window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3701,"title":"Chapter 3701 Li Moying’s Condition (8)","paragraphs":["3701 Li Moying’s Condition (8)","“Please don’t worry, Patriarch Li, this is the most critical moment for the treatment! You must not come in now, otherwise, all previous efforts will be wasted!”","Li Shihong almost couldn’t help but break in at first, but when he heard this, he immediately stopped.","If what Liu Buyan said was true, he could actually make the profound energy in Li Moying’s body react, this was already a sign of an effective treatment!","When other doctors treated Li Moying, it was as if Li Moying had fallen asleep. Not to mention the recoil of his profound strength, they couldn’t even touch the threshold.","This also shows that Liu Buyan’s treatment method was really effective...","But, what if something unexpected had happened inside?","Li Shihong was still not at ease with Liu Buyan, an unfamiliar doctor, but after weighing it for a long time, he decided to wait and see what happened next.","Beside Li Shihong, several of the most important Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan had arrived. Hearing the noise just now, they were also very anxious and wanted to go in to see what happened.","“Patriarch, is this Divine Doctor Liu credible? Healing is one thing, how could there be a crashing sound?”","“Isn’t that so? He wouldn’t be abusing the Young Master inside, right?”","“No, I’m still worried, let’s go in and have a look?”","“He’s nothing more than a folk Spirit Medicine Master. When he comes to our Cloudy Qilin Clan, what other front does he dare to have? We are not allowed to go in and see him while he’s treating the patient?”","Everyone rushed to urge.","However, Li Shihong made up his mind, “Alright, since you have invited someone over, you must believe in the medical skills of Divine Doctor Liu! I don’t believe that someone dares to take action against our Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan in Amethyst Paramount Palace! Unless he doesn’t want to live anymore. I don’t think Divine Doctor Liu is so stupid. I’m afraid that his healing methods are different from that of ordinary people. Don’t be so impatient, please be quiet. If you disturb Divine Doctor Liu and distract him, can you bear the responsibility? ”","After everyone heard this, although there were still people who didn’t trust Liu Buyan, they didn’t dare to say anything more.","Liu Buyan kept pricking up his ears to listen to the movement outside.","After a while, he was relieved to hear the silence outside.","If Li Shihong and the others really broke in just now, he really doesn’t know how to explain the current situation.","It was said to be a treatment, but Huang Yueli had already crawled onto Li Moying’s bed, and the corners of her mouth were still stained with blood.","And Li Moying also fell to one side after being tossed by them just now, his clothes had all been messed up, looking as if he had been abused by them.","This was really hard to explain!","Liu Buyan once again pinched Huang Yueli’s meridians, “Junior Sister, what’s wrong with you? How do you feel now? Is your chest tight?”","Huang Yueli took two deep breaths, and slowly got up from the bed.","“It’s alright, I’m much better... just now I was unprepared, so I was directly attacked by Moying’s evil qi, but my injury isn’t very serious, because our evil qi is from the same source after all, it will not hurt me very much. Ugh, if there is a medicinal pill that warms and nourishes the meridians, two pills should be enough...”","“I do have this! It’s specially prepared for you!”","Liu Buyan quickly took out a bottle of medicinal pill from his bosom, and handed it to Huang Yueli.","Although this was only a heaven ranked medicinal pill, it was refined using the new method Huang Yueli taught him, and the efficacy of the medicine was much better than the original one.","Huang Yueli poured out a few pills and swallowed them in one gulp."]},{"number":3702,"title":"Chapter 3702 The Only Way (1)","paragraphs":["3702 The Only Way (1)","After Huang Yueli swallowed the medicinal pills, she sat cross-legged on the bed without saying a word, and began to adjust her breath.","Liu Buyan kept staring at her worriedly, until he saw that Huang Yueli’s pale face was gradually turning red, and he was slightly relieved.","“Junior Sister, are you feeling better? What else do I need to do?” Liu Buyan asked cautiously.","Although he was a Spirit Medicine Master, the help he could provide at this time was very limited, and he could only follow Huang Yueli’s orders.","!!","Huang Yueli shook her head slowly, “I’m fine, please don’t worry, Senior Brother.”","“Then... we are now...”","Before Liu Buyan’s question was completely finished, Huang Yueli had already stepped in resolutely, “Senior Brother, please return to the position just now, let’s do it again!”","Liu Buyan was startled, then his eyes widened, “What... what? Do it again? Right now?!”","Huang Yueli nodded.","Liu Buyan’s face suddenly changed, “Junior Sister, do you know what you are doing? When you were bounced off just now, I was almost scared to death by you! You even vomited blood! Although you refused to say so, but I’m not a fool, from your pulse just now, obviously the meridian has been damaged! You don’t want to take a good rest and recuperate, so you have to do it again so soon??”","However, Huang Yueli didn’t seem to have heard his worried tone, and said to herself, “I was just careless just now, I didn’t expect the evil qi in Moying’s body to form an energy vortex due to long-term condensation. This time I have experience, I can definitely...”","“It would definitely be a success!”","Liu Buyan frowned, and was so anxious that he couldn’t choose what to say.","He stared at the calm girl in front of him, completely disbelieving the nonsense she said!","“Even if you already have experience, you should rest for one night first, and wait until the damage to your meridians has completely healed before continuing to think of a solution! What are you in such a hurry for?”","Huang Yueli bit her lips, and said in a low voice: “Senior Brother, you don’t understand. Moying’s condition is quite bad now, you don’t know what the doctors who treated him before did to him? The original evil qi was supposed to be evenly distributed in his meridians, but now, for some reason, most of them are forced into his dantian...”","After Liu Buyan heard this, he suddenly understood, and said, “I understand, I also heard people say that some famous doctors invited by the Cloudy Qilin Clan thought that Li Moying’s coma was caused by poisoning. They have also used many methods to force out the poison in his body! Perhaps, this was the reason...”","If Li Moying was really poisoned, then using the method of fighting poison with poison, combined with specific acupuncture techniques, would definitely be able to force out part of the poison.","But the problem is, Li Moying was not poisoned at all!","These powerful potions can only damage his meridians. In this way, the evil qi that could barely be controlled by him can take advantage of the emptiness and rush directly into his dantian!","If it were someone else, and they were tossed like this, they would probably die.","However, Li Moying’s physique was by no means comparable to that of ordinary cultivators.","Because the profound energy in his body was very pure, it was not completely replaced by evil qi, but entangled with evil qi to form an energy vortex.","Huang Yueli was bounced away by this energy just now."]},{"number":3703,"title":"Chapter 3703 The Only Way (2)","paragraphs":["3703 The Only Way (2)","Liu Buyan simply stated his conjecture. Although Huang Yueli was not considered a Spirit Medicine Master, she had some basic medical skills after all. After a little thought, she understood.","“So that’s how it is...then do you have a way to repair the damage in Moying’s meridians?”","Liu Buyan murmured: “There should still be a solution, but now we don’t know what medicine Moying has used, and we need to get a list of the medicinal pill used by the previous doctors from the Patriarch Li first, so that we can find a way to fix this?”","Huang Yueli could only nod her head when she heard the words, and had to admit that Liu Buyan was right.","No matter how urgent she was, she couldn’t do this so casually.","“It seems that the matter of detoxification can only wait until tomorrow! Since this was the case, let’s put this matter aside for now, brother, let’s continue to try again and see if we can let Moying learn the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”. The method of evil qi current circulation...”","Before Huang Yueli finished speaking, Liu Buyan’s expression became more and more ugly.","“Junior Sister, were you listening to me just now? You can’t continue doing such risky things! That’s it for today!”","Huang Yueli shook her head, and said resolutely: “No! As I said, I didn’t suffer any injuries, so I can try again! These energies have been in Moying’s body for too long, it won’t work like this...”","“That’s right, Li Moying can’t do this! But what about you? If you insist on going your own way, is there no problem?”","“Senior Brother, how could I not be clear about my own body?”","“You know crap!” Liu Buyan curled his lips coldly, “I think you lost your head when you encountered something related to Li Moying! You only know how to think about him, and you don’t care about yourself at all. No! No, don’t think that I will cooperate with you!”","Without saying anything, Liu Buyan walked directly towards the door.","“I’ll ask Patriarch Li and the others to come in, and we’ll end here first today...”","“Wait!” Huang Yueli hurriedly stopped him.","“Senior Brother, why don’t you believe me? Let’s try this one last time! I need to understand the situation in Moying’s dantian more clearly, and I can think of a solution when I go back.”","Huang Yueli’s voice was soft, and she clasped her hands together, revealing the eyes of a small animal begging.","Liu Buyan glanced back and couldn’t help breathing.","This little girl usually looks confident and takes the lead in everything. She rarely shows such a look with plea.","It has to be said that she still has a talent for being cute. With such a pitiful little expression, it was really unbearable to refuse any of her requests.","Liu Buyan’s footsteps stopped, he raised his chin, and looked at her from above, “Then...the last time!”","The pitiful expression on Huang Yueli’s face disappeared immediately, and a bright smile appeared, “Senior Brother, I knew you’re the best!”","Liu Buyan: “...”","How does he feel that he just fell into her beauty trap and was deceived!","Was it too late for him to regret it now?","The answer, of course, was too late.","As soon as Liu Buyan finished speaking, Huang Yueli immediately climbed onto Li Moying’s bed again and got into position.","“Alright, hurry up, let’s hurry up. Otherwise, Patriarch Li and the others might not be able to wait!”","Liu Buyan had no choice but to take out the whole set of golden needles again and returned to his position and sat in front of Li Moying."]},{"number":3704,"title":"Chapter 3704 The Only Way (3)","paragraphs":["3704 The Only Way (3)","“Alright, but you have to be careful this time, and if you find something wrong, you have to stop immediately, do you hear me?” Liu Buyan said worriedly.","Huang Yueli naturally nodded obediently and agreed.","Even so, Liu Buyan still doesn’t trust her very much in his heart, but now he could only watch her carefully.","Huang Yueli placed her hand on Li Moying’s back again, circulating the evil qi in her body, gradually imbuing the evil qi into Li Moying’s meridians...","This time, because of previous experience, the start went very smoothly.","It only took Huang Yueli half the time of the last time to successfully let the evil qi in Li Moying’s body circulate through the meridians for a full circle.","Seeing that the evil qi had reached the periphery of Li Moying’s dantian again, Huang Yueli held her breath, pulled herself together, and carefully probed inside.","As soon as the energy vortex composed of evil qi and profound energy sensed the entry of external energy, it immediately rushed over!","Huang Yueli has already thought of a way to deal with it. According to the law of luck recorded in the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, she will increase her own strength little by little, and gradually integrate with these energies.","In the beginning, the two energies collided.","Huang Yueli’s meridians were also slightly damaged, her body couldn’t help trembling, and a trace of blood spilled from the corner of her mouth.","Liu Buyan immediately became nervous, “Junior Sister?”","However, Huang Yueli still closed her eyes tightly, her body remained in the original posture, and she just spat out a word, “Continue!”","Liu Buyan gritted his teeth, wishing he could grab Huang Yueli and force her to stop!","However, he also understood that at this point, it was impossible to stop halfway. He can only choose to believe in Huang Yueli!","Huang Yueli suffered a small setback, but she didn’t take it to heart, and continued to make a second attempt.","This time, she succeeded.","Her evil qi was also wrapped in that energy vortex, and merged with the evil qi in Li Moying’s body.","As time passed, more and more energy in her body entered Li Moying’s dantian, and she could sense the situation in Li Moying’s body more and more clearly.","When she was able to see the whole situation of Li Moying’s dantian, Huang Yueli couldn’t help being surprised!","Because, although she knew that Li Moying had absorbed more evil than her, she never thought that he would absorb so much more than her!","It’s almost twice as much as her body!","Looking back now, when the two of them were attacked by Huang Sanbai and those assassins clad in black, Li Moying rushed out and directly protected her behind him, and he himself withstood most of the attacks!","At that time, his physical condition was weaker than hers, and he had almost no defence. That’s why he was so thoroughly invaded by the evil qi...","Thinking of the situation at that time, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but feel a little sour.","But she calmed down quickly, concentrated her mind, and looked for a way to help Li Moying.","She was immersed in this process, unaware that two full hours had passed in the outside world.","It was already night when Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan entered Li Moying’s room.","Two hours passed, and the sky was already dark.","They stayed in the room for so long, and Li Shihong and others waited outside the door for so long.","Liu Buyan could still clearly hear the sound of pacing back and forth from the door from time to time. It seemed that Li Shihong and the others couldn’t wait any longer and were thinking about when to knock on the door to ask."]},{"number":3705,"title":"Chapter 3705 The Only Way (4)","paragraphs":["3705 The Only Way (4)","After another half an hour, the people outside finally lost their patience.","“Bang bang bang!” There were three knocks on the door.","Immediately after, Li Shihong’s voice came, “Divine Doctor Liu, sorry to bother you! However, it has been almost three hours... How is Moying’s condition? Countless people in the clan are waiting for the results of the diagnosis and treatment. Your Excellency at least give me an explanation, so I can explain it to the clansmen.”","Liu Buyan frowned upon hearing the words, and looked at Huang Yueli and Li Moying on the bamboo bed.","!!","At this time, Huang Yueli couldn’t sense the outside world at all. The perspiration on her forehead kept dripping, her face flushed, and her whole body emitted very strong energy fluctuations.","This overflowing breath made Liu Buyan feel very uncomfortable. It was obviously the manifestation of the evil qi in her body!","And although Li Moying’s face didn’t change much, the aura around him also became very strange.","Such a situation, if Li Shihong and the others see it, half their lives will be scared away! How can he explain it to the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","What’s more serious was that Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s identities as evil cultivators might be exposed!","After Liu Buyan thought about it for a while, he planned to delay it a little longer and prevaricate it.","“Patriarch Li, it’s not very convenient now, please wait a little longer...”","However, before he finished speaking, he heard other Elders’ discussions outside.","“Divine Doctor Liu, what’s going on here, why don’t you tell us?”","“That is, whether everything is going well or not, and what treatment you are doing, you have to give an explanation! You didn’t even let us see the Young Master’s face. What’s going on?”","“It’s been three hours. What’s the diagnosis? It takes so long to diagnose the pulse?”","Liu Buyan’s face darkened, feeling very unhappy.","Although he really did have a secret in his heart this time, that’s why he didn’t dare to let them in, but these so-called Elders are too impolite! How dare you question a doctor’s medical skills like this!","When he was in Soaring Heavens Continent, no one dared to speak to him like this!","Of course, this was also because he was still not well-known in the God Realm, so these Elders dare to yell at him like this.","However, he was not a character who was willing to take offence!","A glint of light flashed by Liu Buyan’s eyes, he was about to teach them a lesson.","But at this moment, Huang Yueli’s voice suddenly came from one end of the bamboo bed, “Senior Brother, don’t argue with them, since they want to come in, let them come in.”","When Liu Buyan heard this voice, he immediately lifted his spirits, and hurriedly turned his head to look over.","At some point, Huang Yueli withdrew her evil qi, and also withdrew her hand from Li Moying’s back.","At this moment, she was wiping the perspiration from her forehead with a silk handkerchief, while arranging her slightly messy clothes.","“Junior Sister, are you... all right?” Liu Buyan was both surprised and delighted.","Finally, Huang Yueli was not bounced away this time, but she withdrew herself. However, her complexion was not very good-looking, and there was even a bit of haggardness as a tinge of dark circles could be seen, which shows the exhaustion.","Liu Buyan said that his eyes fell on Li Moying again, “He...doesn’t have any reaction yet?”","Li Moying was still like a perfect statue, handsome but lifeless.","Huang Yueli shook her head, and said: “If you encounter a little trouble, we’ll talk about it when we get back. Now, let Li Shihong and the others come in first! If you drag on, they’re really going to break in!”"]},{"number":3706,"title":"Chapter 3706 Utterly Shameless (1)","paragraphs":["3706 Utterly Shameless (1)","Liu Buyan was puzzled and wanted to ask further questions.","However, at this time, the knock on the door resounded again.","Huang Yueli also quickly helped Li Moying to lie down on the bed, covered him with a quilt, and nodded to Liu Buyan at the same time.","Liu Buyan knew that he couldn’t procrastinate any further, so he took a deep breath, turned around and opened the door.","!!","“Divine Doctor Liu, you finally opened the door! It took so long to diagnose the pulse, we are really a little worried, if there was any disturbance, please forgive me!”","The people outside the door quickly walked into the room.","As the Patriarch, Li Shihong still held his breath, cupped his hands towards Liu Buyan, and said a few words of apology.","But Li Yuntao and the others behind him didn’t have such patience. They anxiously probed Li Moying’s bamboo bed one by one.","They didn’t let out a breath until they saw Li Moying lying on the bed. Although he was motionless, he didn’t look like he was injured in any way.","Liu Buyan folded his arms around his chest, and said calmly: “You are welcome, Patriarch Li. Young Master Li was the future Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, with a distinguished status, and I am just an ordinary Spirit Medicine Master, so you can rest assured It’s normal. How was it? Have you seen it now? Young Master Li is lying there, with no missing arms or legs. If you are worried, you can lift the quilt and check him from head to toe.”","When Liu Buyan spoke, although his tone was calm and nothing special, as long as anyone with ears could hear it, he was already quite displeased at this moment.","When the Elders heard this, they felt a little guilty. For a while, no one spoke.","They were really anxious outside just now, and on the other hand, they really didn’t pay attention to Liu Buyan, a Spirit Medicine Master with an ordinary background.","Although Liu Buyan claimed to be a collateral lineage of the White Fen Clan, he himself said that his bloodline was already very thin. With such a bloodline, even if he came to the White Fen Clan to recognize his relatives, it would be useless. Naturally, it was impossible. They are on a par with the noble Elders of the ancient gods.","That’s why the Elders had no fear and questioned him with a superior attitude.","But now, facts have proven Liu Buyan’s innocence.","Moreover, it would be a little embarrassing for some things to be pointed out.","The atmosphere froze for a while.","Li Shihong was about to come out to smooth things over, but at this moment, a figure came out from behind Li Yuntao, strode up to Liu Buyan, and said in a bad tone: “This doctor, please be more polite! Where do you think you are? This is the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","When Liu Buyan heard this, he couldn’t help being slightly taken aback.","What he said just now was tricky enough. In his opinion, anyone who was a bit ashamed will feel guilty after hearing it.","So, he never expected that someone would rush out unceremoniously, pointing at his nose and cursing.","He frowned slightly, and looked at the person who came, but found that the other person was a young woman, and she was quite an outstanding beauty. Although she couldn’t compare with his Junior Sister, but after he arrived in the God Realm, among the God Race he had met, she can already be said to be a second to none beauty.","It’s just a pity that she has an outstandingly beautiful face, but her face was full of arrogance. At first glance, she looks like a domineering master."]},{"number":3707,"title":"Chapter 3707 Utterly Shameless (2)","paragraphs":["3707 Utterly Shameless (2)","Liu Buyan frowned and said, “Dare to ask this young lady...”","The woman raised her chin and said coldly: “I am Li Moying’s fiancée! The one lying on the bed was my future husband. I think I have the right to inquire carefully about Brother Moying’s treatment, right?”","“Li Moying’s... fiancée??” The wrinkles between Liu Buyan’s brows deepened.","He subconsciously glanced at Huang Yueli who was sitting in the corner, and when he saw her mocking smile, he immediately understood.","!!","Huang Yueli told him earlier that the Cloudy Qilin Clan arranged a marriage for Li Moying, and she was the niece of the Cloudy Qilin Clan Patriarch!","And this woman was the femme fatale who was at the entrance of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow secret realm and wanted to get rid of Huang Yueli, her rival in love!","After thinking about this, Liu Buyan looked at Li Leyun even colder.","“So you are Young Miss Li! I really didn’t expect that a peerless genius like Young Master Li would be forced to marry such an uneducated woman!”","Li Leyun was in a bad mood at first, but after hearing this, she became even more angry, her brows stood on end, she glared at Liu Buyan, and said angrily, “You... what do you mean? You are just a Spirit Medicine Master with impure blood. That’s all, what right do you have to say irresponsible things to me? And you say I’m not good enough for Brother Moying? Are you blind?”","Li Leyun was extremely aggrieved.","Because, Liu Buyan’s words just hit her sore spot.","Ever since the family arranged this marriage, what she heard the most outside was that she was not worthy of Li Moying!","When they were in Empyrean Fox Continent, those Spiritual Armament Masters and the generals of the Allied Armies headquarters all said this. After returning to the family, the clansmen talked about it in private. Now, even the Spirit Medicine Master who just met today said the same!","What was it that made her unworthy of Li Moying?","Were those people blind? Everyone said that she was not worthy, but they praised the lowly thing Li Moying brought from the Lower Realm to the sky!","Brother Moying...","When Liu Buyan heard this title, he was immediately disgusted, and almost choked to death on his own saliva!","Did he make a mistake? Why was this woman so thick-skinned?","Although she looks like a woman in her early twenties from the Lower Realm, that’s because the cultivators of the Ancient God Clan have good talent, broke through the ninth level early, and can delay the aging of her appearance. In fact, she must be at least thirty, right!","Although in the God Realm, thirty or forty years old was about the same as a minor, but calling Brother Moying...wouldn’t that be too shameless?","Finally, Liu Buyan still remembered that he was on the territory of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so he managed to hold back and didn’t retort.","He turned his head to look at Huang Yueli again, and found that although his Junior Sister’s face was somewhat cold, there was no overly excited reaction.","Liu Buyan felt relieved.","That’s right, this Li Leyun was too low-grade, no wonder his Junior Sister was not worried at all.","Li Moying’s vision was so high, he’d be blind to be able to have such a woman in his sight!","Liu Buyan curled the corners of his mouth coldly, “What qualifications do I have? Just because I am the only one who has the ability to cure Young Master Li now! You are yelling at me like this, because you hope that I will stop curing him. Are you sick? You don’t even care about Young Master Li’s life, you just put on airs here? If Young Master Li really married a woman like you, it’s really his bad luck for eight lifetimes!”"]},{"number":3708,"title":"Chapter 3708 Utterly Shameless (3)","paragraphs":["3708 Utterly Shameless (3)","“You... are utter nonsense!”","When Li Leyun heard this, she almost went crazy!","She glared at Liu Buyan, and said unceremoniously: “Who do you think you are? The only Spirit Medicine Master who can cure Brother Moying? Heh, based on your background and bloodline, even a saint ranked Spirit Medicine Master is better. No, only heaven knows how you won the competition? I think you are here to deceive! There are many Spirit Medicine Masters with better medical skills than you in the world, we don’t need...”","“Shut up! Leyun, what are you talking about? Hurry up and shut up!”","!!","Before Li Leyun finished speaking, Li Shihong sternly stopped her.","“Second Uncle, I’m not mistaken, the surname was Liu...” Li Leyun wanted to say more.","Li Shihong raised his voice, “Don’t say a word more! If you dare to say one more word, you will go to the back mountain and face the wall to think about it!”","It was only then that Li Leyun heard that Li Shihong was really angry, so she could only reluctantly shut her mouth.","Li Shihong hurriedly turned his head to look at Liu Buyan, “Divine Doctor Liu, just now...”","Without waiting for him to speak, Liu Buyan waved his hand towards him and interrupted him, “Patriarch Li, I already understand what your Cloudy Qilin Clan means. I am indeed a unknown little doctor, and I am not worthy to be a doctor for Young Master Li. Since this is the case, I don’t dare to cheekily stay here anymore, I’ll just leave now!”","As he said that, he didn’t forget to wave to Huang Yueli.","“Junior Sister, what are you still doing? Let’s go!”","Huang Yueli immediately stood up obediently, and followed Liu Buyan towards the door.","Li Shihong came back to his senses, and quickly rushed to the door, blocking their way.","“Hey, wait, wait! Divine Doctor Liu, Young Miss Li, don’t rush to leave? Our Cloudy Qilin Clan absolutely has no intention of driving you away! It was just my ignorant niece who’s just talking nonsense, please don’t take it seriously. I’ll ask her to apologise to you two!”","As he said that, he looked at Li Leyun coldly, and ordered sternly: “Leyun, come here quickly, and apologise to Divine Doctor Liu and his Junior Sister!”","Li Leyun didn’t think that she was wrong at all, and her face was full of reluctance. She heard Li Shihong’s order, but her feet still didn’t move at all.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli smiled instead of anger, “Patriarch Li, don’t embarrass Young Miss Li, she comes from a noble family, how can she apologise to inferior people like us? Let’s forget it! Senior Brother, we should leave early as well, this Ancient God Clan is not a place for us to stay!”","Liu Buyan immediately replied: “Junior Sister doesn’t like this place either? Alright, let’s go now!”","He looks like a good Senior Brother who obeys his Junior Sister.","When Li Shihong heard this, he became even more anxious, and urged Li Leyun even more severely, “What are you still doing there? Hurry up and apologise!”","“But...but...” Li Leyun bit her lip, feeling extremely wronged.","She was the dignified daughter of the Ancient God Clan, a heavenly genius, and the fiancée of Li Moying, a god-level genius!","In her capacity, she was just accusing an ordinary Spirit Medicine Master. How big of a deal was it? Even if she made a mistake, then as Liu Buyan and his Junior Sister, they can only listen and ask her to apologise?","In Li Leyun’s eyes, Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli were similar to or even worse than the servants in her yard.","However, Li Shihong and the other Elders are very clear about the priorities of the matter."]},{"number":3709,"title":"Chapter 3709 Utterly Shameless (4)","paragraphs":["3709 Utterly Shameless (4)","Liu Buyan had revealed in his speech just now, “He’s the only person in the world who can cure Li Moying!”","Regardless of whether he was boasting or it was true, at least, he said this after he had given Li Moying a pulse diagnosis.","If it wasn’t for some degree of certainty, it would never be possible to talk like this.","Before Liu Buyan, no Spirit Medicine Master had ever said such a thing.","Based on this alone, they had to let Liu Buyan stay to treat Li Moying. This was their chance to see the most hope!","Therefore, Li Shihong was not the only one who was anxious, other Elders also jumped out one after another, asking Li Leyun to apologise to Liu Buyan immediately.","“Leyun, why are you so ignorant? Divine Doctor Liu wis a real miraculous doctor, so he is naturally a person of status!”","“That’s right, as long as Divine Doctor Liu saves the Young Master, he will be the benefactor of our entire Cloudy Qilin Clan, let alone you, a junior, we can’t disrespect Divine Doctor Liu!”","“Why don’t you hurry up and apologise to Divine Doctor Liu?”","“If Divine Doctor Liu leaves just like that, and the Young Master can’t wake up, can you take this responsibility?”","Li Leyun was criticised unanimously by everyone, even her second uncle Li Shihong, who was usually the most doting to her, was full of anger at this moment, and took the lead in forcing her to bow her head to a Spirit Medicine Master with impure blood.","Li Leyun almost cried with aggrievedness.","At the same time, she felt even more resentful in her heart!","But the current situation does not allow her to continue to be willful. In desperation, Li Leyun could only move in front of Liu Buyan step by step, gritted her teeth hard, and said, “Yes... I’m sorry!”","Liu Buyan glanced at her, “Are you talking to me?”","Li Leyun reluctantly said a word of apology, already feeling very embarrassed. Unexpectedly, Liu Buyan still had such a lukewarm attitude, and was immediately stunned.","But Li Shihong glared at her, “Divine Doctor Liu was asking you something!”","Li Leyun could only say: “Yes... yes... Divine Doctor Liu, what happened today ..I’m very... very sorry...”","Liu Buyan smiled lightly and said, “I really dare not take it seriously! The dignified daughter of the Cloudy Qilin Clan apologises to an ordinary person like me. I’m really afraid that I will lose my life in the future if I accept your apology!”","Li Leyun was so angry that she gritted her teeth. If Li Shihong hadn’t been watching from the side, she would have lost her temper.","Seeing this, Li Shihong hurriedly stood up to smooth things over, “Divine Doctor Liu, how can you be an ordinary person? With your medical skills, you will definitely become a generation of Divine Doctors who are famous in the entire God Realm in the future! Young people are not sensible, so don’t talk to her.” Calculated.”","Liu Buyan sneered in his heart and didn’t answer.","If Li Moying wasn’t his brother, no matter how Li Leyun apologised today, even if Li Shihong personally apologised to him, he wouldn’t be able to stay.","However, this woman Li Leyun was just a clown, and Li Moying’s real wife was watching by his side!","If he really left like this, he would probably be beaten to death by his narrow-minded Junior Sister!","Li Shihong was also one with experience. Seeing Liu Buyan’s appearance, he knew that his attitude had loosened, so he hurriedly said, “Divine Doctor Liu, I see that you and Young Miss Li are also tired. I have already prepared two superior rooms for you...”","Liu Buyan didn’t reply. He just glanced at Li Leyun and said coldly, “This is considered an apology? How about my Junior Sister!”"]},{"number":3710,"title":"Chapter 3710 Utterly Shameless (5)","paragraphs":["3710 Utterly Shameless (5)","“What did you say? Your... Your Junior Sister?”","Hearing this, Li Leyun had a look of disbelief on her face, and stared at Huang Yueli incredulously!","She couldn’t believe what she heard!","She was already reluctant to apologise to Liu Buyan but he still has some blood of the White Fen Clan after all, and he was indeed the person who was most likely to rescue Li Moying.","!!","But, to apologise to Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister? ?","Did he make a mistake? Why should she apologise to that lowly human woman?","Moreover, seeing that woman look so beautiful, she was much younger than her, as delicate as a lotus flower emerging from water. If she had known that Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister was so beautiful, she would never have let this dead girl take a step closer to Li Moying from the very beginning!","Who knows what kind of plan this pair of brothers and sisters are planning?","To cure a disease was to cure the disease, but to bring such a beautiful Junior Sister with him, maybe at that time, he will also want to use the kindness of curing Li Moying to let his Junior Sister marry into a wealthy family in one fell swoop, and hug the thigh of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Filled with such thoughts, Li Leyun’s heart sank, and the anger that had been suppressed with great difficulty rose again.","She stubbornly raised her chin, and instead of apologising to Huang Yueli, she said disapprovingly, “Divine Doctor Liu can treat Elder brother Moying, so I’ll just apologise to him. Hmph, what’s with this mere girl? I don’t care, I didn’t say anything to her, so what is there to apologise for?”","Liu Buyan pursed his lips, his gaze turned cold immediately.","It has to be said that Li Leyun’s intuition was quite accurate sometimes.","Liu Buyan brought Huang Yueli to treat his illness. He really had no good intentions, and the target was indeed the position of the young lady of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","The occasion for Li Leyun’s words was not right. As soon as the words came out, even the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan couldn’t listen anymore.","Li Shihong immediately scolded: “You...you girl! You have been spoiled rotten by your father and I! Why can’t Young Miss Li accept an apology from you? She’s the assistant of Divine Doctor Liu, you questioned Divine Doctor Liu’s medical skills, that also means that you are questioning her! Say sorry to her!”","Actually, Li Shihong also felt that Liu Buyan was making a mountain out of a molehill.","However, at this juncture, no matter what Liu Buyan asked, they could only agree to it, let alone asking Li Leyun to apologise to Huang Yueli for such a trivial matter?","Hearing Li Leyun’s rebuttal, Li Shihong’s first reaction was that his niece was too ignorant!","What situation was this? She still cares about her own face and doesn’t even care about the seriousness!","Li Leyun almost cried out of anger!","She was a dignified daughter of the Ancient God Clan, but now she was not as good as a wild girl of the human race? Still being forced to apologise to her?","However, the situation forced her to bend.","Under the unanimous gaze of many Elders, Li Leyun could only bow her head in the end, and said to Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, I’m sorry, please...please stay and treat Brother Moying...”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli didn’t mean to make things difficult for her, but just smiled lightly, “There’s no need to apologise. However, if the masters of the Cloudy Qilin Clan don’t believe that my Senior Brother and I can cure Young Master Li, Why invite us here? Wait a minute, we have spent a lot of effort, but because you don’t trust us, and you sabotage it halfway, isn’t it a waste of time for us?”","Li Shihong hurriedly said: “Young Miss Li, we are really very sorry about today, and we won’t do it again!”"]},{"number":3711,"title":"Chapter 3711 Utterly Shameless (6)","paragraphs":["3711 Utterly Shameless (6)","“Young Miss Li, why don’t you persuade your Senior Brother? We really didn’t mean to offend you!”","“Isn’t it? We are just impatient...”","“Young Miss Li, seeing how kind-hearted you are, you’d surely won’t stand by and not save our Young Master, right?”","The Elders behind Li Shihong had come to their senses at this time, and they all saw that Liu Buyan’s insistence on asking Li Leyun to apologise to his Junior Sister must have attached great importance to this Junior Sister! Maybe they were a couple!","Since Liu Buyan’s attitude was tough, he might as well work hard on his Junior Sister.","Generally, girls were more soft-hearted. Seeing someone like the unparalleled Young Master lying on the bed was somewhat unbearable, right?","Well, luckily for them, they bet right!","Although Huang Yueli was not a soft-hearted girl, the one who was lying on the bed was her most important husband!","Hearing that the Elders described Li Moying as miserable, she immediately felt distressed, and she couldn’t show her tough attitude anymore.","She looked at Liu Buyan, “Senior Brother...”","Liu Buyan knew what she was thinking, so he could only sigh helplessly: “Forget it, since you are willing to forgive them, then let’s continue seeing Young Master Li.”","A gleam of joy flashed in everyone’s eyes.","However, before they were happy for a while, they heard Liu Buyan continue to say: “But...”","This “but” lifted their hearts into the air again.","Li Shihong hurriedly said: “Divine Doctor Liu, what else do you want? Just say!”","Liu Buyan said: “However, starting from tomorrow, all diagnosis and treatment plans must be in accordance with what I said! I have agreed in advance, when the time comes, you can’t interrupt in the middle, and you can’t even send someone to guard the door! Otherwise, If something goes wrong during the treatment, I will not be held responsible!”","When Li Shihong heard this, his face showed a look of embarrassment, “This... I guarantee that no one will interrupt your treatment midway, but... we will send two people at the door, not because we don’t trust you, but... in case the something is needed in the midst of treatment, you can also order someone, and other doctors are like this...”","“I’m not any other doctor! If there’s anything I need, I’ll let my Junior Sister take care of it.” Liu Buyan said calmly.","Speaking of which, Li Shihong couldn’t object anymore.","He was very worried that if he continued, Liu Buyan would really no longer care, so even if the Elders were worried, they had no choice but to agree to Liu Buyan’s conditions.","After the two parties reached an agreement, Li Shihong sent Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan back to their rooms.","The rooms of the two were next to each other.","Liu Buyan sent Huang Yueli to the door of the room, and said: “Junior Sister, you’ve exhausted yourself too much today, you should take a rest soon! Moying’s condition can’t be too late to study until dawn tomorrow. Did you hear that?” ? You have to take care of your body first, if you fall down too, no one will be able to save him!”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and nodded, “I know what’s in my heart, Senior Brother, don’t worry!”","Liu Buyan was still not at ease, but he had said all that needed to be said, so he could only go back to his room.","Before dawn the next day, the two ran into each other in the courtyard.","Liu Buyan saw Huang Yueli’s face, and immediately turned dark, “Didn’t I tell you to let you take a good rest?”"]},{"number":3712,"title":"Chapter 3712 Forgotten Set Of Skills (1)","paragraphs":["3712 Forgotten Set Of Skills (1)","Huang Yueli appeared in front of him with two giant panda eyes.","The originally fair and tender skin was now sallow, and it looked like she hadn’t slept all night.","Huang Yueli didn’t seem to hear Liu Buyan’s reprimand, as soon as she saw her Senior Brother, she immediately ran over excitedly, “Senior Brother, I thought about it for a long time last night, there is still a way to save Moying! ”","The corners of Liu Buyan’s mouth twitched, “I know that you will definitely find a solution, but this is not a reason for you to stay up all night!”","“...It’s just that this method is a bit troublesome to use, and I need your help, Senior Brother...”","Huang Yueli didn’t listen to his accusation again, and continued to rattle on.","Liu Buyan was out of luck now.","This little girl... As long as Li Moying was involved, she would never listen to anyone’s advice!","Forget it, even her Father can’t control her, what was him, a mere Senior Brother!","However, what should he do if he still feels upset?","Just when he was depressed, Huang Yueli’s voice stopped, and when Liu Buyan came back to his senses, he saw the little girl had already moved in front of him, blinking her big eyes and looking at him expectantly.","Liu Buyan immediately felt all the hairs on his back stand and a bad premonition arose in his heart!","“You, you... what do you want to do?”","Huang Yueli smiled sweetly and said: “Senior Brother, you must help me find a way, this matter can only depend on you!”","“Rely on me?” Liu Buyan frowned. “Of course I will do my best to help you. Isn’t that the purpose of me coming here today? What are your plans? Tell me first!”","Huang Yueli’s face suddenly turned a little red, she bit her lip, with a look of hesitation, and after thinking about it for a long time, she didn’t speak.","Liu Buyan felt even worse.","This little girl was not afraid of anything, and she can’t even talk about it, how dangerous it is! Could it be that she dug a hole and waited for him to jump down?","Liu Buyan asked nervously: “What’s the matter? If you have something to say, hurry up and say it?”","Huang Yueli hesitated for a while, then coughed heavily, and said, “Ahem, this matter... First of all, I have to tell you about the results of my meridian treatment for Moying yesterday...”","“Didn’t you already say it yesterday?” Liu Buyan interrupted her, and asked suspiciously: “The evil qi in Li Moying’s body was too strong, and you, although you have learned the secrets of “Saint Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, the ability to control the evil is stronger than him, but your own cultivation base is two small realms lower than his, which makes you unable to completely control the evil in his body. That was the conclusion you had after you tried yesterday. After trying again, you still had to give up in the end.”","“Am I right? Have you discovered anything new?”","Huang Yueli nodded vigorously, “Senior Brother, you summed it up very well, that’s right! I don’t have anything to add. Because of this situation, I thought about it for a long time last night and thought about it several times. I feel that there must be a way to solve this problem. Just when I was so anxious and almost went crazy, I found a manual that Saint Iniquitous Shadow forced upon me when I left. This may be of great help to Moying’s condition...”","When Liu Buyan heard this, he was immediately pleasantly surprised.","“What? There actually is an even more powerful technique than “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual? Why didn’t you come up with it sooner?”"]},{"number":3713,"title":"Chapter 3713 Forgotten Set Of Skills (2)","paragraphs":["3713 Forgotten Set Of Skills (2)","Huang Yueli hesitated suddenly, “Well, this... I had already forgotten about this! If the situation wasn’t so bad, I wouldn’t want to take it out...”","After hearing these words, Liu Buyan’s brows that had been relaxed just now were wrinkled again.","“What kind of manual is this? Why does it sound so unreliable? Was it really given by Saint Iniquitous Shadow? Will there be any side effects?” He pondered, the more he thought about it, the more worried he became, and he couldn’t help suggesting and said: “If it’s convenient, take out the manual, let’s take a look at them together, if there is danger, it is better to find another way.”","He looked at Huang Yueli, but found that Huang Yueli was still standing there motionless, not intending to share the manual at all.","!!","Liu Buyan was startled, thinking he understood, he clenched his fist and coughed wryly, “It seems that I have said something wrong, the skills imparted to you by Saint Iniquitous Shadow are naturally unique secret manuals, I am not evil cultivator I really shouldn’t ask you casually...”","“Senior Brother, I didn’t mean that...”","Seeing that he had misunderstood, Huang Yueli immediately explained.","She also knew that she couldn’t hide this matter from him, so she gritted her teeth and said, “Actually...actually, this manual in my hand is...a double cultivation manual!”","“What... what?? What manual did you say it was?” Liu Buyan’s jaw almost fell to the ground!","Once Huang Yueli said the words, she felt less embarrassed, so she simply explained seriously.","“As you heard, I have a copy of the dual-cultivation method of Saint Iniquitous Shadow! According to him, this set recorded in the manual is very powerful and can greatly improve the cultivation of both sides, especially for the cultivation of evil cultivators. It reaps twice the result with half the effort!”","Liu Buyan was now sure that he had heard correctly.","All of a sudden, the muscles on his face began to twitch uncontrollably.","He never dreamed that Huang Yueli would actually come up with a double cultivation manual!","What does this mean? Was she planning to double cultivate with Li Moying?","To be honest, even though he no longer had any thoughts about Huang Yueli, hearing such words still made him very upset!","Enough! He really had enough from the two of them! They were endless!","One has been in a coma in bed for several months and hasn’t woken up yet, yet she still is able to somehow display her affection every day! How was this all done? Why were there such crazy people in the world?","Seeing that Liu Buyan’s eyes were blurred, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but frown, “Senior Brother, Senior Brother? What’s wrong with you? Did you hear me talking to you?”","It was only then that Liu Buyan came back to his senses, “Yes... I heard... You said that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow gave you a dual-cultivation technique?”","Huang Yueli nodded, “Yes!”","Liu Buyan calmed down for a while, and thought of something, “By the way, when I was in Soaring Heavens Continent, I heard people say that the wife of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow was also a peerless powerhouse in the Life Profound Realm! It was indeed very rare for a husband and wife to be such masters. At that time, some people speculated whether they had a special method of dual cultivation. Now it seems that it was so...”","When he said this, he suddenly paused, and turned to look at Huang Yueli, with a suspicious blush on his face.","“However... Although I don’t understand this kind of thing, and I haven’t seen this kind of exercise, but I also know that if you want to practice this kind of exercise, you still need both parties together?”"]},{"number":3714,"title":"Chapter 3714 Forgotten Set Of Skills (3)","paragraphs":["3714 Forgotten Set Of Skills (3)","When Liu Buyan said this, although he tried his best to appear calm as usual, in fact, there was still a look of embarrassment on his face.","Why does he, a bachelor who has been around for ten thousand years, want to discuss such an issue with his Junior Sister!","It seems that he was very wretched, alright?","However, since he thought of this, he couldn’t help but say it. Because this matter was related to Li Moying’s condition, there was absolutely no room for mistakes, and any doubts cannot be easily let go.","!!","Otherwise, if something goes wrong, Li Moying’s life would be in danger, and they will be torn apart by the Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, “Senior Brother, you really deserve to be the famous number one playboy in Soaring Heavens Continent, you know a lot! It may be the case for others, but Moying’s situation is different for me , Moying used the soul splitting technique before, and part of his primordial spirit was once in my body. Although he has taken back the primordial spirit, I can still control his consciousness to a certain extent. Otherwise, I would not be able to guide the evil qi in his body.”","When Liu Buyan heard this, he almost vomited blood!","He knows a lot?!","What does he know? Even if he knew a little bit, it was the result of being stuffed with pink bubbles every day...","However, Huang Yueli’s words reminded him of when he was in the Lower Realm, and Liu Buyan’s face revealed a look of surprise, “By the way, it turned out to be like this! If that’s the case, then do you think that relying on this dual cultivation method, how certain are you? Are you sure you can cure him?”","Huang Yueli contemplated for a moment before she said: “It’s definitely not a problem to be cured, but...”","This raised Liu Buyan’s curiosity, “But what?”","“However, I’m not sure how long it will take.” Huang Yueli frowned.","When Liu Buyan heard this meaning, he immediately breathed a sigh of relief, and at the same time, he did not forget to give Huang Yueli a glare, “You almost scared me to death, I thought there is something wrong with this! It’s just a matter of time, so what’s the matter? Worried?”","Huang Yueli said: “The problem of time is the biggest problem! If I want to practise this exercise with Moying, then you have to avoid it? But would it be reasonable that you, the majestic Divine Doctor Liu, are alone outside, and leave your Junior Sister to treat Young Master Li alone inside? You have to think of a way.”","Liu Buyan was taken aback for a moment.","He didn’t think of this question at all!","However, after Huang Yueli’s reminder, he immediately realised that this was not only a problem, but also a very serious problem!","This was not the Blue Profound Sect, but the territory of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","If he was found wandering around the door, people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan would definitely find out sooner or later.","However, it was impossible for him to stay in the room...","“Then...then what should I do?” Liu Buyan looked confused.","Huang Yueli said helplessly: “I came to you because I wanted you to think of a way? How about we make up some reason...”","While the two were still discussing here, they heard eager footsteps coming from the door.","Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan were very vigilant, they immediately closed their mouths and turned to look at the person who came.","They saw two maids appearing at the gate of the courtyard and saluted them, “Divine Doctor Liu, Young Miss Li, you’ve woken up so early?”","Liu Buyan nodded slightly, “What’s the matter?”","The maid said respectfully: “The Patriarch is waiting in the back mountain, please come over and have breakfast together!”"]},{"number":3715,"title":"Chapter 3715 Forgotten Set Of Skills (4)","paragraphs":["3715 Forgotten Set Of Skills (4)","Hearing this, Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan looked at each other with a bit of helplessness in their eyes.","As long as one wasn’t a fool, they could tell that Li Shihong’s invitation to them to have a meal was only secondary, the key was that he was anxious for them to treat Li Moying, so he sent someone to remind him early in the morning, it was nothing more than tactful words.","Since the two maids were here, there was no way for them to carry on their discussion.","In desperation, the two had no choice but to go back to their rooms, change their clothes, and follow the two maids to the back mountain.","While the maids were not paying attention, Liu Buyan sneaked closer to Huang Yueli, and asked in a low voice, “Junior Sister, what should I do now? Have you thought of any ideas yet?”","Huang Yueli shook her head slightly, “No, it seems that we can only take one step at a time and play by ear.”","Liu Buyan frowned, and wanted to say something more, but the two maids leading the way in front had already turned their heads and looked at them curiously.","“Divine Doctor Liu, Young Miss Li, please follow us closely! There are dozens of ancient arrays arranged in the back mountain of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and the paths are very complicated. If you don’t have the bloodline of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, you will definitely get lost.”","Huang Yueli quickly responded by following them closely.","She also saw that these two maids were not lying. The array here was indeed very unusual. With her attainments in array, she couldn’t recognize the road they walked yesterday at all.","If she doesn’t follow closely,she might really get lost here.","The two of them had nothing to say all the way. When they arrived at a small pavilion with elegant scenery, Li Shihong had already prepared a hearty breakfast and sat there waiting for them.","In front of Li Shihong, the two naturally had nothing to say.","Fortunately, the breakfast prepared by the Cloudy Qilin Clan was very good. Huang Yueli ate it with great relish. While eating, she also asked Li Shihong how these dishes were made.","Li Shihong was able to answer one or two questions at first, but when Huang Yueli asked in detail, he was stunned, so he had to find the chef to come over and answer Huang Yueli himself.","Seeing that Huang Yueli was having a good talk with the chef, Li Shihong turned to Liu Buyan with a smile, “Divine Doctor Liu, your Junior Sister is not only beautiful, but also has good medical skills. What’s more rare is that she is also very virtuous and proficient in cooking! It is really a blessing to marry her!”","Liu Buyan hooked the corners of his mouth, and said meaningfully: “Patriarch Li also thinks so?”","Li Shihong didn’t know what he meant. He had already misunderstood the relationship between Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli. Hearing Liu Buyan’s question, in order to win over this Divine Doctor, he naturally followed him, “Of course! Facing such a good girl, only the most outstanding young talents in the God Realm can match her! When Young Miss Li gets married in the future, I will definitely give you a big gift!”","Liu Buyan chuckled, “Then I’ll thank the Patriarch for my Junior Sister first!”","Seeing him happy, Li Shihong also twirled his beard and laughed, feeling that he had observed the details and found the right way to win over Liu Buyan.","At such a young age, Liu Buyan became a Spirit Medicine Master with superb medical skills. Maybe he didn’t care if he was given money and fame, but young people always care most about the girl they like. Complimenting his Junior Sister was the most economical thing. A way to save effort.","As everyone knows, Liu Buyan almost couldn’t help laughing out loud at this moment!","He really couldn’t wait to see on the day Huang Yueli really gets married, if Li Shihong can still laugh!"]},{"number":3716,"title":"Chapter 3716 Forgotten Set Of Skills (5)","paragraphs":["3716 Forgotten Set Of Skills (5)","Huang Yueli had been talking to the chef the entire time, so she didn’t notice the conversation between the two of them, until Liu Buyan’s laughter reached her, and she looked over suspiciously.","“Senior Brother, what are you talking about?”","Liu Buyan raised his teacup, blocking the smile on his lips, “I’m not laughing at anything. Junior Sister, you’ve asked so many recipes, have you learned all of them?”","Although Huang Yueli felt a little strange, she didn’t take it to heart.","!!","Liu Buyan was completely different from Li Moying’s stern personality, who doesn’t get close to strangers. As long as one doesn’t offend him, he will definitely act like a romantic nobleman, and he can chat with anyone. It’s not surprising to be able to chat and laugh with Li Shihong.","She smiled and said, “I didn’t learn everything, but I still remembered a few, such as this crystal dumpling, this plum cake...”","She pointed them out one by one, as her gaze became gentle.","Li Shihong also laughed when he heard that, “Young Miss Li’s taste is very similar to Moying’s. He likes these dim sum the most.”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and smiled, “That’s really a coincidence!”","She didn’t think about choosing Li Moying’s favourite dishes to learn, but it was based purely on her own preferences, but maybe because the two of them have been together for a long time, their tastes have become very similar, so she picked out these dishes. These dishes were exactly the same as Li Moying’s favourites.","However, Li Shihong didn’t think much of it at all, thinking it was really a coincidence!","After the three chatted for a few more words, Li Shihong gradually became restless.","Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli exchanged glances, knowing very well that Li Shihong couldn’t wait to urge them to treat Li Moying, but he didn’t know how to speak so as not to appear rude.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli took the initiative to say: “Senior Brother, we’ve almost finished eating, shouldn’t it be time to check on Young Master Li’s situation?”","Liu Buyan naturally listened to his Junior Sister’s instructions, and immediately responded, “Exactly, we came up with a rough treatment plan after discussing it for most of the night yesterday, and we have to try it today.”","When Li Shihong heard it, the two of them actually worked so hard!","When I went back in the middle of the night yesterday, I didn’t rest right away, but was still discussing Li Moying’s condition, and he was immediately very moved.","He said a few more polite words before personally sending the two of them to Li Moying’s room.","After Li Shihong left, the two were about to enter the house.","But when she reached the door, Huang Yueli’s footsteps suddenly stopped.","“Who is it?” Huang Yueli’s gaze suddenly became cold, and she swept to a hidden corner outside the courtyard gate, “Come out for me!”","Liu Buyan’s cultivation was far worse than hers, and she didn’t feel any abnormality at all.","When he was astonished, he saw two figures appearing in the shadow of the corner.","Both of them were dressed as guards, and when they realised that their whereabouts had been spotted, they both seemed a little flustered.","However, they quickly calmed down and came forward to salute, “Divine Doctor Liu, Young Miss Li, subordinates greets you both.”","Liu Buyan recalled it at this moment, frowned, and said, “Who sent you here? Didn’t I say yesterday that no one was allowed to approach this room within a radius of ten miles during my visit? ”","“This...” The two hesitated for a moment before replying, “This subordinate was following the orders of several Elders...”","“Several Elders’ order?” Huang Yueli sneered."]},{"number":3717,"title":"Chapter 3717 Forgotten Set Of Skills (6)","paragraphs":["3717 Forgotten Set Of Skills (6)","“The person who agreed to our conditions was your Patriarch! In the end, the Elders actually acted in such a manner and sent someone behind Patriarch Li’s back? Everyone said that a big clan like the Cloudy Qilin Clan has strict rules and regulations. I didn’t expect it to be nothing more than that!”","Huang Yueli deliberately spoke heavily, and cold sweat broke out on the foreheads of the two guards.","For an Ancient God Clan like them, there was nothing more important than family reputation.","For a moment, neither of them knew how to answer.","!!","Liu Buyan snorted coldly, “What are you still doing here? Why don’t you hurry up and get out of here! You must be satisfied if I go to the Patriarch Li and make it clear that I will stop treating Li Moying?”","“No, no, no... Divine Doctor Liu, please calm down! Don’t go to the Patriarch, our Young Master was still waiting for your treatment!” Upon hearing this, the heads of the two guards shook like rattles.","“That’s right, Divine Doctor Liu, we know we’re wrong, so we’re leaving! We’re leaving immediately!”","The two of them were obviously frightened by this threat. They didn’t dare to make any more excuses, and immediately turned around and ran away. The speed was like a tiger chasing after them!","Liu Buyan frowned, and looked at Huang Yueli beside him, “Junior Sister, it’s really thanks to your strong spiritual sense! Otherwise, we would be in big trouble today!”","Huang Yueli shook her head slightly, “This was the territory of the ancient gods. If we are not careful, we will not know how we died! Fortunately, Patriarch Li is a gentleman who keeps his word, he does what he says and he didn’t make any sneaky moves here. What kind of tricks, otherwise, even if he doesn’t send someone over, there is nothing he can do if he wants to know our every move.”","When Liu Buyan heard this, he became even more worried.","“Junior Sister, then quickly check, is there anyone else watching us around here?”","Huang Yueli calmed down and spread her spiritual consciousness to a ten-mile radius.","After her divine consciousness was combined with the Sky Phoenix Ring, she experienced the baptism of evil qi, and her sensitivity was even far surpassed by many experts in the Dao Profound Realm.","After a while, she shook her head, “There should be no one else.”","Seeing that Liu Buyan was still worried, she added: “Senior Brother, you don’t have to worry too much. Generally speaking, without Li Shihong’s order, other clan members would not dare to spy on the residence of the Young Master of the clan easily. Those two people should be just a special case.”","Liu Buyan’s frowning brows relaxed a little, but there was still doubt in his eyes, “Special case? What do you mean? Aren’t these two guards sent by the Elders?”","Huang Yueli slightly lowered her eyelids, her long eyelashes drooping down, covering the light in her eyes.","“It’s hard to say. For a big family like the Cloudy Qilin Clan, the internal relationship is intricate, and outsiders like us can’t guess it. It seems that we really need to be extra cautious in the diagnosis and treatment this time...”","As she spoke, she greeted Liu Buyan, “Let’s go in and see Moying first.”","Liu Buyan nodded, and walked into the room with her.","In the quiet room, there was a touch of calming incense. The fragrance was light and dense, which made people feel refreshed.","Liu Buyan sighed, “It’s really worthy of the ancient gods! This tranquilizing incense was made from the dew on the scales of real ancient dragons, which was enough to heal most internal injuries. The reason why Patriarch Li can afford such rare spices is to let Li Moying, sleep well? Tsk tsk, this brat is really lucky!”","Wherever he goes, he was a winner in life!"]},{"number":3718,"title":"Chapter 3718 Bashful Matter (1)","paragraphs":["3718 Bashful Matter (1)","It’s not like him, when he first arrived in the God Realm, he was so miserable!","And not long after Li Moying came here, he became the Young Master of the Ancient God Clan, a peerless genius second to none in the God Realm. This gap... was really too big!","After hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help raising her eyebrows.","Speaking of which, Li Moying’s luck was really much better than hers.","!!","Although she too was the same and was a god-level talent, after she arrived in the God Realm, nothing had been smooth. She even has her own clan yet she could not return. She had to avoid Huang Sanbai’s pursuit everywhere.","Li Moying was different. When he was alone, everything went smoothly. Yet every time he was unlucky, he was with her...","“Junior Sister, Junior Sister, what’s wrong with you?” Liu Buyan’s cry rang in her ears.","Huang Yueli suddenly came back to her senses, and shook her head, “It’s alright, I’m just a little distracted.”","As she spoke, she walked to Li Moying’s bedside.","On the bamboo bed, Li Moying was still lying flat, looking as if he was asleep, no different from when they saw him yesterday.","Huang Yueli’s slender fingers brushed across the bridge of Li Moying’s nose, her gaze fixed deeply on his face.","After a while, she finally said, “Senior Brother, it seems that there is no other way.”","Liu Buyan nodded upon hearing the words, “Then I’ll go out and avoid it for a while. I’ll come back here in the evening...”","As he spoke, he turned around and was about to go out.","Huang Yueli stopped him from behind, “Wait, Senior Brother, where are you planning to hang out for so long?”","Liu Buyan paused, “This... I haven’t thought about it yet. However, Patriarch Li has promised us just now that he will not send anyone within a radius of ten miles from this hut. If he can really keep his promise, then as long as I don’t leave the vicinity as much as possible, we should be fine.”","Huang Yueli was not as at ease as he was.","She frowned, “What Patriarch Li said should be fine, but I’m worried that there are guards like just now, spying on us...”","“Then what should we do?” Liu Buyan hesitated.","Huang Yueli thought for a while, and suddenly her eyes lit up, “Yes!”","She made a move with her right hand, and after a golden light flashed, a little Phoenix with golden-red feathers appeared in the room.","As soon as Huang Yueli saw the shining feathers on it, she hurriedly shouted: “Wait, Little Wang Cai, you can’t appear here like this, quickly transform into a human form! Hurry up!”","Under her repeated urging, the Little Phoenix, which was still flapping its wings and didn’t stop, suddenly swayed, and when it reappeared, it turned into a little boy.","He was obviously frightened by Huang Yueli’s nervous urging voice, and thought that something serious had happened, so he was looking left and right nervously, observing the surrounding situation with a look of shock on his face.","After he saw clearly that there was no danger around him, a look of irritation appeared on his chubby face.","“Female Devil, why are you making such a fuss? You scared me to death! Huh? Isn’t that the Great Demon King? You finally found the Great Demon King?”","He stretched his neck and looked towards Li Moying who was on the bed.","Huang Yueli said: “That’s right, we found Li Moying, so now we are on the territory of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","After hearing this, Little Wang Cai’s face froze, “Ah? This is... this was the place of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? No... no wonder I feel so uncomfortable... I am not acclimatised, I feel dizzy and have a stomachache. I’m going to pass out...”"]},{"number":3719,"title":"Chapter 3719 Bashful Matter (2)","paragraphs":["3719 Bashful Matter (2)","As Little Wang Cai was talking, he really rolled his eyes and fell backwards.","Huang Yueli was speechless for a while, reached out and grabbed the collar behind his back, and lifted him up.","“All right, all right, how can it be so serious? Although the thunder attribute energy here is indeed a bit stronger, there has never been any evidence that a majestic ancient Phoenix would be allergic to thunder attribute energy, and would faint because of it!”","Little Wang Cai was picked up, his face was ruddy, and he looked extremely healthy, but his eyes were still tightly closed, and he muttered, “Who says Phoenix would not be allergic to thunder attributes? Well, I am! Ah! Female Devil, this is the territory of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! You don’t want to live anymore, let’s run away!”","!!","Huang Yueli put him on the chair, dumbfounded, and said seriously: “Alright, don’t make trouble on purpose. We came here to save Moying’s life, and we can’t leave until he wakes up! Now I have a task for you, you take my Senior Brother to walk around, not more than ten miles around! Once you find someone watching us nearby, you should remind Senior Brother in time, do you understand?”","Only then did Little Phoenix open his eyes, his face full of bewilderment.","“Why? If you want to save the Great Demon King, isn’t Liu Buyan a Spirit Medicine Master? Why did you tell him to go outside? Also, why do we have to hang around outside? This is a place deep within the Cloudy Qilin Clan! It’s very dangerous! If I’m caught by them, all my feathers will be plucked and I’ll be made into stewed chicken in minutes!”","The corners of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched again, she was very speechless about Little Wang Cai’s strange thoughts.","She said patiently: “That’s why I told you not to go out within a radius of ten miles! It should be safe around here, but once you go far, you will be easily spotted by the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. My Senior Brother’s spiritual sense is not strong enough, and he needs your help. Well, it’s getting late, you two go now! Little Wang Cai, you must remember to listen to Uncle Liu!”","Little Wang Cai still had a confused expression on his face.","Actually, whether he understood what Huang Yueli said, his heart was full of doubts.","“Wait! Female Devil, you haven’t answered me yet! Why did you drive the two of us out for medical treatment? What are you two trying to do in the room...”","Little Wang Cai was still asking questions, but didn’t notice that Huang Yueli’s face had darkened.","Liu Buyan has been observing the expression of his Junior Sister.","Seeing her unkind expression, he was afraid that Little Wang Cai would be beaten, so he quickly lifted the little brat’s collar and dragged him out.","“Junior Sister, let’s go now! Don’t worry, I have no other advantages, but I am cautious enough, so there will be no problem Young! Little Wang Cai and I will watch out for you!”","The door slammed shut.","Little Wang Cai was still yelling, “Uncle Liu, let me down! What on earth is the Female Devil trying to do? She actually put a noble Phoenix like me on the territory of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! No, I will definitely be killed if I’m caught! I want to go back!”","“Alright, stop yelling. If you offend my Junior Sister, she will beat your ass, and I won’t be able to save you!” Liu Buyan looked at Little Wang Cai with a headache.","To be honest, he still kind of understands why Huang Yueli always wants to beat people up!","Because this little guy was really too abominable!","And every time it comes out, there are 100,000 questions to ask, which can really make people collapse."]},{"number":3720,"title":"Chapter 3720 Bashful Matter (3)","paragraphs":["3720 Bashful Matter (3)","“Why did the Female Devil beat me? I...I just want to go back to the Sky Phoenix Ring and hide! Female Devil, open the door, open the door quickly! What are you doing inside?”","Little Wang Cai yelled again, Liu Buyan hastily covered his mouth and took it aside.","“Children should not ask about adult matters!”","“What sort of adult matters?” Little Wang Cai asked suspiciously.","!!","But immediately, his eyeballs rolled, “Oh, I understand! The Female Devil and the Big Demon Lord are going to do shameful things in there, right?”","“Cough cough... cough cough cough cough...”","Hearing this, Liu Buyan was almost choked to death by his own saliva, and coughed several times in succession, but couldn’t stop.","“I said... you little brat, how do you know something shameful? Don’t talk nonsense...”","Little Wang Cai raised his chin and looked at him with disdainful eyes, “Why don’t I know? I’m an ancient holy beast who knows everything! Besides, the Big Demon Lord used to kiss the Female Devil indiscriminately. I hid in the Sky Phoenix Ring saw it! Hmph! They are a pair of villains who only care about themselves and don’t care about children!”","Liu Buyan looked up at the sky, feeling speechless for a while, not knowing what to say.","Originally, when he saw Huang Yueli’s Phoenix a few days ago, he was still envious of his Junior Sister, and thought that if he could get a baby of an ancient divine beast to raise, it would definitely be a great help in the future.","As a result, he only realised the reality now.","The ancient mythical beasts are not the same as ordinary spirit beasts. In terms of intelligence, they are not inferior to the human race, and their personalities are particularly eccentric. If there was a brat like Little Wang Cai, he would not be able to handle it!","Fortunately, Little Wang Cai calmed down a lot after knowing what they were doing in the room.","Liu Buyan took out a handful of sugar pills and gave him, “Little Wang Cai, do you want to eat sugar? These are not ordinary sugar pills. They are made with more than a dozen kinds of medicinal materials. They are not only delicious, but also can improve your cultivation.”","Seeing the delicious food, Little Wang Cai’s little face was stunned, and then he pursed his lips, “You want to bribe me with just a bottle of sugar pills? If you have the ability, you can roast chicken legs for me!”","“Roasted chicken legs?” Liu Buyan was startled, and then said, “No problem!”","As a Spirit Medicine Master, his cooking skills are also very good, because like what Huang Yueli said, cooking was also an application of the art of controlling fire, and it was impossible for craftsmen like them who rely on fire in their profession.","Here, Liu Buyan finally managed to coax the little brat.","In the room, Huang Yueli was sitting beside Li Moying’s bed.","On her right hand, there was an ancient book with yellowed paper.","Huang Yueli’s big, watery eyes kept scanning the page. As she watched, a blush appeared on her cheeks, and this blush was about to expand rapidly.","“Yes... Did I make a mistake? The secret book of double cultivation that Master gave me, really... is it really not wrong? This... This is too... too outrageous!”","Huang Yueli felt that her cheeks were so hot that they were about to burn!","Fortunately, Li Moying was now in a coma, and he can’t see her current expression at all, nor can he see this... Double Cultivation Secret Manual beside her...","Although she knew that this classic book was about that kind of thing, Huang Yueli was already mentally prepared.","But the moment she opened it, she still felt shocked!"]},{"number":3721,"title":"Chapter 3721 Bashful Matter (4)","paragraphs":["3721 Bashful Matter (4)","Because, the content recorded on it has exceeded her imagination! It was completely different from her previous cognition.","To achieve the effect that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow said, more than a dozen new poses need to be unlocked, all of which she had never thought of before!","“I’ll go... this was alright? And that... what was that?”","“No, no, no! How could it be like this? Is this really for cultivation??”","!!","Huang Yueli seriously felt that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow was simply tricking her! Li Moying had spent a lot of time before trying to find out this secret book of double cultivation. If he knew that the content on it was so tricky, he probably wouldn’t be so persistent!","Huang Yueli turned a few pages back. The further she went, the more she couldn’t believe the content.","In the end, she couldn’t help but toss the book in her hand aside.","“No, this is too unreliable! I don’t want to practise such a technique!”","She grunted, and was about to stand up from the bed.","But at this moment, out of the corner of her eye, she saw Li Moying lying on the bed.","The peerless genius who was once so powerful, domineering, and incomparable was now lying quietly beside her, breathing lightly and weakly, like a perfect doll.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but pause when she got up.","This double cultivation secret manual...was their last hope.","If she wants to wake up Li Moying as soon as possible, then her best choice was to immediately find a way to cultivate with Li Moying.","However...","Huang Yueli’s eyes once again fell on the secret manual of double cultivation.","Thinking of the above content, her little face involuntarily turned red again, and her white teeth bit her lower lips until it almost bled.","However, after hesitating for a long time, she still bent down and picked up the secret manual that she had swept to the ground.","In order for Li Moying to live well, she would even give up her own life without hesitation, let alone such a small sacrifice?","Besides, they’re already married, even... even if it’s a bit difficult for dual cultivation, then... it’s not really a sacrifice, was it?","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli glanced at the contents of the secret manual for the last time, then, gritted her teeth, raised her hand and lifted Li Moying’s quilt!","...","A side hall on the east side of Amethyst Paramount Palace.","In the corridor, two young cultivators dressed as guards hurried past and stopped at the entrance of the main room.","“This subordinate asks to see Young Miss Leyun.”","“Come in!”","Hearing a woman’s voice in the room, the two guards lowered their heads and walked in cautiously.","“Young Miss Leyun...”","They didn’t even have time to say hello, when they heard a harsh reprimand, “Why are you two here? Didn’t I send you to Brother Moying to keep an eye on the every move of that couple of dogs? Brother Moying’s illness has not been cured yet, who allowed you to come back?”","The two guards were shocked and bent even lower.","“Young...Miss, please calm down! We...we hid well at first, but who knows, that Young Miss Li discovered our hiding place...”","“Divine Doctor Liu was very angry when he saw us, and said that if we don’t leave, he will tell the Patriarch. This... we can only leave...”","“Hmph, you’re all trash!”","Hearing this, Li Leyun roared angrily!"]},{"number":3722,"title":"Chapter 3722 What Are They Doing? (1)","paragraphs":["3722 What Are They Doing? (1)","The two guards lowered their heads and dared not speak any more.","Li Leyun took a few deep breaths, and finally calmed down a little. Her gaze coldly scanned the two young cultivates in front of her.","“Don’t you two know how to use your brains? Liu Buyan drove you back, and you really came back? You didn’t get any information, and you don’t know how to think of other ways?”","The two guards have relatively straightforward personalities. After hearing this, they still can’t recall, “It’s...Young Miss Leyun, it’s not that we didn’t think about it, but...if Divine Doctor Liu really went to tell the Patriarch, then what should we do?”","Li Leyun was really speechless when she heard the words of these two blockheads, but she knew that anger was useless, so she could only speak more clearly by herself.","“If Liu Buyan really intends to file a complaint, he can file a complaint when you come back! Now he must be in Brother Moying’s room, how can he go to my uncle’s when he is busy? You don’t know how to pretend to leave and turn back, continue to inquire about news?”","“Ah...it’s still possible!”","The two guards suddenly realised, and then they all showed shame.","Li Leyun narrowed her eyes and waved her hand, “Alright, don’t be stupid in front of me, you look upset! Hurry up and go to Brother Moying to find out if Liu Buyan and his Junior Sister are in the room. What are you doing here? I don’t believe they are treating Brother Moying properly! There must be something wrong with the two of them!”","When Li Leyun said this, Huang Yueli’s disguised face flashed in her mind.","She didn’t know why, she should have never met Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister but when she met the bright watery eyes of her’s, she felt a familiar sense of threat for no reason, which made her feel a sense of crisis deep in her heart!","It’s like the feeling she had when she met that wife of Li Moying!","Obviously, this Junior Sister of Liu Buyan, like that bitch, is someone who has ambitions for Li Moying!","Li Leyun decided based on her female intuition that this was definitely the case. No matter how well they disguised themselves, they couldn’t hide it from her eyes!","If Huang Yueli knew what was going on in her heart, she probably couldn’t help but applaud her!","Although Li Leyun was not very good in other aspects, her intuition was quite accurate.","...","Outside Li Moying’s hut, Liu Buyan and Little Wang Cai were roasting chicken legs by the pond in the yard.","Liu Buyan originally wanted to persuade Little Phoenix not to eat it, because he didn’t know where to get chicken legs at all.","But who knows, Little Wang Cai took out a lot by himself, at least twenty or so, and Liu Buyan was dumbfounded when he saw it.","“This...these chicken legs...where did they come from?”","Looking at the raw chicken legs, Little Wang Cai couldn’t help swallowing his saliva, and replied casually: “The female devil bought it for me, but she usually doesn’t allow me to eat more, so I locked it in the cabinet. This time, while she was not paying attention, I’ve only managed to steal so much!”","Liu Buyan was speechless for a while, wiped the sweat off his forehead, and said, “Since Junior Sister won’t let you eat, I think it’s better to forget it...”","“You don’t mean what you say! Didn’t you agree to roast chicken legs for me? Boo hoo, you’re a liar, you’re a big villain! If you don’t roast chicken legs for me, I’ll complain to the Female Devil!”","As Little Phoenix said, he jumped up from the ground and was about to rush out of the door.","Liu Buyan’s expression changed, and he quickly grabbed him."]},{"number":3723,"title":"Chapter 3723 What Are They Doing?(2)","paragraphs":["3723 What Are They Doing?(2)","“Wait, come back! Children shouldn’t run around on their own, do you hear me?” Liu Buyan warned him anxiously.","The ostensible reason why his Junior Sister handed over this brat to him was to ask Little Wang Cai to help him investigate the surrounding situation, but Liu Buyan knew very well that there was another reason, that he didn’t want this little thing to affect her and Li Moying.","Since this was the case, he had to help his Junior Sister look after him.","Heaven knows what Huang Yueli and Li Moying are doing in the room now.","!!","If Little Wang Cai rushed in and interrupted them, he would still be able to gloat about his misfortune in normal times, but now was a critical moment. If Li Moying’s condition relapses, everyone will be in trouble.","Thinking of this, Liu Buyan could only press down on his desire to educate the little Brat, and chose to give in.","“Alright, alright, I’ll roast chicken legs for you, can’t I bake them for you? Sit down obediently! If you don’t behave well, I won’t cook them for you!”","Only then did Little Wang Cai stop in his tracks, and sat down on the stone bench, “Let me tell you first, if your skills are not good, don’t even try to ask this Lord to work in the future!”","The corners of Liu Buyan’s mouth twitched.","Whose brat was this, he really wanted to beat him up! Still calling himself ‘Lord’!","He doesn’t even have full hair yet, how dare he call himself ‘Lord’?","However, for the sake of his Junior Sister’s big plan, Liu Buyan could only pretend not to hear, took out the meat cleaver and flint he used in his training from his space, took out a few bottles of honey and sauce, and started to grill the chicken legs.","It has to be said that Liu Buyan’s craftsmanship was indeed at a master’s level.","Not long after, the aroma of barbecue began to waft from the sky above the small courtyard.","Little Wang Cai stared at the drumstick in his hand without blinking. His eyes were so straight that he didn’t even notice that his own saliva was dripping down the corner of his mouth.","Seeing him salivating like this, Liu Buyan was finally a little satisfied.","He deliberately said, “How was it? Uncle Liu’s craftsmanship is not too bad, right? Your saliva is dripping!”","Only then did Little Wang Cai come back to his senses, and subconsciously wiped the corners of his mouth with his hand, only to find that his hands were indeed wet, and a blush of embarrassment immediately appeared on his chubby little face.","However, his mouth was still very stubborn, “It’s... just so-so! It’s far inferior to the Female Devil!”","Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows, “Tsk tsk, since you dislike my poor craftsmanship, then stop eating it!”","With that said, he retracted his hand and was about to take the chicken leg away.","When Little Phoenix saw it, he became impatient, and immediately threw his whole body over, hugged Liu Buyan’s arm, snatched the chicken leg, and stuffed it into his mouth.","“I... I’ve already bitten it... This is mine!”","While gnawing on the chicken leg, he spoke vaguely.","The two were so busy bickering that they didn’t notice that in the woods not far away, two guards went back and forth, approaching Li Moying’s hut sneakily.","The two guards could smell the smell of barbecue in the air from a long distance away, and they couldn’t help being attracted, and secretly swallowed their saliva.","“This... what kind of smell is this?”","“It smells like... like someone is roasting chicken legs?”","“Impossible? Didn’t Divine Doctor Liu and the others come to treat the Young Master? How could it be possible to barbecue here?”","“This...how do I know this? But, I will definitely not smell it wrong!”","The two guards looked at each other, and walked towards Liu Buyan under the cover of the"]},{"number":3724,"title":"Chapter 3724 What Are They Doing?(3)","paragraphs":["3724 What Are They Doing?(3)","Since they were still relatively far away, they could only vaguely judge from the sound that it was a young man and a child having a barbecue, but they couldn’t hear their conversation clearly.","One of the guards stopped and grabbed the accomplice beside him.","“Wait!”","The other person looked at him suspiciously, “What’s wrong?”","!!","“Forget it, let’s not go there!”","“Why don’t you go there? Someone dares to do this kind of thing outside the Young Master’s yard! No matter whether this person is Divine Doctor Liu or not, it was an insult to our Cloudy Qilin Clan! We have to find out the situation quickly and go back and report to Young Miss Leyun!”","The person in front glared at him, “No, Young Miss Leyun sent us here to investigate the situation of Divine Doctor Liu treating the Young Master, not to meddle in such nosy matters! We can’t take care of things here, we should go to the hut first. Let’s do the things that Young Miss Leyun explained first, and then go to see it when we go back.”","When the accomplice heard it, he felt it made sense and nodded.","The two gradually moved away from Liu Buyan and the others, deliberately took a long detour and headed towards Li Moying’s room.","It can be said that these two guards were really very lucky.","At this time, Little Phoenix was completely focused on his chicken legs, and he couldn’t care about other things at all, while Liu Buyan was still somewhat vigilant, but his cultivation base was only so small, compared with these Cloudy Qilin Clan guards, it was nothing , the actual combat level was not even comparable to others, so naturally it was even more impossible to find the whereabouts of the two.","The two guards approached all the way, and they were two hundred metres away from the door of Li Moying’s bedroom, when they heard a strange sound coming from the room.","“Wait... wait! You... did you hear the voice in the room?”","“Well, I heard a little, a man’s voice, and... and a woman’s voice...”","“Strange, this sound was too strange! This... this panting sound... why does it sound like...”","The two guards looked at each other, and they both saw the look of surprise in each other’s eyes!","The two of them were not inexperienced people. Usually, there are many things about these men of the ancient gods going out to drink flower wine. Naturally, they can tell what was going on.","Although the sound in the room was very subtle, it really sounds like the movement made when doing that kind of thing!","After the two exchanged eye contact for a while, they both shook their heads inwardly, feeling ashamed for their obscene thoughts!","Divine Doctor Liu brought his Junior Sister inside to treat their Young Master!","There are currently two men and one woman in the room, what can they do? Besides, the Young Master was still in a coma, even if Divine Doctor Liu has that kind of relationship with his Junior Sister, it’s impossible for him to be so insane, right?","It must be that they are too dirty!","But, that voice was really... really a bit weird...","The two guards stood there, in a dilemma for a moment, not knowing what to do.","“What should we do?” One of them lowered his voice.","“Now there seems to be no sound in the room again. Why don’t we get closer and hear what’s going on inside?”","“This...isn’t that good? If you get closer, you might be discovered!”","“But... that voice just now... just in case...”","“Bah, bah, what are you thinking about? This was impossible, right?”","The two hesitated. At first they paid attention to lowering their voices, but now they couldn’t control the volume."]},{"number":3725,"title":"Chapter 3725 What Are They Doing?(4)","paragraphs":["3725 What Are They Doing?(4)","In the room separated by a wall, Huang Yueli’s face was completely dark.","At this moment, the faint scent of calming incense in the room has been completely replaced by an ambiguous one.","Huang Yueli was lying on Li Moying’s body, and the clothes under the quilt of the two of them had disappeared!","And on Li Moying’s face, there was no longer a calm and peaceful expression like before when he looked just as if he were sleeping. Although his eyes were still tightly closed, his face was flushed, and beads of perspiration dripped from his forehead. His eyebrows were even more knitted together, as if trying to endure something.","Feeling that Huang Yueli’s movements stopped, he seemed to be very uncomfortable, and his body even began to rub against the bed slightly.","Feeling his restlessness, Huang Yueli blushed even more, wishing she could just fall off him!","However, she didn’t dare to do that at all!","Because, from the outside, Li Moying’s body only showed signs of emotion, and only Huang Yueli, who was working hard in double cultivation with him, could clearly feel that the evil qi in Li Moying’s body was also going through this process, gradually getting along with the breath in her body and fusing in the midst.","This process went smoothly beyond her imagination.","Just now, although Huang Yueli had already decided to work with Li Moying to treat her illness, when it came time to implement the plan, she encountered a lot of difficulties.","Because, Huang Yueli realised that she doesn’t know much at all!","Usually, Li Moying was very, very proactive. Sometimes just a look from Huang Yueli was enough to make this man instantly turn into a beast and throw his wife down.","Therefore, Huang Yueli never had the need to take the initiative to contribute at all. She just needs to lie down obediently and let Li Moying take charge of everything.","But now, Li Moying was unconscious on the bed and can’t even move a finger. She had no choice but to take the initiative!","However, not only does she have to take the initiative, but also has to unlock difficult new poses.","To be honest, in the eyes of a girl like her who has not been married for a long time, the double cultivation secret manual given to her by Saint Iniquitous Shadow was even more difficult to understand than the most profound secret manual in the world. The difficulty level was really at Hell Level!","Looking at the contents of the secret manual, Huang Yueli deeply understood what kind of feelings those ordinary cultivators felt in their hearts...","Unfortunately, now she has no way out.","Huang Yueli could only grit her teeth, hold the secret manual in front of her eyes, suppress all shy thoughts, study it carefully over and over again, and at the same time, keep trying to practice.","It took a lot of effort before she understood a part of it, and the effect of the practice was pretty good, at least Li Moying had started to react a little bit!","Seeing that she only needs to spend a little more time to make the evil qi in Li Moying’s body complete the first cycle, but at this moment, the two guards’ discussions suddenly came from outside the door!","Huang Yueli was startled when she heard the sound, and almost fell off the bed in fright!","These two people were already so close!","They were only one or two hundred metres away from this door!","Originally, Huang Yueli’s spiritual consciousness was very strong, and she was usually very vigilant, so she wouldn’t have discovered it until this time, but at this moment, her attention was on Li Moying, so she knew that it was only now that she realized something was wrong.","Outside the door, the two guards had reached an agreement.","“Let’s go and investigate carefully first!”"]},{"number":3726,"title":"Chapter 3726 What Are They Doing?(5)","paragraphs":["3726 What Are They Doing?(5)","“That’s right, if we go back like this, how can we explain to Young Miss Leyun?”","The image of Li Leyun when she was angry appeared in the minds of the two guards, and they couldn’t help but shiver.","Although Li Leyun was a beauty, she was also a strong person whose cultivation base was much higher than theirs. The aura she exuded from her body when she was angry was enough to make them terrified.","The two made up their minds and approached the door cautiously step by step.","Huang Yueli rolled up the quilt, and subconsciously rolled over from Li Moying’s body.","The man felt the girl’s departure, and his eyebrows tightened as his chest heaved slightly, as if he wanted to turn passive into active, but in the end he still couldn’t do what he wanted.","The moment Huang Yueli withdrew, she clearly felt the chaos of evil qi in Li Moying’s meridians, and she couldn’t help but feel anxious.","A thought flashed through her mind, and she detected the location of Little Phoenix.","It was found that the little brat was gnawing on chicken legs, without realizing that his Master was in danger because of his negligence.","Huang Yueli was so angry that she almost vomited blood, “Little Wang Cai, what are you doing?”","Little Wang Cai really ate so much that his mouth was full of oil. After eating seven or eight chicken legs in a row, his stomach was already bulging. At this moment, Huang Yueli’s angry voice suddenly sounded in his mind.","He suddenly turned pale with fright, trembled all over, and the chicken leg on his right hand fell to the ground.","It’s over, it’s over, it’s over!","He was actually found by the Female Devil who ate chicken legs, and let her know that he ate so much!","In fact, Little Phoenix also knew that as Huang Yueli’s contracted divine beast, it was still a half-spiritual body. As long as Huang Yueli wanted to know what he was doing outside, he couldn’t escape the cover of his Master’s spiritual consciousness.","Therefore, he usually doesn’t dare to do bad things without telling Huang Yueli.","But today was different. Little Wang Cai knew that when his Master was with the Great Demon King, he must have been um um ah ah.","Even though he couldn’t figure out what he was doing, one thing was for sure, that is, the Female Devil had no time to take care of him! No matter what evil he does, he will not be found out!","When Huang Yueli and Li Moying were together before, he often ate chicken legs secretly, and he was never found out!","Today... What happened today?","“Could it be that the Great Demon King can’t do it after he’s in a coma? So... the Female Devil is dissatisfied?”","Little Phoenix muttered to himself, puffing up his cheeks and thinking suspiciously, completely unaware that he had already said these words out of his mouth.","When Liu Buyan heard it from the side, he was sweating for him.","But before he had time to remind the brat, Huang Yueli had already lost her temper.","“Where did you learn these things! What can’t do it, are these words a child like you should say?”","The spiritual senses of both parties to the contract are connected, so Huang Yueli’s angry words were directly transmitted to Little Wang Cai’s mind, just like thunder.","Little Phoenix’s face turned even paler, “Female... Female Devil, please keep your voice down, I... I’m not a child anymore, I’m already tens of thousands of years old! Besides, isn’t that what the Big Demon Lord whispered to you before?” ? Why can he say it, but I can’t?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s face also turned livid.","After a long time, it was the man on the bed who’s skin was thicker than the city wall, who taught the child badly!"]},{"number":3727,"title":"Chapter 3727 What Are They Doing?(6)","paragraphs":["3727 What Are They Doing?(6)","Huang Yueli really wanted to grab Little Wang Cai and smack his butt, and then make Li Moying kneel on the washboard for an entire day and night.","Unfortunately, now was not the time.","The two guards in the courtyard had already walked down the corridor and were only a few metres away from the door.","However, they were obviously afraid of the people in the room. After approaching, they stopped. Both of them held their breaths, obviously pricking up their ears, trying to hear clearly what was going on in the room.","Realizing this, Huang Yueli naturally wouldn’t continue.","However, the breath in Li Moying’s body became more and more chaotic.","The sweat on his forehead kept coming out, one drop after another, soaking a large area of the pillow.","Even though he couldn’t move, Huang Yueli could clearly feel how severe pain he was enduring right now.","The dual cultivation technique was suddenly interrupted while it was in operation, not to mention Li Moying, even Huang Yueli suffered serious backlash. Just now she was so angry that she almost vomited blood. It was not an exaggeration, but she was really going to vomit blood. The backlash made a mouthful of blood reach her throat, and she swallowed it back abruptly.","A low moan came from Li Moying’s throat, mixed with pain and pleasure.","Coupled with his slightly hoarse voice due to being in long-term coma, the low magnetic voice echoed in Huang Yueli’s ears, not to mention how seductive it was.","Huang Yue’s head shook, and she moved her body subconsciously, feeling restless.","The influence of the double cultivation method on her was also very serious.","Huang Yueli tried her best to suppress the abnormal reaction of her body, during which time she used her spiritual consciousness to communicate with Little Wang Cai.","After hearing Huang Yueli angrily explain the situation at the door, Little Wang Cai realized how much trouble he had caused!","For a moment, the blood on his face faded away, and he looked like a dead man.","Liu Buyan didn’t understand, so he went in, saw it from the side, and said a little strangely: “Little Wang Cai, what’s wrong with you? Why is your face so ugly? You’re so afraid of my Junior Sister, tsk tsk, don’t you usually seem lawless eh? Don’t worry, that little girl was still very soft-hearted to those close to her. You just ate a few chicken legs. eat you!”","When Little Phoenix heard this, the corners of his mouth turned down, and two tears instantly appeared in his eyes.","“Boo Hoooooooooooooooooooooooo!”","“Is it so serious?” Liu Buyan looked puzzled.","“Yes, of course! The two guards you drove away just now are here again, and they’ve already reached the door! Quick, let’s save the Female Devil!”","“What??” Liu Buyan’s expression changed in shock.","Halfway through the speech, Little Phoenix already flew out and ran towards the door.","Liu Buyan came back to his senses, and hurriedly chased after him.","At this moment, the two guards had already arrived under the window of Li Moying’s room. They were so close to the target that they didn’t dare to speak. They could only communicate with their eyes and spiritual sense.","“Here... can you hear the voice inside clearly?”","“The woman’s voice was gone, but...but this man’s voice seems...it really seems to be the Young Master!”","“What’s going on? What did they do to the Young Master??”"]},{"number":3728,"title":"Chapter 3728 What Are They Doing?(7)","paragraphs":["3728 What Are They Doing?(7)","Thinking that the Young Master, who made the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan proud and respected, was suffering under the hands of two quack doctors of unknown origin, the two guards couldn’t stand it any longer.","They wanted to go in and stop it, but they didn’t dare to do so.","While the two were hesitating, suddenly, a voice sounded behind them.","“What are you doing here?!”","The two of them jumped up from the ground in fright!","Looking back, he met Liu Buyan’s stern gaze.","The two felt guilty and scared, their legs gave way, and they almost fell to their knees in front of Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan looked at them condescendingly, and said in a cold voice: “I have warned you just now, don’t appear around here again, and you are still here? Who gave you the courage to openly resist the orders of the Patriarch?”","“I...we...no...not...”","The two guards tremblingly wanted to explain, but found that they didn’t know how to explain.","Because Liu Buyan’s accusation against them was true in the first place!","They are the ones who knowingly committed crimes, went back and forth, and wanted to spy on him and his Junior Sister!","One of the guards was a bit more courageous. After he felt that he couldn’t explain it, he simply went all out and asked directly: “Divine Doctor Liu, aren’t you supposed to treat our Young Master? Why are you outside the room? You actually left our Young Master alone in the room? Young Master must be very uncomfortable to make that kind of noise! Where did you do to our Young Master? The Patriarch invited you to come and treat the illness, that’s how you treat our Young Master?”","Liu Buyan felt a sudden shock in his heart.","When he came over just now, he knew something was wrong. The two of them were hiding under the window, and they didn’t know how much they heard!","Now, they have even heard Li Moying’s voice, so...then his Junior Sister...","Liu Buyan’s face remained calm, hooked the corners of his mouth, and said with a sneer: “What? Young Master Li’s can make a noise, is it my fault? Before I came, your Young Master couldn’t even move his tongue. If it weren’t for my good medical skills, even if you have ten ears, you still wouldn’t be able to hear him!”","The two guards were startled when they heard this.","They were too eager just now, so they didn’t realize that there was anything wrong with this matter.","Now after Liu Buyan said this, the two realized that their Young Master could actually make a sound! !","This... This itself was an incredible thing!","Thinking about it this way, not only did Liu Buyan not throw their Young Master aside, on the contrary, no matter what treatment method he used, at least, they had seen obvious results now...","Liu Buyan’s icy voice sounded again, “What are you still doing here? Get out of here quickly! I’ve already remembered your two faces, and I’ll report to Patriarch Li when he comes. If something goes wrong and if your Young Master really can’t wake up, hmph! Think carefully about how to explain it to your Patriarch!”","When the two guards heard this, they were really scared out of their wits!","Although they disturbed Liu Buyan’s treatment unintentionally, it was true that they came here with bad motives. Moreover, Li Shihong had already ordered that no one should approach. It was also a fact that they knowingly committed crimes!","If Li Shihong knew about this, their lives would definitely be in danger!"]},{"number":3729,"title":"Chapter 3729 What Are They Doing?(8)","paragraphs":["3729 What Are They Doing?(8)","Thinking of this, the two guards couldn’t care about anything else, they all knelt down on the ground and kowtowed desperately to Liu Buyan.","“Divine Doctor Liu, please be magnanimous!”","“We know our mistake, and we will never dare to do so again! Please spare us!”","“It’s all because we judged the heart of a gentleman with the heart of a villain and offended Your Excellency. Please spare our lives!”","Seeing the panic-stricken appearance of the two guards, Liu Buyan secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","However, he didn’t relax because of this, he knew that he had to do a full set of acting, so he snorted coldly, “If your Young Master was alright, I don’t have time to take care of you clowns, but if the treatment fails, I will definitely report the truth to your Patriarch.”","The two guards wanted to say something, but Liu Buyan glared, “You are still here, do you want to continue to influence my treatment?”","“No, no, let’s get out, get out!”","The two guards, who were already scared to death, only realized at this moment, and ran away in a hurry!","Liu Buyan watched them disappear into the path in front of the yard, then pursed his lips, walked to the door, and knocked lightly.","“Junior Sister! Junior Sister, are you alright?”","In the room, Li Moying hummed faintly.","Liu Buyan was pleasantly surprised at first. This shows that Huang Yueli’s so-called dual cultivation method really has obvious effects on treating Li Moying!","But then, his brows subconsciously frowned again.","This voice...was a bit too ambiguous, no wonder the two guards couldn’t help approaching just now...","Even if it was him, hearing such a voice would inevitably make him feel that something was wrong.","Wait, he didn’t think anything wrong at all. What happened in the room must be something very ambiguous...","The corners of Liu Buyan’s mouth pursed even deeper, and he paused for a moment, not knowing whether he should stay or leave.","Fortunately, after a while, Huang Yueli’s voice came out, “Thank you, brother, for your help! You wait a little longer, I... I will come out soon!”","Liu Buyan let out a “hmph” and immediately left quickly. The speed of turning around and moving his legs was even faster than those two guards just now!","Because this scene was so embarrassing!","When Huang Yueli heard that Liu Buyan was leaving, she carefully released her spiritual consciousness, checked the surroundings, and confirmed that no one else was around, and she finally felt relieved.","Thank goodness.","Finally, Liu Buyan’s reaction was quite astute, and the two guards obviously hadn’t experienced anything, so they were fooled by him in a few moments! Otherwise, if she and Li Moying were seen in the room by others, they would be in big trouble!","However, although one problem has been solved now, another problem...","Huang Yueli’s gaze once again turned to Li Moying on the bed.","The dual cultivation technique was forcibly interrupted. Although Huang Yueli was still working hard to control the evil qi in the two of them, Li Moying’s body still couldn’t bear it.","He felt hot all over for a while, and became cold again for a while.","The muffled groan just now was still ambiguous, but at this moment, it was already in complete pain.","“Those two guys are really damned! Ughh... what should we do now?”","Huang Yueli bit her lips, her little face flushed, and the difficult postures in the secret manual of double cultivation that she had just read appeared in her mind.","“Ugh... don’t tell me that...we’ll have to try out the more challenging postures? Are those even possible to begin with?”"]},{"number":3730,"title":"Chapter 3730 Poisoned By The Fox Vixen (1)","paragraphs":["3730 Poisoned By The Fox Vixen (1)","The two guards fled in desperation and they ran like no tomorrow. Only after pulling a huge distance did they finally stop.","The two looked at each other, still in shock.","They were really terrified by Liu Buyan just now, they never thought that they would be caught by Liu Buyan!","Moreover, Liu Buyan still has such an astonishing aura!","!!","Although he was only at the early stage of the Dream Profound Realm, and the cultivation strength of the two guards was far above him, but at that moment just now, in front of Liu Buyan, they didn’t even dare to show their anger.","“It’s... so terrible! We are really... so unlucky today!”","“If Divine Doctor Liu tells the Patriarch about this, it’s a huge disaster!”","The two couldn’t help but secretly prayed in their hearts, hoping that Li Moying in the room would recover as soon as possible. In this way, even if the Patriarch knew about the ‘good deeds’ they had done, he would forgive them because he was in a good mood...","“What should we do now? We’re in front of Young Miss Leyun, what should I say?” One of them asked.","The other person was still panting. Hearing this, his body stiffened instantly, “This...”","The faces of both of them became more and more ugly.","They had just escaped from Liu Buyan’s trap, but for them, the matter was far from over. As long as they thought about Li Leyun’s face if they knew that their actions had failed, the two of them trembled in their hearts.","“Why don’t we...don’t return to Young Miss Leyun?”","“But, will this work? If Young Miss Leyun asks...”","“If she asks, we’ll just say that we stayed near the hut all day and didn’t find anything unusual, and it’s impossible for Young Miss Leyun to know...”","“Your words are reasonable...”","The two were discussing secretly, when suddenly, they heard a cold voice from behind.","“What are you two talking about? What is impossible for me to know? Huh?”","Li Leyun’s soft voice suddenly sounded, and the two guards were so frightened that they sat down on the ground.","“What’s the matter? Afraid until you’re behaving like this? What have you done wrong?” Li Leyun asked with a sneer.","The two guards were really frightened, their faces paled instantly, and they turned their heads tremblingly, “Le...Young Miss Leyun...”","Both of them were extremely depressed.","Speaking of which, today they can be said to be unlucky. First, they secretly monitored Liu Buyan, but their whereabouts were exposed twice, and they were very frightened by Liu Buyan.","This time, they just stood on the side of the road and talked secretly, but were caught by Li Leyun on the spot!","They usually don’t dare to disobey Li Leyun’s orders. Today, because this matter involved the orders of the Patriarch, they wanted to take advantage of it.","But it was just this one time that they did something wrong, and it was revealed immediately.","Looking at Li Leyun’s angry eyes, the two lowered their heads guilty.","As soon as Li Leyun raised her right hand, the whip swung towards them!","“Alright, you two eat everything from inside to outside! How dare you tell lies to fool me? I think you have eaten the heart of a tiger, and you don’t want to live anymore!”","Li Leyun’s cultivation base was very high, and her shots were heavy. The two guards were whipped a few times. Not only were their skin torn apart and blood was flowing like a river, but they also suffered serious internal injuries, and their internal organs hurt.","However, they didn’t dare to struggle."]},{"number":3731,"title":"Chapter 3731 Falling Into The Vixen’s Poisonous Hands (2)","paragraphs":["3731 Falling Into The Vixen’s Poisonous Hands (2)","They didn’t even dare to dodge, so they could only bear this assault with their head down.","Li Leyun slapped them several times, but the leader of the guards beside her couldn’t stand it anymore, and reminded in a low voice: “Young Miss Leyun, don’t rush to deal with them now, it’s more important to see what happened to the Young Master first... ”","Li Leyun thought of it and forced herself to suppress the anger in her heart.","She threw down the whip, glared at the two guards who huddled together, and said coldly: “Tell me, what did you see at Brother Moying’s place just now? What exactly did Liu Buyan want to do to Brother Moying? Spit everything out for me. You’d better make it clear! If you dare to hide a single word, the next would be the punishment hall!”","!!","The two guards have already regretted terribly and now, naturally, they dare not hide anything.","The two hurriedly told the truth about the situation just now.","While talking, they also tried to justify their actions.","“Young Miss Leyun, it was indeed the two of us who were reckless this time. I didn’t expect Divine Doctor Liu to have such astonishing medical skills, and he can even make the Young Master speak!”","“It’s also because we disturbed Divine Doctor Liu’s treatment, and we were afraid that after the Patriarch knew about us, he would blame you, miss, so we wanted to hide it temporarily...”","“Yes, yes, Divine Doctor Liu was really treating the young master...”","The two desperately explained, wiping away tears from time to time, trying to use the most sincere tone, trying to explain the matter as Li Leyun’s consideration.","However, Li Leyun didn’t pay attention to their hard-working performance.","When she heard what the two said, the first thing she noticed was not that Liu Buyan could make Li Moying speak so quickly, but...","“What did you just say? Liu Buyan was not in the room? Then who was in the room with Brother Moying?”","The two guards said hesitantly: “This...we heard a woman’s voice vaguely at the door earlier, presumably that should be the Junior Sister of Divine Doctor Liu?”","Hearing this, Li Leyun flicked the whip in her hand and slammed it heavily on a small tree by the roadside.","The young tree with young branches was split in two on the spot, and the leaves fell to the ground.","Seeing this scene, the two guards subconsciously shuddered, not daring to imagine what the consequences would be if the whip had hit them.","Although Li Leyun, as the Patriarch’s niece, has always appeared in the God Realm as an elegant and intelligent daughter, but as her direct subordinates, the two of them knew that Young Miss Leyun was by no means what she appeared to be on the surface.","Li Leyun turned her head and stared at them, “Did you all hear clearly? There was a woman’s voice in Brother Moying’s room, and Liu Buyan was not in the room. There was only the so-called Junior Sister and Brother Moying alone. A lone man and a lone woman in the same room?!”","The guards lowered their heads, not daring to answer.","Li Leyun originally had a grudge against Huang Yueli’s “Junior Sister Li”, but now when she heard about her again, her anger began to soar.","Although at present, there was actually no conclusive evidence that something happened when Junior Sister Li and Li Moying were in the same room alone, but Li Leyun’s intuition told her that this matter was definitely not simple!","“I just knew that Divine Doctor Liu and his Junior Sister came to our Cloudy Qilin Clan with a purpose!”"]},{"number":3732,"title":"Chapter 3732 Falling Into The Vixen’s Poisonous Hands (3)","paragraphs":["3732 Falling Into The Vixen’s Poisonous Hands (3)","As long as the thought that the most powerful male god in her heart was being coveted by a lowly human woman, Li Leyun’s jealousness soared and she couldn’t calm down no matter what.","“Liu Buyan clearly sneaked into the Amethyst Paramount Palace under the pretense of medical treatment, hoping to use his Junior Sister’s beauty to seduce Brother Moying, and then take the opportunity to ascend to the sky! No wonder the medical treatment refuses to be seen by others, not even letting people approach within a radius of ten miles! It turns out that they want to do such a shameless thing!”","Li Leyun seemed to have thousands of claws scratching her heart, “Poor Brother Moying was unconscious, no matter what they do to Brother Moying, he will not be able to resist! If he wakes up, he finds that he has been humiliated like this, I don’t know what kind of anger he’ll be in after knowing that all because of a shameless Fox Vixen...”","“No, I can’t let Brother Moying suffer such a thing! I’m going to expose the true colours of that couple!”","Li Leyun suddenly came to her senses, and couldn’t take care of anything else right now, so she was about to go to Li Moying’s hut angrily!","At this time, she was so angry that she lost her mind, but the maids and guards around her were quite clear-headed.","Seeing her like this, they hurriedly rushed over, trying to stop her.","“Young Miss Leyun, don’t be impulsive! Please stop!”","“Young Miss, the Patriarch has ordered that no one approach the hut. If you go there and make trouble, what will the Patriarch think?”","“Young Miss Leyun, no matter what Divine Doctor Liu and the others are doing, you should report to the Patriarch first before...”","“That’s enough, shut up!”","Li Leyun flicked her sleeves abruptly, and everyone under her command were afraid to speak any further.","“Whoever dares to say one more word will go to the punishment hall with those two damned waste!”","The punishment halls of the major families of the Ancient God Clan were used to punish members of the family who had committed serious crimes. Once they entered, they would definitely suffer a lot. Moreover, it was very unlikely that they would be able to get out in this life.","As soon as they heard this, no matter how much they wanted to persuade her in their hearts, they could only hold back.","It’s not that Li Leyun was ignorant of the seriousness of this matter. If it were other matters, she would definitely first go to Li Shihong to clarify.","But now, it’s about her Brother Moying’s chastity!","What if Brother Moying suffered under the poisonous hands of that Fox Vixen?","She wants to save him immediately!","Poor Li Leyun doesn’t even know that Li Moying has been poisoned by a certain little fox countless times.","Moreover, he was the one who sent it to the door himself, insisting on letting a certain little fox poison him.","Li Leyun ran forward all the way, followed by a group of stumbling guards and maids.","While they were running wildly, they secretly groaned in their hearts.","It’s over, it’s over, was their lady really crazy? How dare you openly disobey the orders of the Patriarch!","This matter was about to explode!","When the truth comes out, Li Leyun, as the Patriarch’s niece, will at most be reprimanded and grounded for a period of time, but it will be miserable for them as subordinates!","Maybe, they will be expelled from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","It’s a pity that at this time, no one will come to rescue them...","Seeing that Li Moying’s hut was in front of them, everyone was about to despair.","At this moment, the sound of hurried footsteps suddenly came from the shade beside them."]},{"number":3733,"title":"Chapter 3733 Falling Into The Vixen’s Poisonous Hands (4)","paragraphs":["3733 Falling Into The Vixen’s Poisonous Hands (4)","“Someone else is coming!”","I don’t know who called out in a low voice, and everyone else noticed it.","When everyone looked back, they couldn’t help being taken aback.","Because, it was Li Shihong, the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who came out of the woods!","!!","He walked in the front, followed by Li Yuntao, Li Yunhai and other Elders, and a group of guards.","Li Shihong was startled when he saw them, “Leyun, what are you doing? Where do you want to go with so many people?”","Li Leyun was so anxious that she wished she could rush to the hut to see what happened.","However, it was her second uncle, the Patriarch she feared most, who stopped her!","This time, she could only stop in her tracks, “Second Uncle, I’m... I’m going... I’m going...”","She hesitated, thinking of what she was doing, she didn’t know how to speak for a while.","Li Shihong snorted coldly, and said, “Don’t you dare to say it? I see that you are aggressive. You are clearly going to Moying’s hut, right? What? You still think about going to trouble with Divine Doctor Liu? How many times have I warned you yesterday? Huh? Besides, the order I just issued this morning was that no one was allowed to approach the hut within a radius of ten miles! How far are you from the hut now? Can you tell me?”","Although Li Shihong was usually kind, he was the head of the clan after all, and once he puts on a serious front, he looked very dignified and solemn.","Li Leyun immediately broke out in a cold sweat.","Even if she was Li Shihong’s niece, she will definitely be severely punished for defying the Patriarch’s order and not mentioned after being caught by so many Elders.","“You are so courageous! Even ater the warning from yesterday’s incident, you’re still so defiant! If I don’t punish you today, what prestige do I have as a Patriarch? Come...”","When she heard that Li Shihong really wanted to punish her, Li Leyun became anxious.","She quickly raised her head and said loudly, “Second Uncle, you can’t punish me! The reason why I disobeyed your order this time was because... because...”","“Why?” Li Shihong frowned.","“Because...” Li Leyun gritted her teeth and said, “Because I have sent someone to find out that Liu Buyan and his Junior Sister did not come here to treat Brother Moying seriously. He actually sent that woman to seduce our Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Master!”","“What??”","Hearing this, Li Shihong and the Elders were in an uproar.","Everyone’s eyes widened, and they all had expressions of disbelief.","“How is this possible? The Young Master is already in a coma, how can she seduce him?”","“That’s right, Young Miss Leyun, you can’t talk nonsense about this. If it gets out, people will say that our Cloudy Qilin Clan doesn’t have any education!”","“If Divine Doctor Liu finds out, he will definitely be mad at you. Can you bear this responsibility?”","Seeing that no one believed her, Li Leyun became anxious, stomped her feet and said, “Elders, I’m really not talking nonsense, I... I have witnesses!”","Originally, she was still scrupulous, not wanting to reveal that she had secretly monitored Liu Buyan.","But when things got to this point, in order to convince everyone, she couldn’t care less about anything else.","Li Leyun pointed to the two guards behind her, “I sent these two people to the hut just now, and they heard with their own ears the ambiguous voices of a man and a woman coming from the room, not only that, but they also saw Liu Buyan was walking from outside the room! As a doctor, he doesn’t see the patient himself, but leaves his Junior Sister alone in Brother Moying’s room!”"]},{"number":3734,"title":"Chapter 3734 Face Slaps (1)","paragraphs":["3734 Face Slaps (1)","Hearing this, the two guards shuddered, they had been killed by Li Leyun!","In order to defend herself, this young lady sold the two of them outright!","The Patriarch has issued repeated orders not to allow anyone to approach the hut. Now that the two of them defied his order openly, they will definitely not be spared!","Sure enough, as soon as Li Leyun finished speaking, Li Shihong glanced at the two guards coldly, and said angrily: “You didn’t listen to my previous order, did you? No one listens to my words?”","Li Shihong released his oppressive aura and the two guards shuddered, knelt on the ground, kowtowed desperately, and shouted “Patriarch, forgive me!”","Seeing this scene, Li Leyun also reacted.","However, she didn’t care about the lives of the two guards at all, she just wanted to prove her words were right, there must be something wrong with Liu Buyan and his Junior Sister!","“Second Uncle, don’t scare them! Even... even if I had sent someone to investigate the hut, I...I was wrong... but I’m still worried about Brother Moying! Facts have proved that my worries weren’t unfounded! Those two guys are not Divine Doctors at all, but charlatans! I don’t know what other bad things they are going to do to Brother Moying! Second Uncle, let’s go and save Brother Moying, let’s not tarry else it will be too late! ”","“Doing bad things?” Li Shihong became even angrier after hearing this, “It’s not easy for a Divine Doctor like Liu Buyan to come to treat Moying! You actually keep looking for trouble for Divine Doctor Liu! Yesterday you have already offended him, but fortunately, Divine Doctor Liu was magnanimous and didn’t argue with you, so he was still willing to stay for a consultation! Now you actually sent someone to monitor him again!”","Li Shihong was so angry that his chest kept rising and falling, and he glared at Li Leyun.","He really didn’t expect that this niece, who has always been excellent, would become so unreliable when encountering matters related to Li Moying.","She didn’t even listen to his orders!","After being reprimanded by Li Shihong, Li Leyun finally realized that she had really caused a disaster this time.","However, she didn’t feel so scared.","Because, she firmly believes that what she did was right!","“Second Uncle, it doesn’t matter how you scold me. I know I shouldn’t disobey your orders. But... But Brother Moying is really in danger! Please hurry over and save him!”","“You’re still talking nonsense here!” Li Leyun was so angry that his beard almost flew up.","Seeing that he didn’t believe her, Li Leyun quickly kicked the two guards who were kneeling on the ground and kowtowing.","“You two, don’t just kowtow, quickly explain what you have seen! Only by rescuing Brother Moying in time can you pay off for your crime!”","The two guards were initially frightened.","Under the powerful influence of the Patriarch, all he knew was to kowtow and beg for mercy.","Unexpectedly kicked by Li Leyun, and hearing her say the words “pay off for your crime”, the two of them immediately realized that this was their only chance!","The two hurriedly raised their heads, scrambling to explain.","“Patriarch, it’s true! What Young Miss Leyun said is true! Divine Doctor Liu and the others really have a problem!”","“We all saw it with our own eyes just now. Divine Doctor Liu wasn’t in the Young Master’s room, but was outside!”"]},{"number":3735,"title":"Chapter 3735 Face Slaps (2)","paragraphs":["3735 Face Slaps (2)","“That’s right, only Young Master and Young Miss Li were in the room! Moreover, there was really a strange sound coming from inside, it’s as if... as if...”","Having said this, the two guards stopped suddenly, subconsciously understanding that such words were not suitable for speaking.","However, Li Shihong’s face was already livid when he heard them, and when he saw them stop, he snorted coldly and asked, “Like what? Aren’t you going to be a witness? How can you only say half of what you say?”","“Speak clearly!” Li Shihong snapped.","!!","Seeing the two guards trembling and daring not to say anything, Li Leyun cast a contemptuous glance at them.","These two cowardly fellows were really useless!","She simply stood up and said, “Second Uncle, they dare not tell, of course it was because what happened in the room must be shameless! Think about it, as a doctor, how can Divine Doctor Liu walk away from the patient so easily? Even if he has to do some errands, his Junior Sister should be the one to run errands! But, he just left his Junior Sister alone in the room!”","“A lone man and woman in the same room...”","As Li Leyun spoke, she secretly gritted her teeth, filled with resentment!","That little bitch actually dared to covet her Brother Moying!","This time, even at the risk of angering the Patriarch, she will tear that dead girl into pieces!","“Are you done?” Li Shihong said coldly.","Li Leyun was taken aback for a moment, “I...I’m done..”","She looked up at Li Shihong, and found that the expression on her Second Uncle’s face was gloomy, and she couldn’t see his emotions at this time at all, and the anger that was visible just now had also subsided a little.","Li Leyun couldn’t understand for a moment.","Liu Buyan encouraged his Junior Sister to seduce Li Moying. Shouldn’t Li Shihong be furious on the spot and lead someone to rush over to arrest the two of them?","Why did Li Shihong seem calmer than before?","Just as Li Leyun hesitated, Li Shihong said again: “Is there anything else to add?”","Li Leyun didn’t know what was going on, so she could only hesitate and say, “No...nothing more...”","“Hmph, that’s good!”","Li Shihong narrowed his eyes and looked at Li Leyun with a strictness that he had never seen before.","“I really didn’t know when the top genius of our Cloudy Qilin Clan became the kind of shrew in the market, not only sent people to follow and spy on other people’s whereabouts, but also made such a nasty guess when she heard a little bit of wind! Listening to what you said, it’s simply unbearable!”","Li Leyun was shocked, but she still tried to defend herself, “Second Uncle, what I said was true...”","“Don’t call me Second Uncle!” Li Shihong didn’t have the patience to listen to her continue, and interrupted her sharply.","“What you said was true? You clearly have a dirty mind, so you think people are dirty too! Do you know that the reason why I’m here now is that Divine Doctor Liu personally asked me to come here?”","At first, Li Leyun wanted to continue to say something to discredit the pair of shameless thugs.","But who would have thought that Li Shihong would actually say such a thing!","This was really unexpected!","“What... what? Liu Buyan personally... invited you to come here?”","Li Shihong sneered and said, “That’s right, that’s right! Divine Doctor Liu said that the treatment has made some progress, so asked us to come over and discuss it. If it’s really like what you said, he conspired with his Junior Sister, wouldn’t he specially ask us to come and watch?”"]},{"number":3736,"title":"Chapter 3736 Face Slaps (3)","paragraphs":["3736 Face Slaps (3)","Li Leyun never dreamed that things would unfold like this!","But in retrospect, she hurried to the hut with her people, just in time to bump into Li Shihong and so many of them also appearing here, it doesn’t seem like a coincidence.","After all, Li Moying’s recuperating hut was located in a very remote place and usually, disciples from the clan are even forbidden to come here at will, for fear of affecting the Young Master’s rest.","So...Li Shihong and the others were really invited by Liu Buyan!","!!","Li Leyun’s mind was buzzing, she couldn’t believe it was real!","If Liu Buyan really sent someone to invite Li Shihong, wouldn’t that mean that her so-called lone man and woman, plotting evil things, simply cannot exist?","Li Shihong and the Elders behind him knew this long ago!","And she still doesn’t know anything about it, and she was still trying to smear Liu Buyan here. In the eyes of others, wouldn’t she have already become a big joke?","But, how was this possible? If Liu Buyan and his Junior Sister were really treating the illness well, why would they...","Li Leyun suddenly came back to her senses and kicked the two guards on the ground!","This time, unlike the last time, she was just upset, but really angry, so she used all her strength when she stepped out.","The two guards didn’t expect to be attacked at all. They didn’t even have a little defence, and they were kicked away and sent flying!","A loud bang resounded twice.","The bodies of the two of them slammed heavily on a big tree dozens of metres away before sliding down against the tree trunk.","Looking from a distance, you can still see traces of blood on the ground.","“Li Leyun! What are you doing?!” Li Shihong scolded her with a frown.","Li Leyun immediately put on a pitiful expression, “Second Uncle, there is something wrong with these two guards! I... I was deceived by them just now! They told me that Young Miss Li and Brother Moying were alone in the room and that there were all kinds of ambiguous sounds coming from inside, so I misunderstood... I... I really didn’t expect this to happen! They are also my own subordinates yet they actually made up such a lie !”","The two guards crashed into a tree and were already knocked unconscious.","Just after waking up, when they heard Li Leyun’s words again, they immediately fainted from the rage again!","They didn’t expect that after Li Leyun had finished using them, she turned them into scapegoats again, and poured a bucket of dirty water on their heads.","The ambiguous matter between Young Miss Li and the Young Master was not said by the two of them at all!","At the beginning, they only said that they misunderstood Divine Doctor Liu, but it was Li Leyun who immediately thought of that, and insisted on rushing over to “catch the chartalans”. These servants couldn’t stop them even if they wanted to!","It’s a pity that no matter how much they tried to justify it, it was useless now.","Li Shihong glanced at Li Leyun coldly, not missing the guilt in her eyes.","“Come here, take those two guards down and send them to the punishment hall! After dealing with the matter here, we will interrogate properly. Now, Elders, let me go to the hut to have a look! We have delayed too much here. I’m afraid Divine Doctor Liu will lose his patience while waiting for me!”","He looked at Li Leyun, “You come with us too! I’ll let you see with your own eyes who Divine Doctor Liu really is! Are you really guilty of speculating about him like this behind his back?”","Li Yuntao and the others looked at Li Leyun with resentful gazes."]},{"number":3737,"title":"Chapter 3737 Face Slaps (4)","paragraphs":["3737 Face Slaps (4)","However, no one spoke anymore.","Li Shihong took a big step and walked to the hut first.","No one noticed that a chubby little boy was hiding nearby in the woods and listened to everything they said.","Seeing that the dispute was over, the little boy also turned into a stream of light and disappeared with a whoosh.","As a spirit body, Little Wang Cai easily slipped into the room through the half-open window, without attracting the attention of Li Shihong and others.","As soon as it came in, it yelled, “Female Devil, Female Devil, those Cloudy Qilin Clan have come and will be here soon!”","Huang Yueli’s calm voice came, “I know, don’t tell me that I can’t hear them making such a loud commotion in the woods? But, what are these people arguing about? Why haven’t they come in for so long?”","At this moment, Huang Yueli had already tidied up her appearance, not even a single strand of hair was out of place, she looked elegant and composed. No one could tell what she was doing for Li Moying more than half an hour ago where she looked completely dishevelled and distraught.","She was sitting on a chair under the window, drinking tea slowly.","Even Li Moying looked completely different this time.","Since they couldn’t put back any of the clothes that Huang Yueli had stripped off just now, he was now lying in a huge bathtub, with part of his perfect body line revealed.","Various medicinal herbs were piled up in the bathtub. With the hot water, thick steam was emitted, and a scent of medicinal herbs wafted from the bathtub.","Liu Buyan was adding water to the bathtub.","He only came out from behind the screen when he heard Little Wang Cai’s scream, and sat opposite Huang Yueli.","Little Wang Cai was excitedly describing to Huang Yueli what he saw just now.","“... Female Devil, you didn’t see it! That Young Miss Leyun was really too funny! She insisted that the Big Demon Lord and you were doing bad things in here, but she had been severely slapped in the face! Looking at her livid face, I almost couldn’t hold back my laughter! Hahaha, you’re still a Female Devil, you know everything well, how can that stupid ugly woman beat you!”","Little Wang Cai looked at Huang Yueli with a look of honour, and he had already forgotten the miserable situation he was in when he was punished by Huang Yueli.","Liu Buyan shook his head inwardly, and waited for Little Phoenix to finish speaking before he said, “You’re smart, Junior Sister. I thought that after those two guards were driven away, it would be impossible for them to come again. It’s Junior Sister, you insisted on calling Patriarch Li and the others.over! It seems that you know Li Leyun better and know that she will not be reconciled and will come to make trouble again!”","The corners of her lips hooked up as she said, “That’s right. It’s not the first time I’ve dealt with her...”","Thinking of the things that happened in Empyrean Fox Continent, a cold glint in Huang Yueli’s eyes flashed by.","Li Leyun was someone who can do anything to become Li Moying’s fiancée!","Fortunately, she was prepared. After today, no matter how much Li Leyun smeared them, Li Shihong would not believe it!","At this moment, clear footsteps came from outside the door.","Huang Yueli raised her hand, motioned to Little Wang Cai, and took him back.","At the same moment, there was a knock on the door.","“Bang bang bang!”","“Divine Doctor Liu, we have arrived, is it convenient to come in now?”","Liu Buyan exchanged glances with Huang Yueli and stood up, “Patriarch Li, you are finally here! Please come in!”"]},{"number":3738,"title":"Chapter 3738 Face Slaps (5)","paragraphs":["3738 Face Slaps (5)","After getting Liu Buyan’s permission, Li Shihong opened the door and walked in.","Followed by a group of Elders, and a dejected Li Leyun.","However, as soon as Li Leyun entered the room, she immediately became energetic and stretched her head out and scanned the room vigilantly.","She still harboured the last ray of hope, thinking that there might be some kind of evidence left behind in the room by this shameless pair of Senior Brother and Junior Sister. As long as she could find these pieces of evidence and put them in front of Li Shihong, then she would be able to stand upright in one fell swoop!","However, it’s a pity that Li Leyun’s eyes almost popped out, but she couldn’t find anything wrong.","In the spacious room, the windows on all sides were opened, making it airy and bright.","The bedding on the bed was neatly folded and piled aside, but there was no sign of Li Moying on the bed.","Just as Li Leyun was about to speak out, she heard Li Shihong in front of her speak first.","“Divine Doctor Liu, Moying is... taking a medicinal bath?”","Only then did Li Leyun look in the direction of Li Shihong’s finger. However, Li Moying’s bathtub was behind the screen, so he could see it from Li Shihong’s position, but Li Leyun followed behind, blocking his view up.","Liu Buyan nodded, and said: “That’s right, I came up with this treatment plan after discussing with my Junior Sister for a long time yesterday. The medicinal materials used in Young Master Li’s medicinal bath are our master’s unique formula, which can help detoxify poisons. It helps the circulation of profound energy. In addition, coupled with the technique of the acupuncture with golden needles, it can be effective in a very short period of time.”","Li Shihong was very happy when he heard this, “Divine Doctor Liu, you are really good at healing! You found a cure so quickly! I don’t know, you mentioned a very short time, how long will that take?”","Speaking of this, he paused, and then explained: “Divine Doctor Liu, don’t blame me for being impolite, our clansmen are too impatient! Moying has been in a coma for so long, and it seems that there is less than a month left until the God Realm’s Grand Meet. There isn’t much time left... Can you advise if there is any hope for Moying to wake up before the God Realm’s Grand Meet?”","Li Shihong asked cautiously and gulped.","Liu Buyan showed hesitation, frowned and muttered, “Well...”","While making a thoughtful expression, he secretly looked in Huang Yueli’s direction when everyone was not paying attention.","Seeing Huang Yueli nodded calmly, he said: “As long as you can cooperate with my treatment plan and don’t interfere with it, it is not impossible to heal Young Master Li before the God Realm’s Grand Meet...”","Even though he had already received a guaranteed ticket from his Junior Sister, Liu Buyan still a backhand and didn’t fully speak.","Even if they could really heal Li Moying, they still have to take this opportunity to take advantage of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Otherwise, others will think that they didn’t put in much effort!","Although... as a Senior Brother, he really didn’t do much...","However, he can also be responsible for helping his Junior Sister avoid these troubles!","When Li Shihong heard this, he was naturally full of joy, and he patted his chest and said that he would definitely satisfy all Liu Buyan’s requirements!","The Elders behind him also complied.","But at this moment, a discordant voice sounded.","“Second Uncle, we can’t just listen to what Liu Buyan is saying here, can we? Can I go behind the screen to see Brother Moying? You have to confirm his situation with your own eyes to know that they aren’t lying, right?”"]},{"number":3739,"title":"Chapter 3739 Face Slaps (6)","paragraphs":["3739 Face Slaps (6)","When Li Shihong heard it, and saw that it was his restless niece who jumped out to stir up trouble again, his brows furrowed in displeasure.","Before Li Leyun finished speaking, he snapped, “Shut up! There is no place for you to speak here! You don’t know medical skills, so in what capacity can you interfere with Divine Doctor Liu’s treatment here? You haven’t remembered the lesson just now, huh?”","After being scolded by Li Shihong like this, Li Leyun’s face turned blue for a while, and she lowered her head in shame.","In front of the Elders, she was a junior after all and it was alright to be reprimanded by the Patriarch.","!!","However, this time, she was reprimanded so mercilessly by the Patriarch in front of Liu Buyan and his Junior Sister!","Just thinking about it made her feel extremely ashamed!","However, she only hesitated for a moment, then mustered up her courage again, raised her head, and said loudly: “Second Uncle, I know you don’t believe me, but this is related to Brother Moying’s body, just make sure it’s alright The bad thing? Everyone heard what my guard said just now. They heard Brother Moying’s voice outside the window! But now, we’ve been in for so long, and Brother Moying hasn’t moved at all. So how would we know that what they said was true? Isn’t it too abnormal?”","Li Shihong and the Elders had lost patience with Li Leyun.","He even wanted to interrupt her a few times and drive her out directly.","But who knows, this time, what Li Leyun said actually made some sense.","The two guards just now did say that they heard Li Moying’s voice outside the room.","Although there was no way to believe that the voice was ambiguous, but just making a sound does not seem to be a lie. After all, there was no need to fake such a thing.","If this was true, there was something wrong with Li Moying being so motionless now.","Li Shihong frowned slightly, and looked at Liu Buyan, “Divine Doctor Liu, what...what’s going on? I heard people say that Moying was able to make some noise just now, but now it seems...”","Before Liu Buyan could make a sound, the girl beside him had already let out a chuckle.","“Hey, this is quite interesting! Didn’t the Patriarch say before to my Senior Brother that you won’t interfere with our treatment and no one will come to disturb us within a radius of ten miles? Then who did the Patriarch listen to? It seems that Young Master Li can be heard from as far as ten miles?”","As Huang Yueli spoke, she blinked her big watery eyes, looking like a curious innocent girl.","Her voice was soft, and her tone was not too harsh, but Li Shihong’s face immediately became a little hot when he heard this.","He coughed twice, feeling extremely embarrassed, “This... this... Young Miss Li, this was all due to the lax discipline. I have never sent anyone to spy on the two of you, and I have already issued a strict order not to let other people come over, but... there was still a little accident...”","“Accident eh...” Huang Yueli curled her lips.","Li Shihong fell silent now, because he couldn’t cover up the fact that he didn’t manage the members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan well!","Continuing to defend, it seems to be sophistry instead.","So, he cupped his hands flatly, “Two divine doctors, it’s really my fault. I apologise to the two of you here. I promise that this will never happen again!”","Liu Buyan snorted coldly, “If there is another time, my Junior Sister and I will leave directly!”"]},{"number":3740,"title":"Chapter 3740 Face Slaps (7)","paragraphs":["3740 Face Slaps (7)","Li Shihong nodded quickly, “Yes, yes, please don’t worry! If this happens again, I will have no face to ask you to stay!”","As he spoke, he wiped the cold sweat from his forehead, feeling relieved.","Hearing Liu Buyan’s words, he probably wouldn’t immediately turn his back on him and leave.","He was really afraid that Liu Buyan would be so angry that he would leave there and then!","Although Amethyst Paramount Palace was heavily guarded, it was not so easy for Liu Buyan to leave with his Junior Sister, but even if they could lock them, they still couldn’t force them to treat Li Moying! If such a situation really happened, the unlucky ones would definitely be their Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Now, the two people in front of him were the people he couldn’t afford to offend!","Only then did Liu Buyan’s tense face relax a little, and he nodded slightly.","Seeing this, Li Shihong heaved a sigh of relief, and was about to say a few words of comfort, but at this moment, Li Leyun’s voice rang out once again and interrupted him.","“Second Uncle! Don’t be led astray by the two of them!”","“Shut up!” Li Shihong roared back at her and didn’t listen to what she wanted to say but immediately waved his hand to summon someone, “Come, take Young Miss Leyun away!”","Li Shihong’s personal guards responded, and they came up to pull her away.","However, after all, they were concerned about Li Leyun’s identity, and they didn’t dare to be hard on her. They hesitated a bit between actions, and it was just this little hesitation that allowed Li Leyun to take advantage of this gap.","Taking advantage of the guards showing their flaws, she jumped out from behind the Elders and ran directly behind the screen.","Everyone was caught off guard and didn’t react for a while.","It wasn’t until Li Leyun ran to Li Moying’s bathtub that Li Shihong saw it clearly, and his eyebrows were raised in anger, “You...you you...Li Leyun, what are you going to do?”","Li Yuntao also said: “Young Miss Leyun, come out quickly, the Young Master is not wearing any clothes now! As a woman who has not married, how can you run over by yourself?”","“Yes, Young Miss Leyun, come out quickly!”","The Elders all frowned, apparently very dissatisfied with Li Leyun’s behaviour.","Li Shihong couldn’t even imagine how his niece, who was always generous and demure, suddenly became like this? She actually ran behind the screen to see a young man’s body!","How inappropriate was this?","Even if he intended to let Li Leyun marry Li Moying, after all, the two haven’t been formally engaged yet, have they?","After hearing the words of several Elders, Li Leyun realized what she had done.","She really didn’t think that much just now, she just wanted to see what Li Moying’s situation was now.","She firmly believes that things are definitely not as simple as what Liu Buyan said just now, but there was no evidence. Maybe if she saw Li Moying’s situation with her own eyes, she could find some evidence.","But it didn’t occur to her that Li Moying would be undressed!","Li Leyun subconsciously wanted to back away, but as soon as her eyes came into contact with the almost perfect male body in the bathtub, she stared straight and couldn’t move her legs for a moment...","“What!!!”","While Li Leyun was in a daze, she suddenly felt someone pull her back hard!","Her attention was all on Li Moying, and she never expected to be attacked by someone.","This action immediately made her lose her balance and took several steps back!","Moreover, in the end, before she could stand firmly, she fell to the ground with her hands and feet facing the sky."]},{"number":3741,"title":"Chapter 3741 Face Slaps (8)","paragraphs":["3741 Face Slaps (8)","Li Leyun felt the pain on her back, as her head also hit the ground she also felt that her ears were buzzing.","She didn’t know how long it took, but she finally regained consciousness and realized what had just happened.","She quickly struggled to get up, and at the same time turned her head to see who suddenly grabbed her, and caused her to fall in such an embarrassing posture!","As a result, when she turned around, she met Huang Yueli’s face.","Li Leyun’s complexion suddenly changed, and her anger rushed to the top of her head, “You... damn girl, it’s you! How dare you sneak up on me from behind! Tell me clearly, what is your intention? Anxious to pull me away, and give me such a heavy hand! Second Uncle, you have to get justice for me! They obviously have guilt in their hearts, otherwise why would they do this?”","This scene happened so quickly that Li Shihong was a little dazed.","Knowing that Li Leyun screamed, the Elders came back to their senses and looked over in surprise.","Huang Yueli hid behind Liu Buyan with a face full of grievances, “Li... Young Miss Li, you... how could you say that about me? I just... just wanted to save your life! But you said I had guilt in my heart... ...”","“Save my life? Do you think I’m a fool? I’m alive and well, so I need you to save me? You clearly have a guilty conscience!”","Li Leyun consciously caught Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan’s tricks, and suddenly she didn’t feel any pain from her injuries, and pointed at Huang Yueli’s nose and cursed at her.","“Damned girl, damned Fox Vixen! Come and catch her!”","Huang Yueli looked aggrieved, “Young Miss Li, I’m really doing it for your own good! You don’t know that the herbs that Young Master Li used to take a bath are actually poisonous! Young Master Li has toxins in his body. It is normal to use poison to fight against poison, but if ordinary cultivators inhale too much, their meridians will soon be paralyzed and they may even die!”","“Huh, what??”","After hearing this, Li Shihong and the others present all became nervous.","“Divine Doctor Liu, are you serious?”","Liu Buyan hastily appeased everyone, and said: “Don’t worry, everyone. These medicinal materials are mainly effective on cultivators below the Dao Profound Realm. The Patriarch Li and the Elders are high enough to stand far away. As long as you take my detoxification pill, there won’t be any problems. But just now, Young Miss Li stood too close, and her cultivation level isn’t high enough. My Junior Sister was worried that something would happen, so ...”","Hearing these words, Li Shihong and the Elders heaved a sigh of relief at the same time.","“Since that’s the case, please remember to give us the detoxification pill.”","Liu Buyan nodded with a smile, “That’s natural!”","Li Shihong turned to Huang Yueli again, with a grateful expression on his face, “Young Miss Li, it’s really thanks to your quick response that you rescued my niece in time, otherwise, this girl would run around without knowing anything! She said something rude just now, and I’ll have to ask Young Miss Li to forgive her for my sake.”","As he said that, he glared at Li Leyun, who was still on the ground and couldn’t get up, “Leyun, if you still can’t get up, please apologise to Young Miss Li!”","“Second Uncle, you...you want me to apologise? It’s clear...it’s clearly this damned girl who did the trick...”","Li Leyun opened her mouth in disbelief.","She really wanted to stand up, but for some reason, no matter how hard she struggled, she couldn’t get up."]},{"number":3742,"title":"Chapter 3742 Face Slaps (9)","paragraphs":["3742 Face Slaps (9)","Her legs seemed to be filled with lead, they were so heavy that she couldn’t lift them up.","Li Leyun struggled a few times, but couldn’t stand up. She was so anxious that cold sweat broke out on her forehead.","However, in the eyes of Li Shihong and others, she looked like she was deliberately acting like a demon, lying on the ground and refusing to get up.","This time, Li Shihong became even more angry, and said angrily: “Li Leyun, why don’t you hurry up and get up for me? A majestic daughter of the Ancient God Clan, lying on the ground and rolling around, that’s no different from a shrew ? The face of the Cloudy Qilin Clan will be completely lost by you!”","“Second Uncle, I...I’m not...”","Li Leyun was so anxious that tears were about to fall. She tried her best to get up from the ground, but she couldn’t help it. Her whole body was squirming on the ground like a caterpillar, not to mention how embarrassing she looked.","The Elders showed disgusted expressions. They really didn’t want to admit that the woman in front of them who had no manners at all, was a heavenly genius of their Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Liu Buyan watched from the sidelines, and almost couldn’t hold back his laughter!","He couldn’t be more clear about the reason why Li Leyun was still squirming on the floor and couldn’t get up.","Since Huang Yueli’s cultivation base was higher than his, even he didn’t see what kind of mystery Huang Yueli had done.","However, he at least understood one thing. The main reason why Huang Yueli didn’t hold back and manipulated Li Leyun in front of Li Shihong and others must be because Li Leyun saw Li Moying’s naked body!","Liu silently took a peek at Huang Yueli, and sure enough, he saw his Junior Sister’s face was stern, and there was a hint of anger flashing in her beautiful bright eyes.","Liu Buyan shivered subconsciously.","His little Junior Sister was really angry!","He has a feeling that Li Leyun, a woman with no eyes, was going to be in trouble!","Seeing that Li Leyun refused to get up, Li Shihong was even more angry, and was about to ask the guards around him to drag her up.","At this moment, Huang Yueli stood up again and said, “Patriarch Li, I think Young Miss Leyun may not be willing to get up, it may be because she stayed by the tub for too long just now and has inhaled too much poisonous gas, that’s why she can’t stand up...”","Li Shihong was startled, then frowned and asked, “This...what can we do?”","Huang Yueli said: “Patriarch Li, please don’t worry, it’s a good thing Young Miss Leyun left the tub in time, even if she feels a little uncomfortable now, it shouldn’t be a serious problem, as long as it’s diagnosed and treated in time, I’ll go and help Young Miss Leyun and take a look.”","Li Shihong had a look of shame on his face when he heard the words, “Young Miss Li, you are so kind! Leyun was so ignorant, she slandered you just now, but you are still willing to treat her. Really... makes me feel so sorry! Then I will thank Young Miss Li first, your Senior Brother and you are the benefactors of our Cloudy Qilin Clan.”","Huang Yueli said calmly: “Patriarch Li is really too polite.”","Several Elders were also full of praise for Huang Yueli.","Especially seeing how calm she was, no matter whether others slandered her or praised her, she was always calm and composed, which made people secretly admire her.","How many top experts who have been famous for many years may not have such magnanimity!"]},{"number":3743,"title":"Chapter 3743 Face Slaps (10)","paragraphs":["3743 Face Slaps (10)","This Young Miss Li was really amazing!","Amid the admiration of everyone, Huang Yueli slowly walked to Li Leyun’s side and stopped.","Seeing Huang Yueli’s beautiful and refined face, Li Leyun glared at her fiercely, her eyes were bulging and looked as if her eyeballs were about to pop out.","No matter what Li Shihong and the others said, in Li Leyun’s heart, she had had already determined that Huang Yueli was not a good person!","Why did she pull her away to prevent her from being poisoned? Li Leyun didn’t believe it at all!","From her point of view, this amazingly beautiful woman must have dragged her down on purpose, trying to make a fool of her, and she clearly had no good intentions!","However, what Li Leyun couldn’t figure out was why a young Spirit Medicine Master could easily drag her who was already at the Heaven Realm exponent, so easily?","Li Leyun never dreamt that the girl in front of her was already stronger than her!","Therefore, she can only attribute it to the fact that she was dumbfounded by Li Moying just now, that’s why she stumbled and suffered such humiliation.","“Young Miss Leyun, how are you? I’ll help you up...” Huang Yueli said, reaching out her hand to Li Leyun.","She has a faint smile on her face, which looked very gentle to others, but in Li Leyun’s eyes, she had no good intentions at all!","Li Leyun dodged subconsciously, writhing on the ground, not wanting Huang Yueli to touch her.","She kept yelling, “Go away! Get the hell out of here! I don’t need your fake kindness!”","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, looking embarrassed, but said nothing.","Li Shihong couldn’t listen on any longer and said in a harsh tone, “Li Leyun, what are you talking about? How dare you talk to Young Miss Li like this?? She came to see you with good intentions and didn’t care about what you offended just now. Now you are still insulting people like this? You, you...you are really trying to ride on my head?! How can our Cloudy Qilin Clan have such an ignorant clansman like you?”","Li Shihong was so angry that he no longer held back.","He had always doted on Li Leyun, his niece, and rarely said such heavy words, but today he was really disappointed in Li Leyun!","All of Li Leyun’s deeds today were not at all like the noble daughter of a big clan.","Still facing Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli, the two benefactors of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, if this was known to outsiders, they would really be a joke.","Li Leyun was still dodging, but when she heard Li Shihong’s words, she couldn’t help but froze.","“Second Uncle, I really didn’t... didn’t mean to target her! Just now it was clearly this damned girl she...she...” Li Leyun became anxious and wanted to explain, but the more anxious she became, the more unclear she was. “She clearly pulled me down on purpose just now! She just wanted to see me make a fool of myself!”","But Li Shihong didn’t believe her nonsense at all, sneered, and said: “If you didn’t insist on running behind the screen, who would pull you? How could you fall down and make a fool of yourself? It’s clear that you have been seeking death on your own but someone saved you, yet you made it sound as if it was turned into harming you? If so...”","Li Shihong seemed to have made up his mind, and turned to Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, since my niece doesn’t appreciate it, I don’t need to trouble you anymore. Since she doesn’t want you to treat her illness, then there’s no need to. Since she doesn’t even know what’s good or bad and repays kindness with revenge...even if you heal her, it’s pointless!”"]},{"number":3744,"title":"Chapter 3744 Face Slaps (11)","paragraphs":["3744 Face Slaps (11)","When Huang Yueli heard this, her eyes widened in surprise.","Although she also felt that people like Li Leyun were used to repaying kindness with revenge, so saving her would be in vain.","However, it really surprised her that these words came out of Li Shihong’s mouth.","From this, she could ascertain that the Patriarch who had always doted on Li Leyun was extremely disappointed in her at this moment!","“But, this...”","Huang Yueli was amused in her heart, but her face was full of hesitation.","Li Shihong said: “Young Miss Li, you don’t have to make things difficult, this is my order! Even if this unappreciative one has suffered any damage in any way, it’s none of your business!”","When Li Leyun heard this, her head buzzed!","If, until just now, she still thought that she was the proud daughter of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Li Shihong’s niece, no matter what happened, the clan would forgive her, and they would eventually satisfy her request.","Only now did she truly understand what a dangerous situation she had pushed herself into today!","Li Leyun suddenly understood, and naturally she didn’t dare to continue creating a ruckus any longer and quickly shouted, “No! Don’t! Second Uncle, I know I was wrong, I really know that I was wrong! Please help me! Don’t leave me here! I... I really can’t move my legs!”","Seeing her like this, Li Shihong felt even more disgusted in his heart, and frowned, “I’m not a doctor, how can I save you? This is the unique prescription of Divine Doctor Liu and Young Miss Li, so naturally only they can treat you. Now everyone has been offended by you, if you want someone to treat you, you can only ask for forgiveness from the two of them.”","The expression on Li Leyun’s face suddenly froze, looking extremely funny.","She looked up at Huang Yueli, and saw a beautiful young girl standing not far away with an elegant demeanour, with a decent smile on her face.","It was in stark contrast to her lying on the ground covered in dust and her distorted expression.","A feeling of resentment welled up in her heart.","Obviously she should be the one who’s superior!","It’s obvious that the damned girl of the human race should be lying on the ground, and everyone sees it as a joke!","But why were things the other way around?","“It seems that Young Miss Leyun doesn’t intend to apologise. Then we won’t bother Divine Doctor Liu and Young Miss Li for treatment, and take her down first...” Seeing that Li Leyun was still hesitating, Li Shihong also lost his patience.","Li Leyun was so excited that she finally came to her senses and hurriedly shouted: “Don’t, don’t, don’t...Second Uncle, I really know I was wrong!”","She hurriedly turned to Huang Yueli, and shouted repeatedly: “Young Miss Li, I’m sorry, I apologise to you! I’m really sorry! I misunderstood you just now! But, I... I was just too worried about my fiancé... He has been in a coma for so long, and I was worried that something might happen to him again, so I was impatient, so I didn’t choose my words. I’m sorry, I’m really sorry!”","At this time, Li Leyun didn’t care about losing face anymore.","All she knew was that she couldn’t move her legs now, and she couldn’t be dragged out like a dead dog!","Now she has lost enough face in front of the elders. If she was seen by other clansmen, where will she put the face of Young Miss Leyun who had always been aloof!","If Li Zijun and the others find out, they will laugh out loud!","Moreover, seeing how confident Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli were, maybe only they could heal her leg..."]},{"number":3745,"title":"Chapter 3745 Face Slaps (12)","paragraphs":["3745 Face Slaps (12)","Seeing this, Li Shihong turned pale, but instead of pleading for Li Leyun, he said, “Hmph! Only now do you know that you are wrong? I’m afraid Young Miss Li might not forgive you! But, it’s your own fault! Don’t think I I don’t know what you did in Medial Arch City!”","Hearing this, Li Leyun shuddered all over again!","She also caused a lot of trouble at the Spiritual Armament Master Competition in Medial Arch City, and she lost all face of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","At that time, the two elders, Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai, were furious and made it clear that they would no longer support her as Li Moying’s fiancée.","!!","Later, if it wasn’t for her chance to follow Huang Sanbai and save the dying Li Moying, based on what she did in Medial Arch City, she would be severely punished when she came back, let alone being able to be engaged with Li Moying!","Now that Li Shihong was bringing up the old matter again, it probably means that he wants to cancel the engagement between the two...","It was only then that Li Leyun realized the seriousness of the matter, and she completely let go of her last thoughts about any calculations and face as she hugged Huang Yueli’s thigh, and kept begging, “Young Miss Li, please help me! I really know I was wrong! Both you and Divine Doctor Liu are benefactors of our Cloudy Qilin Clan. It is because of my dirty mind that I have wronged you two. I deserve to die, I deserve to die! No matter how you punish me, you can punish me! I... I apologise to you, to you... to kowtow to you!”","As Li Leyun said, she wanted to kneel on the ground and kowtow.","However, her legs were still immobile after all, she couldn’t even stand up, and it was even more impossible to get into a kneeling position.","After struggling a few times, but it didn’t work, she had no choice but to give up, turning over and knocking her head on the ground.","However, at the moment when her head was about to touch the ground, she was suddenly blocked by a burst of profound force.","Immediately, she heard Huang Yueli’s soft voice above her head, “Young Miss Leyun, what are you doing? We are just ordinary healers, and you are the daughter of the Ancient God Clan. We really do not deserve such courtesy. Please get up quickly, when did I say that I don’t want to heal you?”","It was Huang Yueli herself who stopped Li Leyun.","If it was in private, then Li Leyun kowtowed hundreds of times, and Huang Yueli wouldn’t even frown.","But now, after all, this was Amethyst Paramount Palace, and moreover they were still before the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Patriarch and many elders.","Huang Yueli knew that in this scene, even though Li Shihong had said harsh words and seemed to no longer care about Li Leyun’s life or death, in fact, in the eyes of these Cloudy Qilin Clan’s top clansmen, Li Leyun was still a member of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","If she really wants Li Leyun to kowtow to her hundreds of times, even though Li Shihong and the others won’t say anything now, it’s hard to guarantee that they will remember her in their hearts, and the loss outweighs the gain.","It’s better to just let her go.","In this case, not only will she appear magnanimous, but it will also make Li Leyun look even more despicable.","Sure enough, as soon as Huang Yueli’s words came out of her mouth, Li Shihong’s face showed guilt.","“Young Miss Li, you are really... so kind! This niece of mine has offended you like this, yet you are still willing to save her... Sigh, I’m the one who lacked on her discipline and have caused you trouble!”","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, “Patriarch Li, you are too polite. As doctors, saving lives and healing the wounded is what we should do.”","“Ugh...”","Li Shihong sighed and stared at Li Leyun, “Look at Young Miss Li and do some self reflection!”"]},{"number":3746,"title":"Chapter 3746 Face Slaps (13)","paragraphs":["3746 Face Slaps (13)","Li Shihong’s opinion of Huang Yueli had elevated in his heart, but at the same time, he was even more disappointed with Li Leyun.","Looking at Young Miss Li in front of him, she was much younger than Li Leyun in terms of age, but she was so knowledgeable and decent in dealing with people, that she is not far behind any first class noble daughters in the God Realm.","As for Li Leyun, although she claims to be one of the four beauties in the God Realm, what she has done today... can’t even match one of Young Miss Li’s finger!","After being told off by Li Shihong, Li Leyun was so angry that she almost fainted.","!!","If it were different, she would have jumped up long ago and whipped that bitch into pieces, but now, she could only bear it! She, Li Leyun, had never been so aggrieved in her life!","Li Leyun lowered her head, clenched her hands into fists tightly, her nails were deeply embedded in her palms, and only then did she hold back the anger in her heart.","But in her heart, her hatred towards Huang Yueli was already bone deep.","A stern look flashed in her eyes.","Damn girl, just wait for me! Sooner or later, I will reveal your true colours!","At this moment, the sound of footsteps approached, Huang Yueli stood in front of her again, knelt down, and with a concerned expression on her face, reached out and grabbed Li Leyun’s wrist.","“Let me see how Young Miss Leyun is doing now...”","Li Leyun subconsciously wanted to withdraw her hand, but somehow, Huang Yueli managed to grabqX r d her.","Li Shihong and the others thanked Huang Yueli repeatedly, and all kinds of praises were heard endlessly.","“Young Miss Li, we really have to thank you for today!”","“Young Miss Li not only has superb medical skills, but also acts so righteously. It’s really rare...”","Only Li Leyun herself, the moment Huang Yueli met her, her eyes suddenly widened and her face changed suddenly!","Because, at that time, she felt that a cold energy rushed into her meridians along Huang Yueli’s fingers in an instant!","Under the impact of this energy, the numbness in Li Leyun’s legs disappeared immediately, but what was replaced was a sharp pain!","It felt as if there were countless drills drilling into her bones, and the pain caused her to scream out aloud!","“Ah...! Ah...! It hurts! Damn girl, let me go! You want to kill me!”","Huang Yueli seemed to be frightened by her scream, and with a shake of her hand, she let go of Li Leyun.","Hearing such a strange scream, Li Shihong and the others were taken aback, and hurried over.","“Young Miss Li, what’s going on?”","“Is there something wrong with Young Miss Leyun’s body?”","“It must have been delayed for a long time just now, the poisonous gas has seeped into the meridians! This... can this be cured?”","With so many masters at the Dao Profound Realm present, none of them suspected that Huang Yueli had done something she shouldn’t have done. They all subconsciously believed that it was Li Leyun who inhaled too much poisonous gas, which caused such consequences.","Liu Buyan listened from the sidelines, he couldn’t help but be convinced by his Junior Sister’s ability!","Thinking about it, it took him a lot of effort to win Li Shihong’s complete trust.","And Huang Yueli managed so many elders with just a few words!","Huang Yueli looked worried, and said: “Young Miss Leyun’s physique is a little worse than I imagined, plus it took too long just now, that’s why the sudden pain is so sudden. But don’t worry, everyone, it’s actually painful. It’s a good thing, it’s better than nothing, which means it can definitely be cured, but it may take a long time.”"]},{"number":3747,"title":"Chapter 3747 Face Slaps (14)","paragraphs":["3747 Face Slaps (14)","Li Shihong and others heaved a sigh of relief.","“That’s good, that’s good! Young Miss Li, this time it’s all up to you! I really don’t know how to thank you...”","Li Leyun’s eyes went black from the pain just now, and she almost fainted.","It’s only now that she could barely adapt to the pain and was able to pay attention to the surrounding situation.","When she heard Li Shihong’s words, she almost vomited blood!","Just now, it was clear that that damned girl had secretly hurt her in the dark, and she was in such pain! Didn’t they see it? They actually believed that damn girl’s nonsense?!","What kind of mesmerising soup did the damned girl feed them?!","Li Leyun was puzzled and wanted to argue, “Second Uncle, you...don’t be fooled by her, she clearly..just now...”","However, Li Shihong and the elders had absolutely no intention of listening to her finish.","Li Shihong frowned after hearing the beginning, “Leyun, why are you so ignorant? You are in pain because you harmed yourself and inhaled the poisonous gas. Young Miss Li will treat you and can save you. Two legs are fine, and the pain is what you should suffer! It’s just some pain to cure it, and you still yell like this, do you still look like a cultivator?”","“Isn’t it? Young Miss Leyun, it’s just a little pain, just bear with it!”","“The young people nowadays are really not like us back then. We never uttered a word no matter how many injuries we had suffered! No wonder there are fewer and fewer geniuses in the clan in recent years. They are all spoiled!”","The Elders also echoed.","“I...”","Before Li Leyun could finish her sentence, she was stopped by all kinds of chatter, and she didn’t know how to defend herself for a while.","Everyone had already decided that she is making trouble for no reason by crying for pain!","And Huang Yueli was a very good person in their eyes!","Just when Li Leyun was feeling helpless, Huang Yueli’s voice sounded again, “Now I will treat Young Miss Leyun with acupuncture, but I must first remind everyone that although this poison can be used with the golden needles technique, however it forces out the poison from the meridians and this process is very painful, several times more painful than just now, in case Young Miss Leyun can’t bear it...”","Li Leyun didn’t even have time to express her opinion. Li Shihong snorted and interjected, “It’s just a little pain. There’s nothing she can’t bear! If she dares to yell there, she doesn’t deserve to be a member of our Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","After hearing this, Li Leyun’s face turned pale instantly!","What Li Shihong said was like a death sentence for her.","Those who haven’t experienced it can’t even imagine what happened to her just now.","Moreover, that damned girl also said that the treatment process was several times more painful than before, so... She couldn’t imagine what it would be like!","However, before Li Leyun had time to explain anything, Huang Yueli had already taken out a whole set of golden needles from her space, and squatted in front of her.","Looking at Huang Yueli’s slender, white and slender fingers, she picked up a long golden needle. The needle tip reflected the sunlight, making it look particularly dazzling.","Li Leyun’s eyes were so frightened that she passed out!","Everyone stared dumbfounded at Li Leyun, who was limp on the ground. They couldn’t believe that the majestic Cloudy Qilin Clan’s heaven ranked genius was so frightened that she fainted because sahe was afraid that the treatment would be too painful!","As a cultivator, this was really embarrassing!","Huang Yueli’s hand holding the needle did not tremble at all, and stabbed directly towards Li Leyun’s knee."]},{"number":3748,"title":"Chapter 3748 Face Slaps (15)","paragraphs":["3748 Face Slaps (15)","“Ouch–!”","Li Leyun let out another scream, and woke up from the coma!","Even Li Shihong and the others couldn’t bear the sound, their eyebrows trembled subconsciously.","Screaming so exaggeratedly, could it be...did it really hurt so much?","However, the movement of Huang Yueli’s hand did not stop at all, and immediately continued to prick the second needle.","Then the third needle, the fourth needle...","She moved very fast, and between rising and falling, phantoms even appeared in front of everyone’s eyes, and they could no longer clearly see her techniques.","At the same time, Li Leyun screamed one after another, and because Huang Yueli moved too fast, her screams obviously couldn’t keep up with the speed of her needles, so the screams were intermittent, it sounded awkward, it seemed that she might die at any time.","Li Leyun’s complexion also turned into a liver colour, her eyes were wide open, and she looked terrified.","Just when she was screaming hoarsely, Huang Yueli suddenly stood up and took a few steps back.","“Patriarch Li, I have finished the acupuncture.”","Li Shihong was still immersed in Li Leyun’s screams, his ears were still buzzing, his head was swollen and painful, and he hadn’t reacted yet.","“What... what? What did you say?”","Huang Yueli repeated it calmly: “Patriarch Li, most of the poisonous gas in Young Miss Leyun’s body has been eliminated, and the rest just needs to drink the medicine. In about ten days, her legs will be able to walk normally. However, I’m afraid her legs will still hurt for a while, and this is something I can’t solve.”","It was only then that Li Shihong came to his senses, with a look of surprise on his face, “This...the accupuncture has already been completed??”","After he asked the question, he suddenly thought of Huang Yueli’s lightning-fast movements just now, and he couldn’t help feeling a little bit of realization in his heart.","From Li Shihong’s perspective, it can still be seen that this Young Miss Li moved so fast, at least hundreds of needles have been administered just now.","It was enough to cure general illnesses.","But, how could her movements...how could she be so fast!","After Li Shihong understood it, he was shocked!","Even if he doesn’t know anything about Spirit Medicine Masters, at least he still has common sense. He still knows the level of a Spirit Medicine Master with such a fast speed.","Not only him, but also the elders behind Li Shihong, all of them were well-informed. Recalling the scene just now, all of them showed expressions of shock.","Originally, although they treated Huang Yueli with courtesy, most of them still looked at Liu Buyan’s face.","Since it was Liu Buyan who participated in the Spirit Medicine Master competition, and he was a Senior Brother, everyone subconsciously believed that Liu Buyan’s medical skills must be much higher than his Junior Sister.","His Junior Sister was just an assistant.","But now, Huang Yueli showed her tricks, and it shocked everyone who underestimated her!","It turns out that Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister was really outstanding in medical skills, not Liu Buyan’s exaggeration!","Liu Buyan was on the side, taking a panoramic view of the changes in everyone’s expressions, and shook his head amusingly.","His family’s Junior Sister did learn the technique of the golden needles in the lower realms in her early years, and she has a good talent and learned it very quickly.","However, after all, she is not very interested in medical skills and has been neglecting to practice, so this method was not enough in the God Realm.","If you want to say how high Huang Yueli’s medical skills are, it’s definitely a misunderstanding by Li Shihong and the others."]},{"number":3749,"title":"Chapter 3749 Face Slaps (16)","paragraphs":["3749 Face Slaps (16)","The reason why she acted so decisively was because Li Leyun’s condition was not a disease at all, but was injured by Huang Yueli’s evil qi.","So, instead of saying that Huang Yueli’s acupuncture just now was curing illnesses and saving lives, it would be better to say that she was randomly inserting needles.","Anyway, a few pricks won’t kill anyone.","It’s just that Li Leyun will suffer more.","However, this is what Li Leyun asked for, and it is not worthy of sympathy at all.","Li Shihong and the others obviously misunderstood. They looked at Huang Yueli more eagerly than before, and their attitude towards her was also extraordinarily enthusiastic.","“Young Miss Li... No no, Divine Doctor Li, thank you for saving my niece. I will write down this kindness, and it will be repaid in the future!”","With a smile on her face, Huang Yueli coped with it with ease, without any guilt at all.","After Li Leyun went through the torment just now, she was no longer able to chase after Huang Yueli and yell at her. She lay on the ground in a collapsed state, not even moving.","All the elders surrounded Huang Yueli, and they had already forgotten that there was a heavenly genius lying on the ground.","After a while, Li Shihong finally remembered his niece and hurriedly turned around to look.","Seeing this, he became a little worried again, “This... Doctor Li, what is Leyun’s situation now? What should we do?”","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, “Actually, Young Miss Leyun should be able to stand up already, but her meridians have been ravaged by poisonous gas, consuming too much profound strength and vitality, it’s best to let someone carry her back, let her rest and recuperate. As for the prescription of soup and medicine she needs to drink every day, I will send someone to deliver it later.”","“Alright, alright, that’s good, thank you Divine Doctor Li!”","After hearing this, Li Shihong immediately beckoned, and called a few guards over, telling them to quickly carry Li Leyun down.","He really couldn’t bear to watch it any longer. He wanted this niece to disappear from his eyes quickly.","Although Li Leyun was not reconciled, she still vividly remembered the way she cried and howled just now.","She was ashamed to stay here any longer. This time, she finally didn’t act like a monster and was carried away directly.","Li Shihong’s involvement with Li Leyun today can be regarded as a loss of face.","So, seeing that he was fine, he also planned to leave, “Divine Doctor Liu, Doctor Li, since there is nothing wrong, then I...”","Halfway through his speech, he suddenly heard a “squeak” sound from behind the screen, like the sound of water being splashed from a bathtub.","Li Shihong’s body froze suddenly.","Everyone in the room subconsciously looked behind the screen.","The next moment, they ran towards the bathtub in unison.","Liu Buyan said slowly from behind: “Hey, wait! Elders, don’t be in such a hurry, have you forgotten that the water in the tub is poisonous?”","Li Shihong and the others were already planning to fish out Li Moying. Hearing this, they quickly withdrew their hands, but stared at the young man in the bathtub with wide eyes.","“Divine Doctor Liu, just now... it was Moying who moved just now! He moved, didn’t he?”","Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli looked at each other before walking over together.","Liu Buyan said: “Young Master Li is the only one here. Naturally, the water in the bathtub will be splashed out because he moved a little, but...”","After listening to the first half of the paragraph, the elders already showed ecstatic expressions on their faces, but when they heard Liu Buyan’s “but”, they froze again"]},{"number":3750,"title":"Chapter 3750 Li Moying Awakens (1)","paragraphs":["3750 Li Moying Awakens (1)","“But what?” Li Shihong stepped forward and asked eagerly.","“However, this is just a natural body reaction after the toxins in his meridians have been reduced, not an action he made on his own...” Liu Buyan explained.","When Li Shihong heard this, he immediately seemed a little disappointed.","Liu Buyan smiled and said, “Patriarch Li, don’t be so nervous. Young Master Li’s injury cannot be recovered in a day or two, but after today’s treatment, he can move his fingers occasionally, which is a good sign. It will take some time, but he will definitely be able to return to its original state.”","Hearing this, Li Shihong and several elders let out a sigh of relief at the same time.","At this moment, seeing Li Moying move a little bit with their own eyes, even if it was just a finger twitch, it was enough to make everyone surrender to Liu Buyan’s medical skills.","Coupled with the fact that Huang Yueli also “showed her skills” just now, this made everyone trust and admire the medical skills of this pair of Senior Brother and Junior Sister even more.","“Divine Doctor Liu, I really don’t know how to thank you, and Divine Doctor Li...Thanks to the two of you, otherwise, I really don’t know who else would be able to save Moying...”","Li Shihong took Liu Buyan’s hand and thanked him and Huang Yueli in various ways.","When the elders saw the Patriarch, they all took the lead in showing favor, and they would not be stingy with compliments.","Compliments piled on one after another until even a thick-skinned person like Liu Buyan felt a little embarrassed.","Although he was confident that he will become one of the top Spirit Medicine Master in the God Realm in the future, but now, if he insists on saying that he was a genius doctor who crushes Heaven Elixir Pagoda, he really did not dare not boast about it.","Turning around to look again, his Junior Sister was really good, she had been watching from the side with her arms crossed, obviously watching all of the with relish.","Liu Buyan had no choice but to say: “Patriarch Li, don’t worry, Young Master Li’s illness is covered by me. It’s getting late today, Young Master Li still needs to focus on recuperation, and try not to have anyone else bother...”","Li Shihong knew the meaning after hearing him and immediately understood the meaning of Liu Buyan’s words.","He immediately stated: “Divine Doctor Liu, don’t worry, what happened today will not happen again! When I go back, I will definitely teach that girl a lesson, and I will also warn the clansmen, and no one will come to spy on the two doctors in the future. We won’t disturb Moying’s rest anymore, we will go back now, please take care!”","Li Shihong cupped his hands and left with a group of elders.","Only then did Liu Buyan look back at Huang Yueli, and said with a half smile but not a smile: “Junior Sister, you are really ruthless! Tsk tsk, didn’t that woman just glance at Li Moying, the colour of the potion in the tub is so dark, what can she even see? Yet you just torment others to such an extent!”","Huang Yueli gave him a blank look, and said dissatisfied: “Senior Brother, whose side are you on , huh? Of course, I punished her not only because of today’s events! You forgot, back then, she almost killed me! Based on this alone, she deserves what suffered.”","Liu Buyan suddenly realized, “I forgot about it. This woman is courageous enough. If she offends you, she won’t know how she will die in the future!”","After hearing this explanation, Liu Buyan thought he had misunderstood Huang Yueli, so he skipped this matter and continued to look at Li Moying’s situation.","What he didn’t notice was that behind him, Huang Yueli raised her chin arrogantly."]},{"number":3751,"title":"Chapter 3751 Li Moying Awakens (2)","paragraphs":["3751 Li Moying Awakens (2)","The last time, she was almost killed by Li Leyun, of course she had to take revenge.","However, Li Leyun saw her husband taking a bath today, and that was also unforgivable!","She was the only one who had the privilege to look at her husband, and if anyone else dares to take a look, just wait for her to cut that person into pieces!","...","!!","After Li Shihong went back, he really convened a meeting of the whole clan, calling together all members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the entire Amethyst Paramount Palace, and issued repeated orders, strictly prohibiting them from harassing the two genius doctors.","Although Li Shihong didn’t say anything about Li Leyun at the meeting, Amethyst Paramount Palace was so big that no news can be spread out of the family, but there were quite a few people who saw Li Leyun’s embarrassment at the scene that day and naturally, words Bagan to brew in the grapevine.","Even the Patriarch’s niece disobeyed the order and suffered such a big loss. Even if the others had their own ideas, they didn’t dare to act rashly.","In this way, Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli immediately relaxed.","From that day on, no one dared to wander around Li Moying’s hut anymore, and they didn’t have to spend so much time patrolling around.","However, just in case, Huang Yueli secretly modified some of the arrays near the hut, so that they would know in time if someone approached.","Every morning, Huang Yueli would rush to the hut to practice double cultivation with Li Moying.","In the beginning, she would go back to the residence in the evening, but as time went by, she became more and more lazy to travel back and forth. Later, she simply found a reason and stayed in the hut.","In the hut, besides the room where Li Moying lives, there were several other rooms, and Liu Buyan also lives here, so Li Shihong and others didn’t think too much about it, so they agreed to accept it, thinking that the pair of Senior Brother and Junior Sister were too reliable and responsible!","In order to treat Li Moying, he forgot to sleep and eat, he was simply a model figure among Spirit Medicine Masters! Compared with those genius doctors who demand money and are hard to find, it was a world of difference!","They actually suspected that the two of them were conspiring against them before, and deliberately sneaked into the Cloudy Qilin Clan under the pretext of treating illnesses. They were really ashamed to face the two genius doctors...","The members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan never thought that Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan were really plotting something against them!","What’s more, under their noses, they have defiled their Young Master!","One night seven days later, after taking a shower, Huang Yueli walked to Li Moying’s bed and stared at his peerless handsome face.","He had his his eyes closed tightly, his thin lips pursed lightly, and breathing slowly, as if he had only fallen asleep.","Huang Yueli’s slender fingers brushed over the man’s eyebrows, along the bridge of his tall nose all the way down, and landed on his thin, slightly white lips.","“Hey, Moying, why haven’t you woken up yet? It’s obvious that the evil qi in your body has almost been transformed?”","There was a silence in the room.","It was already dark, and no one would pass by around the hut.","Although Liu Buyan lives next door, he can’t hear anything because of the soundproof array around his room.","Except for a few intermittent bird calls, there was only silence.","Huang Yueli paused for a moment, then pouted her mouth suddenly, and said with great dissatisfaction: “Li Moying, you big liar! Didn’t you say it before? It’s easy to do that kind of thing, I don’t need to exert any effort , as long as you lie down obediently, you will do all the hard work! But now?”"]},{"number":3752,"title":"Chapter 3752 Li Moying Awakens (3)","paragraphs":["3752 Li Moying Awakens (3)","“I was really deceived by you! I’m so exhausted and you’re still pretending to be dead here!”","“Li Moying, I warn you! If you still look like a ghost tomorrow, then I will go on strike and quit!”","“Did you hear me??”","Huang Yueli was tired for several days, her back was sore, and she suddenly became irritable!","After she finished speaking, the room fell silent again.","For a while, Huang Yueli was not used to this kind of silence...","An environment that was too quiet would only make her feel even more how lonely and vulnerable she was at this moment.","However, her loneliness is not only because of the quietness at this time, but also because of the man beside her.","I don’t know when it started, as long as she left him, her heart seemed to be lost, she felt empty, and she couldn’t get any energy to do anything.","“Cough...”","In the room that was so quiet that you could hear a needle drop, there was a slight noise suddenly.","With a flick of her finger, Huang Yueli brushed across Li Moying’s cheek.","She widened her eyes and looked at Li Moying’s face.","However, to her disappointment, even though she had stared her eyes wide open, Li Moying was still the same as before, with his eyes tightly closed, looking pure and innocent, as if he had fallen asleep peacefully.","Huang Yueli sighed slightly, “What the hell was I thinking? How could he wake up so easily... It seems that I’m really going to go on strike tomorrow!”","While muttering, Huang Yueli reached out to Li Moying’s chest, trying to help him cover the quilt.","What she said about the strike was true.","However, it doesn’t mean that Li Moying should be left alone.","Now through the dual cultivation, she had almost cleaned up the evil qi in Li Moying’s body. If Li Moying does not wake up tomorrow, it can only mean that relying on the manual left by Saint Iniquitous Shadow alone could not completely cure him and they would also have to think of other ways to assist treatment.","This has to be treated by a proper doctor, and she couldn’t help much.","However, the moment Huang Yueli’s fingers touched Li Moying, she suddenly felt her warm body tremble.","The movements of her hands paused, but she thought that it was all an illusion.","Just when she was about to get up and leave, a voice suddenly sounded.","“No...not allowed... strike... strike...”","The voice was very soft, hoarse, and incoherent.","However, that deep and magnetic voice was still so familiar to Huang Yueli, so familiar that when she heard this voice, she suddenly turned around.","She ran back to Li Moying’s bedside in one stride, and got on top of him.","“Moying, Moying, you really spoke just now, didn’t you? Are you awake??”","The man on the bed still didn’t move.","But this time, Huang Yueli did not look away, still staring at his handsome and pale face for a moment, even stopped breathing for a few breaths, waiting patiently.","Amidst Huang Yueli’s pounding heartbeat, Li Moying’s eyelashes trembled slightly, and he slowly opened his eyes.","When the familiar eyes looked back at her, Huang Yueli couldn’t help covering her mouth, her whole body began to tremble with excitement.","Li Moying had been lying down for too long, and seemed to be very uncomfortable with the outside light. Although there were only a few dim oil lamps in the room, he still squinted his eyes subconsciously."]},{"number":3753,"title":"Chapter 3753 Li Moying Awakens (4)","paragraphs":["3753 Li Moying Awakens (4)","After a while, he opened his eyes again, and immediately his eyes fell on Huang Yueli’s face.","The two looked at each other.","Huang Yueli bit her lip, staring blankly at the man in front of her, unable to speak for a moment.","After Li Moying paused for a few breaths, his hoarse voice sounded again, “Little...Little Li’er, you...why are you crying?”","“You... What did you say? I didn’t cry...” Huang Yueli replied subconsciously.","However, when she raised her hand to touch her cheek, she felt that they were wet.","It turned out that when Li Moying woke up just now, she was so excited that she cried directly, but she didn’t realize it herself.","Seeing his little fox’s pitiful and stupid look with red eyes and dark under eye circles, Li Moying’s heart throbbed violently.","In fact, during this period of time, although he has been affected by evil qi, his whole body seems to be paralyzed from the inside to the outside, and he can’t move at all. In the later stage, even his consciousness was a little blurred.","However, he still has a general understanding of the outside world.","Especially after Huang Yueli taught him the exercises, as the evil qi accumulated in his body gradually turned into usable profound energy, his consciousness became clearer and clearer.","Especially when Huang Yueli was with him, his feelings would become very clear.","It’s just that, apart from being able to cooperate with Huang Yueli with instinct to direct the qi, it was even more difficult for him to do something else than ascend to the sky.","No matter how hard Li Moying tried, if he couldn’t move, he couldn’t move.","However, just now, when he heard that his family’s Little Li was about to go on “strike”, for some reason, Li Moying’s head buzzed, he just felt that he didn’t want her to give up so easily.","His little fox took the initiative to approach him!","When he wanted to hook up with his own little fox before, he had to coax him in every possible way. All the reasons were exhausted. When she was in a bad mood, she would kick him aside and go on strike!","Li Moying was anxious to refute, but in the end...","I don’t know why, but at that moment, the shackles that had been imprisoning him suddenly disappeared.","There was a sound in his throat!","Immediately afterwards, under Huang Yueli’s touch, his heavy body began to become lighter...","“Little Li’er...”","Li Moying’s peach blossom eyes flashed with gentle warmth, and she wanted to raise her hand to wipe away the tears on his little fox’s face.","However, he only lifted his hand up an inch, and he couldn’t lift it up any further.","A trace of frustration flashed in Li Moying’s eyes, and he almost wanted to scold himself!","A peerless genius like him has always been unparalleled on weekdays. It is rare that he is so weak that he can’t even wipe his wife’s tears away!","His movements did not escape Huang Yueli’s eyes.","Seeing the annoyed look on the man’s handsome face, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but burst into tears.","“Alright, don’t waste your energy in vain. Lay down obediently, you are my man now, you have to do whatever I ask you to do, and it’s impossible to resist, understand?”","Huang Yueli curled her lips into a smile, and patted Li Moying’s handsome face flirtatiously.","Seeing him wake up, Huang Yueli’s mood immediately changed for the better. It changed from a violent storm to a clear sky!","She even felt as if she was taking liberties with Li Moying."]},{"number":3754,"title":"Chapter 3754 Li Moying Awakens (5)","paragraphs":["3754 Li Moying Awakens (5)","Speaking of which, she was usually led around the nose by Li Moying. This man’s personality was too strong, and it’s rare that he was so obedient! She found this very novel and interesting.","At this time, Huang Yueli had completely forgotten who was complaining just now that she was too tired and wanted to go on strike.","Li Moying’s eyes sank, and the light in his eyes flickered, staring at the little fox in front of him.","Huang Yueli was in a good mood, and she didn’t realize at all that her husband had already revealed his innermost thoughts and was planning how to savour her after he recovered.","She leaned in front of Li Moying, put her hands on his neck, and looked at the man carefully from top to bottom.","Although Li Moying was already awake, she was still a little worried. After all, he had been in a coma for so long, and she didn’t know what the sequelae would be.","After a while, she finally confirmed that Li Moying seemed to be in good condition.","At least there is no problem with his consciousness anymore, and his consciousness was fully awake.","Huang Yueli hooked the corners of her mouth, lowered her head and kissed him lightly on the lips.","Li Moying’s whole body was shocked by this extremely slight touch!","During this period of time, the two practiced together every day. Although Li Moying was unconscious, his body had already instinctively adapted to Huang Yueli’s approach. When the girl approached him, the evil qi in Li Moying’s body was also drawn at the same time. .","The moment Huang Yueli approached, she frowned slightly.","She also clearly felt the bond between the two of them.","This... What’s going on here?","Realizing that the situation was wrong, Huang Yueli didn’t dare to continue taking liberties with her husband anymore, so she hurriedly used her willpower to prop herself up and backed away.","“Little Li’er, you...you come back!”","Noticing that the gentle feeling had gone away suddenly, Li Moying’s body froze.","He subconsciously dragged Huang Yueli back to him.","But...","The stiff body only moved a little bit, and then it became extremely heavy, unable to move any further...","Li Moying slumped down on the bed, his face turned livid, and he almost cursed out loud!","Don’t play with him like this!","For more than a month, he’s been lying on the bed like a disabled person, but he’s awake, but he still can’t move at all? Even if the beloved woman is right in front of him, can he just watch helplessly? Can’t even touch her?","Huang Yueli hid all the way to the other side of the room before stopping, looked at Li Moying from a distance, and cleared her throat.","“Ahem...that...husband, are you feeling a little uncomfortable? That’s... well, that’s a normal reaction after practicing the technique of Saint Iniquitous Shadow. You don’t have to worry about it. It will be fine...”","“Saint Iniquitous Shadow? Who are you talking about?” Li Moying frowned upon hearing this, showing a bit of puzzlement.","When he was in a coma, Huang Yueli and he were still in the process of opening the entrance to the secret realm. Later, he was rescued by members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and he did not see the scene where Huang Yueli fell into the secret realm next.","So, he didn’t know until now that he was able to wake up mainly because the techniques in the manual left by Saint Iniquitous Shadow were too effective.","Huang Yueli cleared her throat, and briefly described the series of things that happened after Li Moying fell into a coma.","The more he listened, the angrier he got as the scowl on his face became more and more intense. In the end, he couldn’t control the rising anger at all.","If it wasn’t for the limitations of his physical condition, he would have jumped up from the bed directly."]},{"number":3755,"title":"Chapter 3755 Li Moying Awakens (6)","paragraphs":["3755 Li Moying Awakens (6)","“Damn Li Leyun, how dare she do such a thing to you!”","“Hmph! There’s also Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai! I respect them as the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Even if they were rude to you, I didn’t want to tear faces with them. I didn’t expect them to be so cruel and merciless. They wanted to kill you while I was unconscious!”","Li Moying had just recovered from a serious illness, and his body had only recovered a little.","However, he was so angry by such news that he spat out a mouthful of blood!","Huang Yueli was startled when she saw the blood on the corner of his mouth, and quickly ran back, reaching out to grab his wrist to take his pulse. “Moying, what’s wrong with you? Don’t be angry, I’m standing here properly now, aren’t I? In fact, they can’t really be considered to have tried to kill me, but they just refused to save me. I am not from the Cloudy Qilin Clan. So, even if they did this, I can understand! Alright, alright, don’t be angry, otherwise, I won’t tell you anything in the future!”","Li Moying looked at his little fox’s big watery eyes, and they looked so mesmerizing.","He could only take a deep breath, and forced himself to suppress the anger in his heart.","“Alright, alright, I’m calm, I’m not angry...”","The anger on his face gradually subsided, and his breathing became steady again.","Huang Yueli was most worried about his condition. Seeing that his symptoms seemed to have alleviated a lot, she felt a little more at ease, and began to take his pulse seriously again.","Because of this, she missed the flash of killing intent in Li Moying’s eyes!","How could he not be angry if they dared to plot against his beloved Little Li’er? It was about his beloved woman, no one could easily appease his anger, even Huang Yueli pleading for mercy was useless!","Now that she was married to him, she was his, and no one can hurt his woman.","Huang Yueli checked him properly from head to toe and finally let out a sigh of relief when she ascertained that Li Moying seemed to be fine.","However, she didn’t have much confidence in her medical skills, so she thought for a while and said, “Moying, Senior Brother Liu lives next door. You just woke up, so I don’t know if there will be any other problems. I’d better invite him over to check you properly!”","“Senior Brother Liu? You mean... Liu Buyan?” Li Moying asked.","Huang Yueli nodded, “Yes!”","Li Moying subconsciously frowned.","In fact, he has heard Liu Buyan’s voice while in a coma for the past few days, and knows that he should be in the Amethyst Paramount Palace right now. However, thinking of Liu Buyan getting along with his beloved Little Li’er every day when he was unconscious, it made him a little uncomfortable.","“Wait, you haven’t finished talking just now! What happened after you left the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow? When did you meet Liu Buyan? How did he come to the God Realm? Huh? You brothers and sisters haven’t seen each other for so long, and now you can meet again in the God Realm, it must be a feeling of encountering an old friend in a foreign land, right?”","When Huang Yueli heard the sour tone, she couldn’t help being taken aback.","She subconsciously turned her eyes to Li Moying’s face, and she saw his sullen and handsome face, his thin lips were slightly pursed, and the word “I’m jealous” was written all over his face.","Huang Yueli pretended to be deep and said: “Well, what you said is absolutely right! The moment I saw Senior Brother, I was so touched! After all, I wanted to save you, but I couldn’t even enter the Amethyst Paramount Palace. There was no one around me who can discuss it! The appearance of Senior Brother really helped me a lot!”"]},{"number":3756,"title":"Chapter 3756 Li Moying Awakens (7)","paragraphs":["3756 Li Moying Awakens (7)","The more Li Moying listened, the darker his face became.","Obviously he’s the one who has been with his Little Li’er the longest!","He’s the one who will step forward to protect Little Li’er every time she encounters danger!","However, this time, he actually passed out at a critical moment, and he had been in a coma for so long, making Liu Buyan the savior in Huang Yueli’s eyes!","!!","Did he make a mistake?","Liu Buyan, besides his medical skills, was there anything else that can be compared with him?","Things aside, Little Li’er was already his wife, and he was the rightful husband!","Other men, whether they were seniors or juniors, can only scram !","Li Moying glanced at his wife’s pretty face, and said coolly: “Well, Liu Buyan has helped you a lot, then you should hurry up and thank him, there’s no need to look at me, an immobile person!”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but laugh even more.","When Li Moying heard that she was still laughing, his face became even more ugly. He deeply felt that his little fox didn’t love him anymore, so she would praise other men in front of him.","Thinking of this, he closed his eyes and prepared to stop talking to Huang Yueli.","But who knew, at this moment, there was a soft touch on his face.","This feeling was simply like...","Li Moying suddenly opened his eyes, and saw his little fox crawling back to the bed at some point, smiling sweetly at him.","“Are you jealous?”","“No!” Li Moying flatly denied it.","Jealous?","Why would he be jealous?","Liu Buyan can’t even touch his woman with a single finger. Of course there was no need to be jealous!","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “It’s good if you’re not jealous. We have to thank Senior Brother because he won the first place in the competition for me, allowing me to enter the Amethyst Paramount Palace to see you! Otherwise, the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s guard is so tight, I can’t get in!”","Hearing this, Li Moying suddenly looked like a cat whose fur had been smoothed out, and his stiff face immediately softened.","“Really? Then... just let it be that he really deserves credit!”","Huang Yueli looked at his arrogant and hard-spoken face, and felt amused in her heart, and didn’t want to tease him anymore, so she simply said: “Actually, Senior Brother has already thought about it now, he has no intention of pursuing me, you don’t have to look at him so warily each time...”","“Did he tell you that?” Li Moying raised his eyebrows slightly.","Huang Yueli nodded, “That’s right, he said it himself! He will come with me to save you, that’s to treat you as a good brother, don’t be cruel to him, you know?”","Huang Yueli looked at her husband eagerly.","In fact, she has always had a little regret in her heart. She feels that Liu Buyan and Li Moying turned against each other because of her. If possible, she very much hopes that the two can reconcile as before, back to when they first met.","And now was a very good opportunity, as long as Li Moying can cooperate a little...","Li Moying glanced at her and let out a “hmm”, neither confirming nor denying.","Although his family’s little Li’er was usually shrewd and capable, but in terms of feelings, she was really simple! She doesn’t understand men at all!","Only a man can understand the secret feelings in another man’s heart.","Maybe Liu Buyan was telling the truth, he had already given up competing with him for Huang Yueli, but that was only because Huang Yueli was already married to him."]},{"number":3757,"title":"Chapter 3757 Li Moying Awakens (8)","paragraphs":["3757 Li Moying Awakens (8)","Liu Buyan didn’t even have a chance to fight.","Since that’s the case, it’s better to just pretend to be more magnanimous, so that next time there won’t be any trouble in the future.","As for whether Liu Buyan really doesn’t like Huang Yueli...","After liking her for so long, it’s simply impossible to let her go so casually.","It’s nothing more than forcing himself to try not to delve into it, and then hypnotizing himself that they were just siblings...","However, Liu Buyan saved him after all this time, and Li Moying couldn’t say anything, so he could only acquiesce to Huang Yueli’s proposal of reconciliation.","Huang Yueli knows her husband very well, if he reacted this way, it meant that he agreed.","So, she happily leaned over and kissed Li Moying’s face again, “Husband, you are so kind! I like you the most!”","Like him the most...","Hearing such a confession from his own little fox, Li Moying’s heart couldn’t help thumping, and at the same time, the evil qi in his body began to churn again.","Huang Yueli originally wanted to continue taking liberties with her husband, but at this moment, she keenly felt that Li Moying’s breathing became heavier...","Shocked, she quickly jumped off the bed.","Li Moying looked at her swift movements and was left speechless.","There was never a moment when he hated his current state of being unable to move so much!","The meat delivered to the mouth just spread its wings and flew away! There was nothing more depressing than this!","Huang Yueli blushed, looking at Li Moying’s wolf-like gaze, she couldn’t help but feel guilty and scared, she thought about it, and said quickly: “Uh...that...what did you just say? Oh, By the way, let Senior Brother come to see you! You just lie down and wait, I will call someone right away!”","“No need, I’m fine, you go back...”","Halfway through his words, Huang Yueli had already disappeared at the door, leaving him staring depressedly.","How could Li Moying want to meet her love rival? He’s still a “Senior Brother” who can’t be driven away or offended!","He just woke up from a coma. What he wants to do the most was to kiss his little fox. Even if the little fox was embarrassed to continue with the past few day’s initiative, at least they could still talk for a while!","In the end, just because he couldn’t control his body’s reaction, he scared the little fox away?","Why were the techniques of Saint Iniquitous Shadow so overbearing!","Not long after, Huang Yueli brought Liu Buyan back alongside.","As soon as Liu Buyan entered the door, seeing Li Moying’s dark but handsome face, not only was he not intimidated by his might like the others, but he even smiled.","“Hey, are you awake? I never thought that you would be seriously injured one day! You have been in a coma for so long! If you don’t wake up again, I suspect that my family’s little Junior Sister would be a widow after a few years of marriage!”","His little Junior Sister!","Hearing these words, Li Moying’s face turned even darker.","What did he mean by his?!","Little Li’er obviously has a husband! In addition, why do cats and dogs have the nerve to claim to be members of her family?","Li Moying wanted to warn Liu Buyan, but when she glanced out of the corner of her eye, he saw Little Li’er staring at him with wide-eyed eyes.","Under the gaze of those bright eyes, Li Moying couldn’t speak harsh words at all, and swallowed the threatening words automatically.","“I’m really sorry, my life is very hard, and it’s not easy to die! Besides, I’m a man with a little wife at home. If I want to fulfill my responsibilities as a man, I don’t dare to die outside.”"]},{"number":3758,"title":"Chapter 3758 One Month (1)","paragraphs":["3758 One Month (1)","Although there was no way to threaten Liu Buyan, Li Moying didn’t intend to let Liu Buyan go so easily, so he simply showed his affection.","As he spoke, he looked at Huang Yueli affectionately.","That means, did you see it? I have a little wife! Are you envious?","Feeling envious was right!","For a beautiful and smart girl like Little Li’er, it’s normal for many people to like her, but sorry, she’s taken!","Liu Buyan heard the words, and the corners of his mouth twitched uncontrollably.","He finally understands that a leopard never changes its spots and even if Li Moying ascended to the God Realm, he was still Li Moying!","As long as he sees Huang Yueli, he will transform into a clingy jealous king with a strong desire to possess, and will be jealous in all sorts of ways.","However, Li Moying didn’t feel that he was wrong at all. After all, Liu Buyan’s attitude towards him was not very polite.","Huang Yueli was quite speechless when she heard that they had started again, so she hurried out to smooth things over.","“Alright, alright, I know you haven’t seen each other for two years, and you miss each other very much, but now is not the time to reminisce about the old days. Senior Brother, you should hurry up and get my husband’s pulse. He has been in a coma for so long, and I don’t know what’s wrong... ...”","Only then did Liu Buyan walk over slowly, sat down on the edge of Li Moying’s bed, and reached out to grab Li Moying’s wrist.","Li Moying also wanted to recover as soon as possible, so he didn’t continue and lay down without moving in a cooperative manner.","Of course, he couldn’t hide if he wanted to.","Liu Buyan put his finger on Li Moying’s wrist, and after a long time, he didn’t speak.","Huang Yueli originally thought that Li Moying’s body should be fine, and it was just a formality to find Liu Buyan, but now, seeing Liu Buyan’s expression, she became more and more nervous.","“Senior Brother, how is Moying doing? Why haven’t you spoken for so long?”","Liu Buyan sighed slightly, and said in a deep tone: “Right now... I still don’t see anything, I want to ask Young Master Li a few questions first.”","Li Moying frowned, originally he didn’t want to pay attention.","However, Huang Yueli immediately nodded, “Alright, brother, you can ask!”","“Do you still feel dizzy now? Can you see things clearly?” Liu Buyan asked.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and stared nervously at the man on the bed, forcing him to answer: “No problem. I am very conscious and can see very clearly, but my body can’t make large movements. There is an indescribable numbness all over the body.”","“Is that so...”","Liu Buyan pondered for a moment, then with his right hand, he took out a few golden needles.","He clamped one of the two-inch long golden needles between his fingers, and stabbed it towards the acupuncture point on Li Moying’s chest!","“Uh...huh!”","Li Moying couldn’t help letting out a muffled groan, which sounded a bit painful.","Huang Yueli immediately became worried, leaned over and asked, “Senior Brother, you... what are you doing? Moying... seems very uncomfortable!”","Liu Buyan frowned and glanced at her, dissatisfied: “This is just treating a disease, I always have to figure out whether he is sensitive to external stimuli, and the degree of paralysis before we can make a further diagnosis, right? ”","“But...then you can’t...” Huang Yueli pouted, still a little dissatisfied.","Don’t think she can’t see it, the place where Liu Buyan pricked the golden needle just now was one of the twelve pain points on the human body!"]},{"number":3759,"title":"Chapter 3759 One Month (2)","paragraphs":["3759 One Month (2)","If ordinary people were stabbed like this, they would probably scream so hard that the roof would be blown off on the spot!","Even a person like Li Moying couldn’t help but groan just now.","You know, for Li Moying, even if he had been cut with a knife, he might not even frown, let alone make a sound.","Liu Buyan said: “I know, that’s the pain point. But, isn’t he paralyzed, saying he doesn’t feel anything? Of course I’m going to start testing the most sensitive point! If there is no response to his pain point, then He’s really screwed! Now he’s feeling it, and that’s a good thing.”","Liu Buyan rushed to speak before Huang Yueli.","This way, everything Huang Yueli wanted to say was blocked back.","Although Huang Yueli also knew that Liu Buyan was intentionally making things difficult for Li Moying, but what he said was really reasonable, and Liu Buyan was the only real Spirit Medicine Master among the three of them. When it came out of his mouth, no one could question it.","Huang Yueli wanted to blame him, but couldn’t find a reason.","In the end, she had no choice but to sit beside Li Moying’s bed in person, and while staring at him with wide eyes, she warned Liu Buyan, “I don’t care, anyway, you can’t hurt Moying anymore! There are so many ways to test and it’s not limited to stimulating the pain point!”","Seeing this, Liu Buyan could only raise his hands and feet in surrender, “Alright, alright, if you don’t like this method, I’ll change it to a gentler one, alright?”","Seeing Huang Yueli’s demeanor of protecting her husband, Liu Buyan also knew that he couldn’t please her, so he had to accept it.","His little Junior Sister really only has Li Moying in her eyes...","Looking at Li Moying’s smug eyes, he really doesn’t look like a person who has just been pricked in pain, it’s almost like a cat that has just been groomed!","Tsk, it’s an eyesore!","However, no matter how intrusive it was, he had no other choice. Liu Buyan, who didn’t dare to make his Junior Sister angry, could only bypass the pain point and check carefully.","Soon, he probed all the main acupuncture points on Li Moying’s upper body.","Next, when Liu Buyan turned his target to Li Moying’s waist, his movements suddenly stopped.","Because, even through his clothes, he clearly felt that there was something wrong with Li Moying’s body reaction...","Just now, the acupoints he pierced with the golden needles were very normal. There was absolutely no intention to torture Li Moying. Of course, it is even less likely to have an aphrodisiac effect.","But Li Moying suddenly...","Damn it! No way? ?","Liu Buyan’s first reaction was that he almost jumped up from the edge of the bed!","Li Moying wouldn’t suddenly change his preference after being in a coma, and become fond of men, right?","But at this moment, he suddenly felt a chill behind him...","As soon as Liu Buyan turned his head, he met Li Moying’s gloomy gaze, a handsome man with a warning look in his eyes...","Liu Buyan came back to his senses all of a sudden, and turned to look at the little Junior Sister who was sitting on the edge of the bed.","Huang Yueli looked worried, and kept looking at Li Moying’s face, holding a small handkerchief in her hand, wiping Li Moying’s sweat.","With her gentle and virtuous appearance, no one could tell that this was the very same person who kills without blinking an eye when provoked.","Liu Buyan was slapped with public display of affection again.","When he was about to choke to death, he finally realized that something was wrong.","When Huang Yueli was wiping her sweat, her slender fingers would slide across Li Moying’s face and neck from time to time."]},{"number":3760,"title":"Chapter 3760 One Month (3)","paragraphs":["3760 One Month (3)","And every time Huang Yueli’s skin touches Li Moying’s, Li Moying’s body will subconsciously tense up.","He was so sensitive to Huang Yueli’s touch!","Liu Buyan was surprised, but after a little thought, he understood.","“Ahem, Junior Sister, I found out that after Li Moying woke up this time, there is indeed something wrong with his body...”","Upon hearing this, Huang Yueli became obviously worried, “What? How did this happen? Senior Brother, what happened to him?”","Li Moying saw at a glance that Liu Buyan had no good intentions, and immediately said: “Really? Why don’t I feel that there is something wrong with me? I’m obviously fine! Even if my body is stiff, it’s just that the evil qi has not been completely transformed. This will be cured in a few days. I know my own body best, and I don’t need some half-assed Spirit Medicine Master to diagnose it!”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she immediately gave him a dissatisfied look.","“Lie down obediently and don’t interrupt! Are you still fine? If you are really fine, you won’t be lying here unable to move! Don’t you need a Spirit Medicine Master to see you? Alright, if you have the ability, you can do it right now. Get off the bed and take a few steps, as long as you can reach the door, you win!”","Li Moying stared at his little fox with an ugly expression.","Even walking to the door? Little Li’er clearly knew that it was impossible for him to get out of bed now!","Wasn’t this obviously trying to embarrass him?","Thinking of this, he looked at Liu Buyan again, and his gaze became even more hostile.","It’s this guy, it wasn’t enough to destroy him and Little Li’er in the lower realm, but he even followed them to the God Realm! Why does his Little Li’er still trust him so much?","Seeing Li Moying’s aggrieved look, Huang Yueli patted his face reassuringly, “Alright, you don’t want to stay in bed all the time, do you? Only by obediently seeing a doctor can you heal faster. I’m still waiting to talk to you about going to the God Realm’s Grand Meet together!”","Her actions and tone was like coaxing a child, not only did she fail to comfort Li Moying, but made him even more aggrieved.","Liu Buyan saw it, coughed twice, and said proudly: “Alright, Junior Sister, don’t talk about it, some people are so childish, I won’t care about them!”","...childish!","Li Moying’s complexion turned even darker. Seeing that he was about to explode, Liu Buyan wisely spoke at the right time and changed the subject.","“Alright, don’t talk about this, Junior Sister, let’s further examine Li Moying’s condition!”","“Ah, yes, Senior Brother, tell me quickly, what’s wrong with him?” Huang Yueli’s attention was suddenly diverted from Li Moying.","Liu Buyan glanced at Li Moying, and slowly said: “Well, this... Junior Sister, you have been using the method of double cultivation to help Li Moying transfer the evil qi in his body, so now that he was awake, was it possible? Have you studied the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” by yourself?”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect him to ask this, she froze for a moment, then nodded, “Of course.”","With Li Moying’s comprehension, it would probably take less than two days to use the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” freely.","Liu Buyan nodded and said, “Well, starting tomorrow, teach him the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual!”","“What?”","Huang Yueli was startled when she heard the words, she didn’t expect Liu Buyan to mention this.","It would definitely be fine to hand over the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” to Li Moying, but after this period of double cultivation, Huang Yueli had already forgotten about that manual."]},{"number":3761,"title":"Chapter 3761 One Month (4)","paragraphs":["3761 One Month (4)","Because, the effect of this dual cultivation method was really great!","Although Huang Yueli still had some psychological barriers to the dual cultivation method at the beginning, after seeing the effect of it, even she couldn’t help but admit that the dual cultivation method was indeed much more effective than one person’s cultivation!","Not only Li Moying, but even her own strength had improved rapidly.","Now there are even faint signs of breaking through to the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm.","Seeing Huang Yueli’s expression, Liu Buyan guessed something.","“Let me just say it straight! Li Moying’s current situation is actually not good. Although the double cultivation method works very well at the beginning, it is very effective, but in fact, it is harmful to his body. His meridian has been severely eroded by evil qi, so he can’t get too excited. However, during the process of your dual cultivation, it is impossible for him to remain calm...”","Liu Buyan spoke vaguely, but the meaning in the words was already very clear.","For Li Moying, the double cultivation of two people was not beneficial.","Huang Yueli frowned, and immediately realized that her initial thinking was a bit too simple.","“So it’s like this, it’s all because I didn’t pay attention... Then what’s the condition of Moying’s body now? Can it be remedied?”","Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying, with a guilty look on her face.","After all, her accomplishments in medicinal skills were not good enough. She only thought that the evil qi in Li Moying’s meridians could be transformed quickly, but she didn’t consider other things at all...","If Li Moying was really harmed because of this, then she would really regret it!","Li Moying saw his little fox’s sombre expression, he immediately felt distressed, “Little Li’er, don’t listen to Liu Buyan’s nonsense, he just deliberately made things serious to scare you! In fact, even if dual cultivation is damaging, however the advantages outweigh the disadvantages, otherwise I wouldn’t even be able to wake up!”","As he said that, he still narrowed his eyes and gave Liu Buyan a menacing look.","Liu Buyan really never forgets to hold him back!","Originally, after he woke up, the little fox was reluctant to get too close to him because of her shyness, so she ran away after just kissing him!","Now that Liu Buyan still said such a thing, what if the little fox really refuses to let him touch her?","However, whatever you are afraid of, come here!","Liu Buyan didn’t seem to be afraid of Young Master Li’s stern gaze, which was enough to intimidate all directions. Not only did he not take Li Moying’s warning hint seriously at all, but he continued to speak calmly.","“Scaring you? Hehe, it’s best that I’m scaring you! But in fact, with your current physical condition, if you continue like this, not only will your cultivation level fail to improve, but you may even be in danger of going mad!”","Huang Yueli immediately said: “Senior Brother, I understand! Starting tomorrow, I will hand over the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” to Moying, and let him practice by himself.”","Li Moying’s face was so dark it couldn’t be darker.","What Little Li’er said clearly meant that she would never double cultivate with him again!","The food brought to its mouth was really about to fly away now!","He first gave Liu Buyan a glare but when he turned to Huang Yueli, he immediately changed into a pitiful expression.","“Little Li’er, don’t listen to his scaremongering. How could I go mad? You know my talent and cultivation. I can handle this little problem...”","However, to Huang Yueli, Li Moying’s body was the most important."]},{"number":3762,"title":"Chapter 3762 One Month (5)","paragraphs":["3762 One Month (5)","It was about his body, no matter what Li Moying said, she couldn’t just give in like this.","Therefore, she hardened her heart and ignored Li Moying’s expectant eyes.","“No way! How can you do this? You don’t even care about your own body? Anyway, you can’t move now if you want to, so you should be obedient!”","“But, Little Li’er, I didn’t disregard my body! It’s obvious that dual cultivation has the best recovery effect on my body, and I am the one who knows it best. Don’t listen to Liu Buyan...”","“No, don’t be so self-willed. As a patient, can’t you obey the Spirit Medicine Master obediently?”","“Little Li’er...”","Li Moying tried to play tricks, but Huang Yueli refused to let him have his way.","What made him even more depressed was that in the past, he could still use his masculine charm to find ways to make Huang Yueli soften and listen to him. Using his looks had always worked very well!","But now, it was useless for him to pretend to be pitiful!","Could it be that he has been lying on the bed for too long and his appearance has become ugly?","Li Moying immediately felt a sense of crisis! Because his family’s little Li’er was good looking!","As everyone knows, when Li Moying frowned and began to doubt himself, Huang Yueli who seemed to be ignoring him, was actually spying on him.","Li Moying, who had just recovered from a long illness, was slightly paler than usual, and the coercion of a strong person that people dare not look directly at was completely gone at this time.","This kind of Li Moying, on the contrary, had a different temperament, a weak but handsome man, which aroused her sympathy, so that she can’t help but want to comfort this man, protect him, and love him...","However, she can’t be soft-hearted!","“Alright, don’t be unhappy...as long as your health is good, you’ll be fine? Don’t make me worry, first practice the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, as long as you restore your original cultivation, you can do whatever you want...”","“I can do anything?”","Hearing these words, Li Moying’s eyes lit up at once and he immediately interrupted her, asking for confirmation.","After being taken aback for a moment, Huang Yueli realized that what she said was too easy to be misunderstood.","She quickly waved her little hand and said, “No, no, you...you misunderstood, what I said was that you can do whatever you want, that is, you don’t have to lie on the bed, you can go out for a walk, you can practice, and you can do anything to participate in the Grand Meet...”","“Dual cultivation is still possible!” Li Moying followed her words and continued.","Huang Yueli nodded subconsciously, “Yes, you can dual...”","She reacted completely subconsciously, and after she said the words, she suddenly realized that she had said the wrong thing again, her face was hot for a moment, and she quickly denied it: “cough cough, no, no, you misunderstood again ...”","“I didn’t misunderstand.”","The corners of Li Moying’s mouth turned upwards, smiling like a cat stealing fish.","Huang Yueli stared at his smiling face, almost staring blankly.","Her husband rarely showed such a smile, and he was a little stunned for a moment. This was really...beautiful...","Why was her husband so good-looking!","He looks good when he’s cold, and even better when he smiles!","Facing Li Moying’s face, Huang Yueli blinked, then blinked again.","When she came back to her senses again, she realized that she was nodding non-stop.","“Alright, husband, I’ll listen to you!”","Li Moying smiled lightly and said, “That’s good, it’s a deal!”"]},{"number":3763,"title":"Chapter 3763 One Month (6)","paragraphs":["3763 One Month (6)","It’s a deal? ?","What was a deal? !","Huang Yueli was confused, and in Li Moying’s eyes that seemed to be smiling, she recalled the scene just now, only to realize that she had been mesmerised by her husband, and agreed to a series of conditions about dual cultivation in a daze!","Beauty trap!","!!","She... She actually fell into the beauty trap again!","Huang Yueli couldn’t help covering her face and mourned for her weak willpower...","Liu Buyan, who was standing on the side watching silently, was even more speechless at this moment.","These two were showing off their affection yet again...was it over yet? Huh, was it over?","Didn’t you see that there’s a bachelor beside him? He’s simply immoral!","Seeing the two people looking at each other affectionately, as if they had completely forgotten about his existence, Liu Buyan coughed heavily.","“Ahem!”","Huang Yueli froze, and then remembered that Liu Buyan was still in the room.","Li Moying has never forgotten Liu Buyan, but he was very, very upset when he was suddenly interrupted in the process of seducing his wife.","He glanced at Liu Buyan, “Why are you still here?”","Liu Buyan said: “I have one more thing to say, I’ll leave after I finish.”","“Spit it out quickly then!”","These words made Liu Buyan almost choke to death.","Spit it out quickly?","Huang Yueli was speechless, raised her hand to pinch Li Moying, and then said: “Senior Brother, if you have any other orders, please tell us! Don’t worry, Moying will obediently follow your orders.”","Hearing this, Li Moying frowned slightly, as if he wanted to say something.","But then, he took a deep breath! Huang Yueli pinched his arm again!","In desperation, he could only choose to keep his mouth shut.","The person he couldn’t offend most in the world was his little fox...","Liu Buyan looked at her, feeling very moved. Pampering this Junior Sister of his was still not in vain! Although her heart was towards her husband after marriage, she can still think of him as a Senior Brother occasionally. Well.. it’s still sad but...","He felt sad in his heart, coughed, and returned to the topic.","“The two of you will definitely not be able to dual cultivate within a month. You must control yourself no matter what! Because not only does Li Moying’s physical condition not allow it, but also his physical condition will also affect you through dual cultivation, Junior Sister!”","Hearing this, Li Moying suddenly became serious.","Just like what Huang Yueli cared about most was his body, what he cared most about was also his Little Li’er.","Originally, he still had a fluke mentality, and planned to pester his little fox and engage in some dual cultivation after he could move one day. Presumably, Huang Yueli would find it difficult to control herself under his beauty trap.","But now, Liu Buyan issued such a serious warning, and even said that it would affect Huang Yueli...","Then he won’t go overboard no matter what!","Seeing the expression on Li Moying’s face, Liu Buyan finally felt satisfied.","After a few more words of advice, he exited the room, leaving space for the young couple who had never met in such a long while.","Huang Yueli raised her head and looked at Li Moying’s tense face, where the words “I’m not happy” were clearly written.","She sat on the edge of the bed amused, raised her hand and pinched his perfect face.","“Dear husband, don’t be angry!”"]},{"number":3764,"title":"Chapter 3764 One Month (7)","paragraphs":["3764 One Month (7)","As she spoke, she sighed in her heart: It feels so good! Li Moying’s skin seems to be better than hers!","Li Moying was harassed by this pair of unscrupulous hands, his face did not change, he just glanced at her lightly, and said, “Come on the bed!”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, then shook her head desperately, “No, no, no! Didn’t you hear what Senior Brother said just now? We can no longer duel cultivate!”","Li Moying raised his eyebrows, and a smile appeared in his eyes, “You little girl, why are your thoughts so impure? Who told you that two people lying on the same bed is for dual cultivation? I just want you to sleep by my side, that’s all, I haven’t seen you for so long, can’t I just stay with you for a while?”","Huang Yueli’s face immediately turned beet red, feeling very embarrassed.","It seems...it seems...probably...it’s really her thinking askew!","Li Moying can’t move very much now, even if he wants to do something bad, he won’t be able to do it at all!","Thinking of this, she kicked off her shoes, obediently climbed onto the bed, and lay down beside Li Moying.","“Little Li’er, you haven’t finished talking just now, have you? After you and Liu Buyan arrived in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, what happened? From what I know about these people in the clan, it’s not that easy for them to trust you... ...”","After the two of them lay quietly for a while, Li Moying’s voice suddenly rang out in the quiet room.","Huang Yueli was already drowsy and almost fell asleep, but when she heard this topic, she immediately woke up.","“Alright, I almost forgot to settle accounts with you! You heartless man, you already have a fiancée in the Cloudy Qilin Clan! Didn’t you say that Li Leyun has been driven away by you? Why was she still bearing the name of your fiancée?” Huh? And also, she is not the only one, you have ten other fiancée candidates? Tsk tsk, you can just open a harem directly!”","Although Huang Yueli was very clear that no matter how much these women express themselves, it was impossible for them to catch Li Moying’s eyes. Her husband only has her in his heart.","However, this did not prevent her from feeling uncomfortable.","Let me ask, who knew that his husband would be in a better mood when he was coveted by a large group of women from the Ancient God Clans?","Li Moying was taken aback for a moment, and the alarm bells rang in his heart.","“Uh... um, um... Little Li’er, listen to my explanation...”","“Alright, explain it, I’m listening!”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, staring at the side profile of the man beside her.","...","The night passed.","When the sunlight pierced through the clouds, Huang Yueli woke up.","Seeing that Li Moying was still fast asleep, she propped herself up lightly, and wanted to sneak out of bed first.","However, just as she moved, she heard a man’s sexy and deep voice above her head, “Little Li’er...where are you going? Sleep with me for a while longer.”","Huang Yueli turned around and covered the quilt for him.","“The Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan will send someone to ask about your situation every day. Seeing that the time is coming soon, I’m going to tell them the news of your awakening. Your clan is very worried about you... You should rest first, I will go and come back later.”","Li Moying wanted to hold her back, but Huang Yueli moved quickly and left in a flash.","Li Moying looked at his immobile fingers in annoyance, feeling depressed in his heart.","So what if you let those people in the clan wait a few more hours!","His little fox only slept for three hours yesterday!"]},{"number":3765,"title":"Chapter 3765 It’s Simply A Miracle(1)","paragraphs":["3765 It’s Simply A Miracle(1)","In another room in Amethyst Paramount Palace.","Li Leyun was lying on her back on the chaise lounge, her legs were still wrapped in bandages, and she was looking at the young guards in front of her with displeasure.","“I asked you to inquire about the news, but in the end, you just used these words to perfuse me? It’s too far away to see clearly? Then won’t you find a way to get in and see? You won’t even think of a way, tell me, what use are you then?”","After being severely reprimanded by Li Leyun, several guards lowered their heads lower and lower.","At the same time, they were secretly complaining in their hearts.","Previously, the two guards that Li Leyun trusted and used the most were thrown directly into the punishment hall for secretly spying on the Young Master’s recuperation. They have not been released until now, and they don’t even know whether they were dead or alive.","Li Leyun herself also suffered from self-inflicted injuries. She suffered severe internal injuries to her meridians, which have not healed for several days.","Despite all of this, Li Leyun didn’t give up because of this, and even sent more guards to inquire about the news.","These guards were not stupid. With Li Leyun like this, it’s hard to protect herself. Isn’t it obvious that they were sent to die if they listened to her?","Naturally, they wouldn’t try their best to help Li Leyun find out.","Seeing their silence, Li Leyun couldn’t help but understand a little bit, and immediately sneered.","“Heh, do you think that I’ve already lost power after being reprimanded by the Patriarch? Even if you don’t do things well for me, I can’t do anything about you? But, don’t forget, I am the Patriarch’s niece! If you dare to be so perfunctory to me, then I can send you to the punishment hall without my Second Uncle’s help!”","When the guards heard the words, they shivered secretly.","It was only then that they remembered that the young lady in front of them had a high status in the clan and had been spoiled since she was a child.","Once she gets angry, she can do anything!","The guards immediately became frightened and begged for mercy.","“Young Miss Leyun, we have really tried our best, please calm down!”","“Young Miss Leyun, please give us some more time, let’s think of a way!”","“That’s right, we definitely didn’t mean to be perfunctory to you, so please don’t get me wrong!”","Li Leyun snorted coldly: “Don’t think I don’t know what you guys are thinking! I’ll give you one last chance, if you can’t find out what Liu Buyan did to Brother Moying recently. If you can’t accomplish anything, you can just go to the punishment hall to spend the rest of your life!”","The guards cried bitterly in their hearts, almost crying on the spot!","Isn’t this embarrassing them?","They will definitely be severely punished for disobeying the Patriarch’s prohibition order, but if they don’t listen to Li Leyun’s words, they will also suffer bad luck...","It’s really a dilemma, no matter which, they were at a dead end!","However, they didn’t dare to refute, so they could only run away depressed.","Li Leyun looked at their backs, and the depression in her heart didn’t lessen, but became more intense.","She gritted her teeth secretly, “Don’t think that you can fool me if you cheated the Second Uncle last time! There was definitely something wrong between Liu Buyan and that little vixen! Brother Moying was locked in a room, and he definitely did something shameful! You just wait for me, one day, I will expose your true colours and pay back double what you have done to me!”","She patted the chaise lounge heavily, trying to vent her anger.","But just moving like this, the pain was so painful that she almost cried out!"]},{"number":3766,"title":"Chapter 3766 It’s Simply A Miracle (2)","paragraphs":["3766 It’s Simply A Miracle (2)","That day, Huang Yueli imbued evil qi into Li Leyun’s meridians.","Although there was not much evil qi, Li Leyun was able to move now after Huang Yueli pricked her with golden needles for a while and Liu Buyan prescribed another dose of medicine, but as long as she got agitated or her movement was a little bigger, her legs also ached.","In desperation, Li Leyun could only force herself to bow her head, and then went to Huang Yueli and the others to intercede, wanting them to heal her.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t even open her mouth to speak, so Li Shihong preemptively gave an order to tell Li Leyun not to make a mountain out of a molehill so as not to antagonise the two divine doctors who were treating Li Moying.","!!","Li Leyun knew that Li Shihong was extremely disappointed in her and he wanted to teach her a profound lesson.","However, after understanding this point, instead of making Li Leyun calm down, it made her even more angry!","She was even more determined to make Huang Yueli fall into her hands.","However, these new guards were not as obedient as her two former subordinates. They dare not violate Li Shihong’s orders at all!","Li Leyun was angry and anxious, but there was no good solution.","What’s more, the thing that hurt her the most was that she realized that she had missed the best opportunity now. It was impossible to prevent that vile Fox Vixen from doing anything to “her” Brother Moying!","After so many days, that Fox Vixen must have tarnished Brother Moying!","“Damn vixen! Don’t be complacent! I will definitely expose you! Also, Brother Moying has a high vision. If he wakes up and realizes that he has been tricked by a lowly woman like you, he will definitely not let you go!”","“I’m just waiting to see how you’ll die in the end!”","Li Leyun gritted her teeth and cursed.","Just then, there was an urgent knock on the door.","“Young Miss Leyun, Young Miss Leyun! Something serious has happened! Young Master...Young Master, he...”","“What’s the matter? My Second Uncle found out about the good deeds that the Fox Vixen did, and she was kicked out together with her hypocritical Senior Brother?”","Li Leyun has long told her personal maid that if anything happens to Li Moying, she must be notified immediately.","So, when she heard that the maid was so anxious, she immediately became excited, completely forgetting that her legs were still half disabled, and suddenly sat up from the chaise lounge.","“Ouch!”","This simple action touched the injured meridians again, and she couldn’t help but gasp.","However, despite the pain in her body, she was very happy in her heart, and kept shouting: “Come in, come in quickly! What’s wrong with Brother Moying? Please tell me clearly?”","The maid pushed the door open and walked in, her face still flushed from running wildly.","“Young Master...Young Master, he...he has regained his consciousness!”","Li Leyun’s excited expression froze immediately, “What... what did you say? Say it again!”","The maid was taken aback by her harsh tone.","The maid originally thought that Li Leyun was most concerned about Li Moying’s injury, and she was most looking forward to Li Moying’s awakening as soon as possible, so she ran over excitedly at the first time.","Although her young lady has a bad temper, as long as she was in a good mood, she was quite generous.","Knowing that the Young Master has woken up, Young Miss Leyun must be happy, and maybe she will be rewarded heavily for the person who delivered the news.","But now, the expression on Li Leyun’s face was different from what she imagined."]},{"number":3767,"title":"Chapter 3767 It’s Simply A Miracle(3)","paragraphs":["3767 It’s Simply A Miracle(3)","Not only was she not happy, but her face turned hideous.","The maid felt a chill in her heart, and her voice became trembling, “Young Master, he .... woke up!”","“Slap!”","A crisp slap resounded!","Li Leyun glowered at her as she raised her hand and slapped the maid across the face!","The maid never thought that she would be beaten when she came to deliver such great news! All of a sudden, she froze on the spot.","Li Leyun roared angrily: “What? Brother Moying woke up? How could he wake up? He doesn’t wake up earlier or later, but he woke up at this time! That little bitch and her Senior Brother are obviously cheats who are bluffing their way through can really heal Brother Moying?”","Li Leyun was not too stupid, although she really hoped that Li Moying would wake up and humiliate Huang Yueli severely, but she also knew that if Li Moying was really healed by Liu Buyan and the others, Then Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli really became benefactors of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Li Shihong wouldn’t believe her words anymore!","She stared fiercely at the maid whose cheeks were red and swollen with her nose bleeding, and asked sharply, “Where did you hear the news? Who allowed you to spread such false rumours in the Amethyst Paramount Palace?”","After the maid was beaten by her, she was so frightened that she trembled all over.","However, she couldn’t give the answer Li Leyun wanted.","“Miss Le... Leyun, spare... spare my life! This servant will never dare to tell lies...”","“This servant... I heard what the Patriarch’s bodyguard said...they said... the Young Master had woken up last night, but Divine Doctor Liu and Doctor Li didn’t report overnight because they were afraid of affecting the rest of the Patriarch. It was only early this morning that they sent someone to tell the Patriarch. Now, the Patriarch and the Elders have all rushed to the Young Master...”","“What did you say?? What you said is true?” Li Leyun turned pale with shock!","The maid lowered her head and said, “If the servant girl tells a single word of lie, she will be struck to death by lightning!”","In order to prevent Li Leyun from poisoning her, the maids began to swear.","Li Leyun was so angry that she clenched her teeth, but at this point, she couldn’t help but believe this fact!","Li Moying really woke up!","Moreover, he was rescued by those two “charlatans” she hated the most!","Thinking that that little vixen and her Senior Brother would become the benefactors of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan and be treated as honoured guests by Li Shihong, Li Leyun felt horrid all over.","Supporting her still aching body, she struggled to move down from the imperial concubine bed, trying to get down.","Seeing that the maid was still trembling slightly with her head down, she became even more angry.","“Are you blind? Didn’t you see that I’m coming down? Why don’t you just come over and give me a hand? Forget it, hurry up and call the guards in and not let them be so arrogant, lest they climb all over our heads in the future! I will go over and expose them personally!”","When the maid heard this, she ran away in a hurry.","Because she ran too fast, she almost tripped and fell to the ground.","Fortunately, Li Leyun was no longer in the mood to pay attention to her now.","Her heart had been eroded by jealousy and anger once again, her only thought was not to let that little vixen be so proud!","...","On the other side, Li Shihong and several Elders have already rushed to Li Moying’s hut.","Early in the morning, when they received the news from Huang Yueli, they were so excited that they almost cried"]},{"number":3768,"title":"Chapter 3768 It’s Simply A Miracle(4)","paragraphs":["3768 It’s Simply A Miracle(4)","They’ve waited for so long, to the extent of wishing upon the moon and the stars every night. They even spent so much money, hired so many famous doctors, but they couldn’t even find out what happened to Li Moying.","Just when they were about to give up, Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli appeared!","The two of them gave great hope to the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan, and everyone was looking forward to seeing a miracle happen.","At last, a miracle really happened!","!!","Moreover, it appeared so quickly and it even exceeded the best situation they had imagined!","Li Shihong and the others didn’t even bother to dress properly, they simply donned on their coats and ran outside.","After running all the way to the door of the hut, Li Shihong remembered that there was a girl like Huang Yueli in the room. In order to show his respect for Divine Doctor Li, he stopped for a while, ordered everyone to tidy up their appearance, before they entered.","In the room, Liu Buzheng was standing by the window. When he saw Li Shihong appearing, he greeted him.","“Patriarch Li, several Elders, you came so fast...”","Li Shihong waved his hand and interrupted Liu Buyan’s words.","“Divine Doctor Liu, we’ll talk about these polite words later. Now, I just want to know if Moying has really woken up?”","Facing Li Shihong’s expectant expression, Liu Buyan nodded slowly.","“Patriarch Li, Young Master Li woke up last night, but at that time he was very tired and fell asleep soon, but now he has recovered some of his physical strength, not only did he wake up just now, but now he is eating breakfast. Patriarch and Elders, you can go and see for yourself.”","Upon hearing this, Li Shihong and the others were so excited that they couldn’t contain themselves!","They thought that even if Li Moying woke up, he could only open and close his eyes, and even speaking was probably very reluctant.","But who knows, now they even learnt that Li Moying can eat breakfast!","In that case, most of his injuries have healed!","The few people were so excited that they didn’t bother to thank Liu Buyan, and immediately rushed behind the screen.","As soon as they entered, they saw a figure leaning against a large pile of pillows on the big bed behind the screen. His body was obviously still a little stiff, but he could at least sit up!","Everyone present was very familiar with his incomparably handsome face!","It was the Young Master of their Cloudy Qilin Clan, a god-level genius who can’t be born in ten thousand years——Li Moying!","“Moying! You...you’re really awake!”","Seeing this scene, Li Shihong almost cried with joy!","The Elders were also very excited.","“Young Master, you finally woke up. You have been in a coma for too long!”","“You really scared everyone this time. All the members of the clan are concerned about your injury. This time, everyone can finally feel relieved!”","“I’ve said it a long time ago. A god-level genius like the Young Master has so much luck. It’s impossible for him to fall into the trap of an insidious villain. He will only get better!”","The Elders praised Li Moying one after another, and strode to the bedside, wanting to congratulate him at a closer range.","But at this moment, a young girl’s voice suddenly resounded from the side.","“Wait, come here later!”","The Elders were startled, they didn’t expect to be stopped.","They only heard the voice which continued: “Didn’t you listen to my Senior Brother? Young Master Li is having breakfast! He has been in a coma for so long and hasn’t eaten anything. His body is very weak, and you still want to interrupt him from eating?”"]},{"number":3769,"title":"Chapter 3769 It’s Simply A Miracle (5)","paragraphs":["3769 It’s Simply A Miracle (5)","Several people froze when they heard this, and suddenly stopped in their tracks. At the same time, they turned and looked back.","Just now, all their minds were on Li Moying and they didn’t notice at all that there was a girl sitting on the other side of the big bed.","She was holding a small porcelain bowl in one hand and a spoon in the other. She was about to feed Li Moying, but was interrupted by them.","When Li Shihong saw it, he felt a little ashamed, “Uh... so it’s... Divine Doctor Li! I’m really sorry, we were too impatient. The moment we heard that Moying woke up, the clansmen were very excited. Thinking of him eating...”","!!","While talking, he couldn’t help but look at Huang Yueli several more times.","Unexpectedly, this Young Miss Li was actually feeding Li Moying!","As a majestic doctor, it’s understandable to ask a maid to do such a trivial matter. She actually brought herself down to do it on her own. She was so dedicated!","He was so lucky to be able to invite Liu Buyan and Young Miss Li, this pair of Senior Brother and Junior Sister this time!","Huang Yueli sensed his gaze, and explained lightly: “Although Young Master Li has woken up, his body is still very stiff, and there are many things that need attention when eating. I’m worried that the maids are rough, if Young Master Li was hurt in the course, wouldn’t it appear that we are not good at medicine?”","Li Shihong didn’t think about it at all. He spent a lot of trouble to invite them. In fact, he stepped into the hole Huang Yueli had dug. He thought Huang Yueli’s remarks were just because he disliked the poor service of the maids of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","He smiled a little embarrassedly, “Young Miss Li, it’s because our Cloudy Qilin Clan was lax and made you laugh. Thanks to you this time, Moying was able to recover so quickly.”","Huang Yueli nodded, she didn’t intend to be humble at all, and continued: “What do you want to say, please talk about it after Young Master Li finishes eating.”","Li Shihong led his people back out immediately.","However, they didn’t go too far. At the edge of the screen, they could still see what was happening inside.","They saw Huang Yueli approaching Li Moying’s side, holding a spoon with her slender fingers, scooped up the soft, glutinous and crystal clear white porridge stewed in the porcelain bowl, and brought it to Li Moying’s mouth.","Li Moying’s face was covered by the shadow at the head of the bed, so he couldn’t see the expression on his face clearly, but it could still be seen that he didn’t eat it right away, but hesitated for a while, and then said something to Huang Yueli.","After hearing what he said, Huang Yueli took back the spoon in her hand, put it to her mouth and blew on it, then handed it to Li Moying’s mouth again.","This time, Li Moying opened his mouth and swallowed it.","Several Elders were watching from the sidelines, but they were so distressed that they all turned their heads to talk to Liu Buyan.","“Divine Divine Doctor Liu, Young Master...is it really alright? Isn’t it too pitiful? I don’t know how long it will take to get better?”","The corners of Liu Buyan’s mouth twitched, his face was speechless, “What? Pity... pitiful??”","“That’s right, look at the Young Master, he used to be such a powerful master, but now he can’t even eat by himself. Alas, if it’s me, I really wish I could die!”","“Looking at the appearance of the Young Master, he obviously has no appetite at all, but in order to get better, he has to force himself to eat. It’s so pitiful, so pitiful indeed!”","When Liu Buyan heard it, he almost spat out a mouthful of blood!"]},{"number":3770,"title":"Chapter 3770 It’s Simply A Miracle (6)","paragraphs":["3770 It’s Simply A Miracle (6)","Pitiful?","Pitiful?!","Which of their eyes could see how pitiful Li Moying was?","Why, in Liu Buyan’s opinion, not only was Li Moying not pitiful, but he was probably already so happy that he was about to fly to heaven?","!!","His Junior Sister was usually quite shy, not as shameless as Li Moying yet he still insisted that she was to feed him.","But now it’s different!","Not only did Huang Yueli personally cook delicious and easy-to-digest meals for Li Moying, but she also fed him so patiently!","Moreover, he doesn’t know what misunderstanding these Elders have. They think that Li Moying refused to eat just because he has no appetite?","Obviously, taking advantage of his own injuries, he deliberately pretended to be pitiful in order to win the sympathy of his Junior Sister, right?","It’s a pity that Liu Buyan was the only sensible person here, he can only watch Li Moying acting there, and his liver was hurting with anger.","Because Li Moying deliberately did not cooperate in various ways, and wanted to attract more attention from his little fox, the feeding process lasted for a long time.","Huang Yueli was always very patient, no matter what Li Moying asked, she would always obey.","Actually, it’s not that she can’t see Li Moying’s thoughts, but in her opinion, her husband was really pitiful enough, so even if he doesn’t pretend, she was willing to do anything for him.","It’s just taking care of him as a baby. It’s not difficult, at most, it’s like taking care of their baby in advance!","(Baby Li: ???)","After finally finishing the meal, Huang Yueli put the porcelain bowl and spoon on the low table and was about to get up.","Suddenly, she noticed another pitiful sight entangled behind her.","Huang Yueli stared at those beautiful peach blossom eyes, couldn’t help laughing, lowered her voice and said, “Moying, what are you doing? Patriarch Li and the others are very worried about you, so you can tell them a few words, wait They’re gone, I’ll make you something else delicious, alright?”","Li Moying snorted, “I don’t want to eat, I want...”","“What do you want?” Huang Yueli was startled.","Li Moying hooked the corner of her mouth, “You know it clearly, don’t pretend to be stupid!”","Huang Yueli’s complexion changed, and she couldn’t help but glared at him, “You...what are you thinking about every day! My Senior Brother has already said that this month was absolutely not...not allowed ! Stop thinking about it, take care of your wounds!”","“Impossible?” Hearing this, Li Moying raised her eyebrows, and said with a half-smile: “Little Li’er, are you delusional? I’m not talking about something you can’t do for a month, just I just want you to wipe my mouth. You touched my face with a spoon just now, so I can’t talk to the Patriarch with a mouthful of porridge? Where are you thinking?”","Huang Yueli was already about to get up and leave him here, but when she heard this, her body froze and the expression on her face froze.","“...What?”","She looked back, and there was indeed a trace of dry rice porridge on the side of Li Moying’s mouth, making his supposedly perfect handsome face look like a little cat who didn’t wipe his mouth after stealing it!","Huang Yueli quickly picked up the silk handkerchief at hand, and wiped it on Li Moying’s mouth.","Since the porridge was a little dry, it took several times to wipe it clean.","While she was wiping, Li Moying kept staring down at her slightly red face."]},{"number":3771,"title":"Chapter 3771 It’s Simply A Miracle (7)","paragraphs":["3771 It’s Simply A Miracle (7)","Being stared at by him like this, Huang Yueli gradually blushed.","She didn’t know why, the two of them were not newlyweds but as long as Li Moying kept staring at her, she would still blush and her heart would thump loudly.","Alas, it’s all because this man was so good-looking!","In order to get rid of such an embarrassing state, Huang Yueli quickened her hand movements, and her strikes were not light or heavy. If she was not careful, a small red mark was rubbed on Li Moying’s face.","!!","Realizing this, Huang Yueli hastily withdrew her hand.","Li Moying couldn’t help but chuckled, “Little Li’er, you are so impure now, you can think of things you can’t do for a month if you say anything, could it be that I have neglected you too much recently? Hmm?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli nervously swept the direction of the screen, and found that Li Shihong and others were talking to Liu Buyan, and seemed to have not noticed their side, so she secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","She glared at Li Moying, and said angrily, “You... What are you talking about? Didn’t you see that there are so many people?”","“Alright, alright, then I’ll wait until there is no one else.” Li Moying followed her words with jest.","Huang Yueli almost smashed the porcelain bowl on his face, “Don’t tell me even if there is no one else! Otherwise, you can just lie here alone! Oh, yes, you can still let that Young Miss Leyun accompany you! Hmph!”","Li Moying couldn’t help laughing when he saw her lose her composure, “Little Li’er, I didn’t expect you to be so jealous.”","“Hmph! I’m not jealous!” Huang Yueli glared at him, “Seeing that you are in such good spirits, you have almost recovered, I’d better call Patriarch Li and the others in!”","“Wait, Little Li’er...”","Seeing that something was wrong, Li Moying wanted to call her back, but Huang Yueli moved very quickly and walked away in the blink of an eye, without even giving him a second glance.","Li Shihong and the others waited behind the screen, but they were not idle.","A group of people gathered around Liu Buyan, asking about Li Moying’s condition.","When Huang Yueli walked over, she found that her Senior Brother’s complexion was already very bad.","Liu Buyan was not a very patient person in the first place, and now he was still being interrogated by so many people. Although the Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were very polite to him, he still finds it annoying.","Seeing Huang Yueli walking in, he hurriedly said: “Alright, my Junior Sister has come out. How is it, Young Master Li was alright?”","Huang Yueli nodded, “Patriarch Li, several Elders, if you want to go see Young Master Li, you can go in now, but...”","After hearing the first half of the sentence, Li Shihong and the others couldn’t wait to rush over.","Hearing this “but”, the footsteps stopped.","Huang Yueli continued: “However, Young Master Li now needs to rest for more than ten hours a day in order to recover as quickly as possible. You guys should hurry up. After half an hour, he should rest.”","Actually, what Li Moying needs was not rest, but cultivation.","He must Master the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” as quickly as possible, and then he can refine the evil qi in his body by himself without Huang Yueli’s assistance.","However, this cannot be explained to the members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so Huang Yueli prevaricates them by resting.","Fortunately, Li Shihong and the others have no doubts about Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan now. When they heard this, they didn’t have any doubts at all, so they quickly expressed their opinion, “We’ll just say a few words and leave!”"]},{"number":3772,"title":"Chapter 3772 It’s Simply A Miracle (8)","paragraphs":["3772 It’s Simply A Miracle (8)","Only then did Huang Yueli move to the side and let them in.","Several people strode to Li Moying’s side.","For a moment, they stood there stunned and speechless.","Even though they were outside the screen just now, they saw Li Moying sitting there eating, and knew that he was talking to Huang Yueli, but when they got there, they saw Li Moying’s sharp and charming peach blossom eyes, the same as before, with his deep gaze and a calm demeanour, they couldn’t help but get excited.","“Young Master, you are finally awake!”","“Great, this is really great!”","“Young Master, do you feel uncomfortable anywhere else?”","A group of Elders surrounded Li Moying, asking about his health in various ways.","Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan stood not far away and watched, and couldn’t help being amazed.","Even Huang Yueli was a little jealous of Li Moying’s good life!","She was also a god-level genius, how could she be hunted down by the clan’s Elders, and she couldn’t even go back now, but Li Moying was so respected by everyone in the clan! The attitudes of these old fellows towards other clansmen are very arrogant and rude, but when facing Li Moying, they had a completely different attitude.","“Moying, you really made all the clansmen worry terribly this time!” Li Shihong sighed, “You finally woke up, it’s good to wake up, my heart was relieved. Don’t worry, I have already asked Divine Doctor Liu just now, and he said that as long as you wake up, you will slowly recover, and your cultivation will also return to the original level.”","Li Moying nodded slightly, “Patriarch, I’m not worried about these things. I will recover to my peak state in the shortest time possible and participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.”","Li Shihong’s eyes widened suddenly after hearing this.","“Wait, Moying, you... what are you talking about? You still want to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet?”","Li Moying took it for granted, “It’s natural. I signed up for the competition on behalf of the clan a long time ago. If I don’t go halfway, I will lose not only my own reputation, but the whole clan will be affected by me.”","“That...that’s right, but...” Li Shihong didn’t know what to say for a while.","No one knows better than him what the consequences will be if Li Moying does not participate in the competition.","Both the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Li Moying himself were very high-profile before. The news that the Cloudy Qilin Clan has a god-level genius has already spread throughout the God Realm. Waiting to see Li Moying’s performance in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","If at this time, Li Moying suddenly stopped competing, everyone would think of the previous dispute between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and come to the conclusion that Li Moying had already been abolished by Huang Sanbai!","This was a heavy blow to the reputation of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Li Moying said: “Patriarch, don’t you want me to participate in the competition?”","Li Shihong sighed: “I know you don’t want to be underestimated, but the clan’s reputation is not as important as your body! For you, the most important thing was to cooperate with Divine Doctor Liu and Divine Doctor Li to recover in the safest way. Cultivation should not be rushed for a while.”","“Patriarch, you don’t need to persuade me anymore! I know my own body. I will definitely be able to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet in a month’s time.”","Li Moying’s eyes flickered slightly, “Huang Sanbai dared to do such a thing, this revenge... I will definitely make him pay back with my own hands! If he sees me appearing in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, I don’t know what his expression would be?”"]},{"number":3773,"title":"Chapter 3773 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (1)","paragraphs":["3773 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (1)","What Li Moying didn’t say was that he was eager to take revenge, not for himself, but for his Little Li’er!","Huang Sanbai chased after them and tried to kill them, the main target was not him, but Huang Yueli.","Li Shihong and the others didn’t understand, but when Huang Yueli heard this, she immediately understood.","She turned her head and looked in Li Moying’s direction, and the gaze of the two met.","Huang Yueli bit her lip, feeling moved in her heart.","Her husband really thought of everything for her.","Li Shihong and several Elders were also shocked by the strength and coldness revealed in Li Moying’s tone, and it took a long time to recover.","Li Shihong frowned, with a face full of disapproval, “Moying, the clan will negotiate with him about Huang Sanbai. Just rest assured, our Cloudy Qilin Clan was not easy to bully. After hurting you, the Sacred Phoenix Clan doesn’t hand over the murderer, we will never let it go! You should recuperate here.”","Li Moying’s attitude was very resolute, and he shook his head, “Patriarch, I appreciate your kindness, but this matter... I must do it! I have already asked Little...cough cough, Young Miss Li, She also said that as long as I take the medicine and practice on time, I will definitely recover within a month.”","“Really?”","When the Elders heard this, they immediately turned their attention to Huang Yueli.","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched, and she couldn’t help but glared at Li Moying.","This man will really cause trouble for her. When he said this, he didn’t discuss it with her first!","Huang Yueli herself actually did not agree with Li Moying’s thoughts. Even with Li Moying’s talent, it would not be too difficult to cultivate the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” to the higher level within a month, but she still did not agree. Here she was worried about her husband’s serious injury, yet he arbitrarily announced that he will go to participate in some God Realm’s Grand Meet!","However, in front of outsiders, she did not refute Li Moying.","“This... I can only say that if the recovery is good, Young Master Li can recover to the state before the injury. However, various accidents will occur during the recovery process. It was still uncertain what the recovery will be like by then!”","Huang Yueli spoke ambiguously, but didn’t finish her words.","Hearing this, Li Moying pursed her thin lips in dissatisfaction, but was completely ignored by his wife.","Li Shihong nodded when he heard the words, and said, “With the words of Divine Doctor Li, I feel relieved!”","Then, he turned his head to look at Li Moying, “Moying, you have heard what Divine Doctor Li said. The list of Cloudy Qilin Clan’s registration for the God Realm Martial Arts has not been finalized yet, so please give it to Young Miss Li at that time.” As a result of the diagnosis, if she confirms that you are in good health, then I won’t stop you, but if Young Miss Li says you can’t go, I won’t take the risk!”","Li Shihong usually dotes on the only god-level genius in the clan, and it was rare for him to be so strong and reject his request.","As soon as he finished speaking, he became a little worried.","Based on his understanding of Li Moying, he would never listen to other people’s objections when he decided on something.","What’s more, he wants Li Moying to listen to a woman’s orders!","Li Moying hates those ladies who are crazy about him the most, and he doesn’t even look at them usually.","He won’t be angry when he hears this, right?","If he had known earlier, he shouldn’t have used Young Miss Li, even if he told Li Moying to listen to what Liu Buyan said, it would have been better!"]},{"number":3774,"title":"Chapter 3774 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (2)","paragraphs":["3774 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (2)","Li Shihong was thinking about how to change his words , when he suddenly heard Li Moying snort softly before he said in a glum tone: “Alright, that’s fine as well.”","That’s fin as well?!","Li Shihong’s eyes widened, and he couldn’t believe his ears!","Young Miss Li was a female doctor! According to Li Moying’s usual performance, he did not despise him on the spot, it was already very good, and he actually agreed to listen to the other party?","!!","The several Elders behind Li Shihong were also speechless and stared incredulously.","On the other hand, Huang Yueli lifted her chin, and said to Li Moying impolitely: “You said this yourself, you are not allowed to find various reasons to renege on your words in the future! The Patriarch is here to listen!”","She didn’t feel at all that it was strange for Li Moying to listen to her words.","After all, they usually listen to her about big and small matters in their clan.","It’s just that Li Moying sometimes likes to be brave, and when he can’t say no to her, he will act coquettishly, roll around, and try to persuade her on the bed.","When Li Shihong heard Huang Yueli speak like this, he was so startled that he almost jumped up.","He hurriedly said: “Young Miss Li, this... please rest assured, Moying has always been a person who keeps his word, and there is no need to mention such things in the future...”","Finally, Li Moying nodded and agreed. Li Shihong estimated that it was because Li Moying just woke up and was still a little confused.","Now Huang Yueli actually jumped out and spoke to Li Moying so impolitely!","If Li Moying was offended, this matter will be difficult.","Li Shihong thought so, and hurriedly stopped Huang Yueli from continuing, and at the same time, he was thinking about going out to tell Huang Yueli a few words in private, so that she would not say something wrong again. However, Li Shihong was also very worried that he would accidentally offend Huang Yueli. Yueli, for a while, felt a bit in a dilemma.","Just when he was struggling, Li Moying spoke again.","This time, his jaw almost dropped to the ground.","“I’ve always kept my promises. Young Miss Li doesn’t believe me?”","Li Moying’s tone was calm, without the anger or displeasure that everyone expected, and when he spoke, there seemed to be a faint smile on his face.","Smile?","Li Shihong was startled by such conjectures, and quickly looked again at Li Moying’s face.","The handsome man was leaning against the head of the bed, staring intently at the girl standing on the other side of the room. Although there was no smile on his face, his gaze was rare and gentle.","In the morning light, those charming peach blossom eyes shimmered like a beautiful painting.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, “Alright then, I will trust you just once.”","She spoke with some reluctance.","However, Li Shihong and the others were almost so excited that they wanted to set off firecrackers!","What they were most worried about was that Li Moying refuses to take good care of his injuries. If he insists on participating in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, no one can stop him. Even the words of the Patriarch will not be very effective in front of Li Moying. .","Unexpectedly, the slender girl in front of them could make Li Moying listen obediently with just a few words.","Although this must be an accidental phenomenon caused by Li Moying’s just waking up, it was still surprising enough.","Li Shihong was afraid that Huang Yueli would say something inappropriate again, so he quickly intervened and said repeatedly: “Alright, that’s great! This matter is settled!”"]},{"number":3775,"title":"Chapter 3775 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (3)","paragraphs":["3775 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (3)","Seeing this, Huang Yueli didn’t say anything more, and took another look at Li Moying, then stepped back, leaving room for Li Shihong and the others.","Li Shihong finally solved the problem he was most worried about and just let out a soft sigh of relief, when he quickly remembered another thing.","“By the way, Moying, do you know why Huang Sanbai, that old coot, chased and tried to kill you? When we were negotiating with the Sacred Phoenix Clan, although he admitted the fact that he injured you, he kept saying... ...kept saying...”","Li Shihong couldn’t speak, but Li Moying’s face showed a clear expression.","!!","“Huang Sanbai must be saying that I killed the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, right?”","Li Shihong was taken aback, “How do you know?”","Li Moying sneered, “That’s what he said when we fought near Forest Shade Town. There were also two Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan present and he killed them too.”","Li Shihong was stunned, and then nodded again and again, “Yes, when it comes to this matter, I also remembered it. At that time, the Sacred Phoenix Clan also said that two of their Elders were missing. The suspicion was also related to you, but after all, with your cultivation level, it’s too difficult to kill two Dao Profound Realm Elders, and the Sacred Phoenix Clan can’t blame you for this matter. They were actually killed by Huang Sanbai?”","The more Li Shihong thought about it, the more he felt something was wrong, his brows were tightly knit together, “How’s this possible? What’s Huang Sanbai up to? It can be explained that he chased and tried to kill you. After all, as long as you exist, the Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely overwhelm the Sacred Phoenix Clan. But, he actually murdered the Elders of his own clan? This...”","Li Moying narrowed his eyes slightly to cover up the cold, murderous glint in his eyes.","He was very clear about Huang Sanbai’s motives for doing these things, but he couldn’t explain it to Li Shihong, so he could only choose to answer evasively.","“I don’t know what that old thief wants to do, but it seems to be related to the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.”","“A... god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan??”","Li Shihong was shocked again and exclaimed directly.","The Elders behind him also showed expressions of astonishment, and they all looked at Li Moying in disbelief.","“Young Master, do you mean... the Sacred Phoenix Clan really has a god-level genius?”","“What? Wasn’t this fabricated by the Sacred Phoenix Clan?”","“No way? Is there really such a person?”","Li Moying nodded indifferently, and said: “There are rumours that the Sacred Phoenix Clan has a god-level genius. It has been a few months. At that time, the Patriarch sent me to the Soul Connection Ocean to inquire about the news. When I arrived there, there’s still a relationship with that genius. She... was indeed a god-level!”","A god-level genius who had “met each other” glanced at him, and his pink lips subconsciously pursed.","Li Moying looked at her charming appearance, a smile appeared on the corner of his mouth.","However, Li Shihong and the others didn’t notice the change in his expression.","They were all still immersed in the shocking news, unable to recover.","“This is actually true!!”","“Heaven is really short-sighted. Among the bastards of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, there’s actually a god-level genius?”","“However, who was the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan? Why hasn’t anyone seen her in the God Realm for so long? Could it be that she was really killed? If this is true, it’s no wonder that Huang Sanbai was in such a hurry and behaved so irrationally!”"]},{"number":3776,"title":"Chapter 3776 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (4)","paragraphs":["3776 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (4)","Li Shihong couldn’t help but look at Li Moying suspiciously, “Moying, so... Could it be that what Huang Sanbai said was true? Did you really kill the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan?”","It’s not surprising that Li Shihong would think so.","Although he also felt that Li Moying was not such a cruel person.","However, with the relationship between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan, it was normal for two god-level geniuses to fight in the streets if they disagreed with each other. make sense...","Li Moying saw the expression on the Patriarch’s face, and knew that he was thinking askew, and quickly explained: “No, that’s not the case! I chatted with the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and it was really a coincidence. Both of us just ascended from the lower realm, and I didn’t know the grievances between our two families. Later, we parted near the Soul Connection Ocean. She left with Huang Sanbai. How did she disappear later? I don’t know at all. I don’t know, and I don’t even know why Huang Sanbai wants to blame me for this.”","Li Moying knew that what happened to Huang Yueli could not be explained, so he simply asked questions.","Li Shihong listened, and the doubts in his heart deepened, “This was strange, since you didn’t do this, how did that god-level genius disappear? What other clan would have such a deep hatred with the Sacred Phoenix Clan ?”","Everyone in the God Realm knows that the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan are the most difficult to deal with.","Therefore, after the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan disappeared, everyone immediately suspected that it was the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Even Li Shihong suspected for a moment that Li Moying did this.","But now, Li Moying has personally said that he didn’t kill anyone!","Li Shihong couldn’t help but not believe it.","He was very aware of Li Moying’s personality. Li Moying was extremely talented, and his personality was open and upright. If he really did it, he has no reason not to admit it. Even if you don’t admit it to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, there was no need to hide it in front of the Elders of the clan.","The Elders also understood this point, so they all fell into contemplation.","“Who the hell was it that dares to plant this blame on our Young Master!”","“The idiots of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, something happened to their god-level genius, and they couldn’t even find out the truth. Hmph! They deserve to be without any god-level genius in their clan!”","Li Moying couldn’t take it anymore, scolding the Sacred Phoenix Clan, isn’t it just scolding his clan’s Little Li’er?","He hurriedly interrupted the Elders, “Alright, now we are guessing here, and we can’t guess anything. In my opinion, this matter was mostly done by the insider of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. That old coot, Huang Sanbai, is the most suspicious! This timeround, at the God Realm’s Grand Meet, I will expose his true colours!”","Hearing this, Li Shihong subconsciously frowned.","However, he didn’t mention the matter of not allowing Li Moying to participate, but said: “Even if Huang Sanbai is insane, he won’t attack the god-level genius of his clan, right? What good will it do him? But If this matter has nothing to do with him, why would he plant the blame on Moying... I really can’t figure it out!”","Li Moying didn’t explain much, but just said: “I have my own concerns about this matter. Don’t worry about it Patriarch. When the time comes, I... ughhh!”","Halfway through his speech, a look of pain suddenly appeared on his cold and indifferent face.","Li Shihong was startled, “Moying, what... what’s wrong?”"]},{"number":3777,"title":"Chapter 3777 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (5)","paragraphs":["3777 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (5)","Just when he didn’t know how to react, a slender figure rushed out from behind him.","“Patriarch Li, please step aside!”","“Huh? Oh, certainly.”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s voice, Li Shihong quickly backed away a few steps.","!!","Huang Yueli walked up to Li Moying, took out a porcelain bottle, poured out two pills from it, brought another glass of water, and told him to take the pills, then she grabbed Li Moying’s wrist. Her eyes narrowed slightly, feeling the pulse beating under the man’s smooth skin.","“What’s the matter? What’s going on with Moying?” Li Shihong calmed down a bit, and asked Huang Yueli.","With a calm expression on Huang Yueli’s face, she explained calmly: “The poisonous gas in Young Master Li’s body has not been completely drained, so if he expends too much energy, he will easily suffer from chest pain. Just now, I advised you to make the long story short, this is the reason.”","“Ah... so it’s like this...” Li Shihong felt ashamed for a while.","Just now when they talked about serious matters with Li Moying, they were all filled with righteous indignation, they only focused on condemning Huang Sanbai, and they had already forgotten what Huang Yueli told them earlier.","Seeing Li Moying’s painful appearance now, he felt a little guilty.","Huang Yueli didn’t even look at them, she raised her hand to press the acupuncture point on Li Moying’s chest, and said, “You guys don’t have to worry, these poisonous gas outbreaks are not fatal, it’s nothing more than some discomfort. Administering acupuncture to Young Master Li can relieve his pain.”","After hearing this, the Elders were obviously relieved.","“That’s good, that’s good! Divine Doctor Li, you still have a solution, thanks to your presence...” Li Shihong and others said repeatedly.","The Patriarchs and Elders of the dignified Ancient God Clan, who were so polite to a young Divine Doctor Like her. If it were someone else, that person would have been flattered and terrified at the same time.","However, the expression on Huang Yueli’s face did not change at all, as if the one who thanked her was just an ordinary uncle on the street.","Moreover, before Li Shihong finished speaking, she interrupted.","“Patriarch Li, this is all my job, you don’t have to be polite. But now I’ll have to trouble you to go out, I’m going to administer acupuncture for Young Master Li.”","It was only then that Li Shihong and the others remembered that Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan didn’t like having outsiders watching when they were seeing a doctor.","Originally, after Huang Yueli said that they were going to give acupuncture, they should have left voluntarily, but it seems a bit embarrassing to only react now.","several Elders hurriedly retreated behind the screen.","However, they didn’t leave right away, but chatted with Liu Buyan who had been waiting outside.","Li Moying’s chest pain just now made Li Shihong and the others feel uneasy, and they made up their minds to leave only after seeing him safe and sound.","Huang Yueli frowned when she heard several people talking outside the screen.","Li Moying will feel uncomfortable, mainly because the evil qi in his meridians has not been completely transformed into his own power, which will cause some confusion from time to time.","The best solution, of course, was to let Li Moying continue to practice “The Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, but now that Li Shihong and others don’t leave, it was not so convenient for him to practice...","In desperation, Huang Yueli could only raise her hand and press Li Moying’s dantian.","“Moying, let me help you guide the evil qi in your body.”"]},{"number":3778,"title":"Chapter 3778 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (6)","paragraphs":["3778 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (6)","“Now, I will imbue my evil qi into your meridians, don’t resist, relax a bit...” Huang Yueli warned in a low voice.","This was actually the method she used to help Li Moying heal at the beginning. At that time, she didn’t see any effect, so she thought of using the method of dual cultivation for treatment.","However, Li Moying had no consciousness at the time. With her own strength, it was difficult to control the evil qi in Li Moying’s body, and she easily suffered from backlashes.","It’s different now. With Li Moying’s cooperation, it was easy to control the chaotic qi flow in his body.","!!","Li Moying nodded, and said in a low voice, “I understand, come on.”","Huang Yueli probed the position of his chest, and felt that the clothes were in the way. After thinking about it, she simply unbuttoned a few buttons on Li Moying’s neckline.","Following her movements, Li Moying’s breathing suddenly became a little heavier, and his chest rose and fell more distinctly.","When she pulled the robe to the side, his strong and powerful chest appeared in front of her eyes. Although Li Moying’s skin had become fairer than hers due to living indoors for a long time, the perfect sculptural muscle lines were still clearly visible. It shows that this was a powerful male body.","Huang Yueli’s eyes swept over his chest, and she didn’t take it seriously at first, but suddenly, she saw a suspicious red mark.","It looks like the marks scratched by the soft little paws of the little milk cat. It was very shallow, but it was full of fresh blood.","Didn’t Li Moying stay in the room all the time? How did you get hurt all of a sudden? Although it was such a small wound, it still looks familiar...","Huang Yueli pondered subconsciously. Suddenly, her body froze and her eyes widened.","Wait, this scratch seems, seems, maybe... She scratched it last night? ?","No wonder it looks so familiar!","At this moment, Li Moying’s laughing voice rang in her ears, “Have you seen enough? I know you are coveting me every day, but I never thought that you would be able to think crookedly after treating me. Well, why don’t you look at another place. If you haven’t seen enough, you can take off all my clothes and look carefully, I don’t mind...”","Seeing his little fox’s face suddenly turning red, Li Moying’s mood immediately improved, and he even forgot the pain accumulated in his dantian.","Huang Yueli blushed, waiting for the man in front of her.","If she didn’t remember that Li Moying was injured, she really wished she could kick him out!","“Who... who is coveting you? Don’t talk nonsense! Even if I... sleep with you a few times, it’s just to cure illness and save lives. Don’t think too much about it!”","“Just to cure illnesses and save lives?” Li Moying’s expression darkened when he heard this, “Say it again? Hmm?”","He was born with a strong majesty. When he usually shows off his aura, even Li Shihong, who has been famous for a long time, will inevitably feel a little guilty.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t take his expression seriously at all.","Others are outraged when they see Li Mo’s video, but in her opinion, it’s just that this man’s old habit of being arrogant was just repeated.","She raised her hand and patted Li Moying’s handsome face lightly, as if comforting a kitten or puppy, she said, “If you tell me to say it again, I’ll say it again? I don’t want to lose face? Alright, just lie down properly and don’t talk so much! If Patriarch Li and the others can’t wait, they might come in directly!”"]},{"number":3779,"title":"Chapter 3779 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (7)","paragraphs":["3779 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (7)","As Huang Yueli said, she pulled away the pillow behind Li Moying, pressed on his chest, and pushed him down on the bed.","Li Moying was still a little reluctant and wanted to struggle.","After all, he always liked being on top, how could he be thrown down without even struggling!","It’s a pity that he couldn’t do what he wanted. Although he pursed his thin lips lightly and looked unhappy, he was ruthlessly pushed down by his own little fox!","“Alright, now, focus and pay attention to the direction and speed of my evil qi spreading in your meridians...”","Huang Yueli’s soft voice rang in his ears.","When it came to business, Li Moying choked back all the redundant words, let go of the last thought in his heart, and began to practice with all his heart following Huang Yueli’s guidance.","Just like during the first treatment, Huang Yueli guided Li Moying’s evil qi to flow through his meridians according to the flow direction in the first volume of “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”.","It’s just that, compared to the situation when she spent a lot of effort and made no progress at the time, with his cooperation, the progress was immense!","Huang Yueli only guided the first part for him and very soon, he comprehended it on his own and the evil qi in his body circulated rapidly.","Huang Yueli deliberately slowed down at the beginning, worried that Li Moying would not be able to keep up.","But it didn’t take long for her to realize that if she didn’t do her best, she might be thrown off by a beginner like Li Moying!","Therefore, she also gradually let go of more thoughts and immersed herself in cultivation.","The evil qi of the two circulated in Li Moying’s meridians for two big cycles.","Feeling that Li Moying had mastered the contents of the first volume of “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” proficiently, and the chaotic atmosphere in his dantian had calmed down, Huang Yueli planned to withdraw her energy.","But the moment she was about to withdraw, Li Moying’s evil qi followed her like a shadow.","The energies in the two of them were originally intertwined and entangled with each other. Now that Li Moying deliberately refused to let her go, Huang Yueli’s breathing became a little disordered.","She pushed Li Moying’s chest, “You...what are you doing...”","Before she finished speaking, she suddenly felt a warm touch on her lips.","Huang Yueli’s eyes suddenly widened!","Li Moying actually came up to her by himself and kissed her!","But, this was not right, he couldn’t get up and do such a big movement by himself in the morning!","Such a thought just flashed through Huang Yueli’s mind. Li Moying had already deepened the kiss. The breaths of the two were intertwined. This feeling was so intense and so familiar...","This was different from Huang Yueli’s feeling of forcibly throwing Li Moying down these days.","It seems to have returned to the time when they were newlyweds.","Li Moying’s personality has always been very strong, especially when they are intimate. He was proactive and enthusiastic, which often makes Huang Yueli overwhelmed.","Unknowingly, Huang Yueli was immersed in the familiar feeling...","...","Outside the screen, Li Shihong and others were surrounding Liu Buyan, asking questions.","“Divine Doctor Liu, how long will the Young Master’s chest problem last? Can it be cured? Will it recur in the future?”","“To be honest, the Young Master still insists on participating in the God Realm’s Grand Meet in a month’s time. What should we do if he suddenly suffers from chest pains during the competition? Divine Doctor Liu, you have to give us an accurate answer! ”","Liu Buyan was bombarded with questions on all sides."]},{"number":3780,"title":"Chapter 3780 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (8)","paragraphs":["3780 This Female Doctor Is Pretty Good (8)","Li Moying couldn’t tell the truth about the real situation. He tried to trick the Elders with excuses, but they were worried about it and insisted on pestering him to get to the bottom of it.","Liu Buyan racked his brains to give a perfunctory answer while resenting his Junior Sister endlessly in his heart.","It’s just to channel the evil qi in the dantian. With Li Moying’s comprehension, does it really take so long to learn it?","Could it be that she was hiding inside and doing impure things again?","He warned them for so long last night, did they just ignore his words?!","“Sorry, Patriarch Li, excuse me...”","Liu Buyan was planning to go behind the screen to check the situation in person, but at this moment, there were bursts of eager footsteps outside the door.","Everyone turned around in surprise and looked at the door.","As they didn’t close the door before, the visitors came in directly through the door.","“Second Uncle, Second Uncle! I heard that Brother Moying woke up, is it true?”","Li Leyun couldn’t walk very much by herself, so she was pushed in by the guards in a wheelchair.","When Li Shihong saw that she was here, his first reaction was to frown.","“Li Leyun, how did you know that Moying had woken up? I seem to have only notified a few Elders...”","Li Leyun couldn’t help but hesitate, but she immediately found a reason, “That... that... I think the weather was good today, I went to the yard to get some fresh air, and I saw a few Elders coming in this direction, so I guessed... ...guessed Moying brother has woken up...”","“Is that really the case?” Li Shihong obviously didn’t believe it.","It was only then that Li Leyun realized that it was not the time for her to come here, but she still bit the bullet and said, “Yes... that’s how it is...”","As she spoke, she was still looking around the room.","“Second Uncle, Brother Moying, is he really awake?”","When Li Shihong saw how uneducated she was, he immediately became angry, and said angrily, “Moying has indeed awakened, but what does this have to do with you? I clearly ordered you to ground yourself in your own courtyard.” In a month, in just a few days, you openly disobeyed the order and even ran to the back mountain! Do you take me, the Patriarch, seriously?”","“Uh...” Li Leyun was at a loss for words for a moment.","Before Li Moying came to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Leyun was the number one genius among the younger generation of the clan.","So, she had been too spoiled.","In the past, even if she was grounded, the grounding order was in vain. If she ran out, no one would hold her accountable.","This time, she naturally thought so too.","But who knew, he was scolded by Li Shihong in front of so many people.","Li Leyun was embarrassed and she didn’t know what to do, but Li Shihong had lost his patience, and angrily shouted at the guard behind her: “What are you doing here? Send Li Leyun back immediately, and the confinement time will be extended to two months!”","When Li Leyun heard this, she became anxious and begged: “Second Uncle, I was wrong, I know I was wrong! Don’t drive me back! I was too worried about Brother Moying, so I insisted on running here. Yes, let me take a look at Brother Moying and I’ll leave! Please!”","Li Shihong frowned. He couldn’t bear to refuse her begging.","Although his niece was not good in every way, she really cares about Li Moying, so it doesn’t matter if she takes a look.","Only...","“Then wait a moment, Moying was not feeling well just now, and Divine Doctor Li is treating him behind the screen!”","“What?!” Li Leyun’s expression changed suddenly, “Brother Moying is alone with that woman again?”"]},{"number":3781,"title":"Chapter 3781 Life Saving Grace (1)","paragraphs":["3781 Life Saving Grace (1)","Hearing this, everyone present frowned.","Originally, everyone thought that it was only natural for Huang Yueli to treat Li Moying’s illness, and no one’s thoughts ran askew.","But why does Li Leyun’s words sound wrong?","Li Shihong immediately said in a displeased tone: “Li Leyun, what are you talking about? Haven’t you learned the lesson from last time? Divine Doctor Li worked hard every day to heal Moying, so that today’s results can be achieved. She is the benefactor of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan, how can make such malicious allegations?”","The elders also subconsciously felt disgusted and began to criticize Li Leyun.","“That’s right, Young Miss Leyun, you... You’re going too far!”","“Hurry up and go back to your own yard. What if Divine Doctor Li hears this?”","Li Leyun felt terribly wronged when she was repeatedly criticized.","Her intuition told her that there must be something wrong with that so-called Young Miss Li. There is something wrong with the way she looks at Brother Moying!","The Elders were all men, and they are all old, so they can’t tell at all. Although that damned girl has covered it up very well, that kind of lingering eyes can only be seen when a young girl looks at her beloved man!","Li Shihong was very dissatisfied with Li Leyun’s words, and couldn’t help but snorted coldly, “Listen to what you said, what does it look like? Come on, send Young Miss Leyun back immediately!”","When Li Leyun heard this, she became anxious, “Second Uncle, you...you can’t drive me away! You just promised me to let me stay and have a look at Brother Moying!”","“That was just now, and now is now!” The gaze at which Li Shihong looked at her revealed great disappointment as he continued on, “I thought you had learned to be good, so I agreed. But now it seems that your head is still not clear! If I let you stay, it will only offend Divine Doctor Li!”","Offend... Divine Doctor Li!","Hearing this, Li Leyun was so angry that she almost fainted!","What kind of thing was that damned girl, she was a mere doctor of the human race, and she was clearly plotting against the Young Master of their Cloudy Qilin Clan! She was clearly a vixen who has ulterior motives and wants to climb high!","What about offending her? What’s the big deal?","But Li Shihong, as the Patriarch of the Ancient God Clan, would actually drive her away, his own niece, because he was afraid of offending that damned girl?","Now that Brother Moying has already woken up, that bitch has no use value! It’s time to deal with her!","The hatred in Li Leyun’s heart gradually rose, eroding her sanity that she had been trying to hold on to.","A murderous intent flashed across her eyes, and she wished she could stab that so-called Divine Doctor to death on the spot!","However, in order to be able to stay here, she could only hold back her breath, lowered her head, and begged: “Second Uncle, I said the wrong thing, please let me take a look at Brother Moying! I’ll wait here, I promise not to talk nonsense...”","Li Leyun was still very beautiful. After being injured this time and being under house arrest for such a long time, her face was pale, and her begging look seemed rather pitiful.","After all, Li Shihong watched his niece grow up. For a while, he felt soft-hearted and hesitated.","The moment he was dazed, Li Leyun suddenly put her hand on the wheel of the wheelchair, turned herself, and rushed behind the screen."]},{"number":3782,"title":"Chapter 3782 Life Saving Grace (2)","paragraphs":["3782 Life Saving Grace (2)","This time, it happened so suddenly.","No one would have thought that Li Leyun, who was seated in a wheelchair and unable to move, would still have such a great power to suddenly exert such force and move under their noses.","By the time the Elders came to their senses, Li Leyun had already reached the edge of the screen.","Li Shihong roared anxiously: “Li Leyun, you...”","!!","However, as soon as he spoke, he heard a “boom” in his ear.","Li Leyun was not used to sitting in a wheelchair, and she lacks the skills to drive it forcibly, so she accidentally knocked down the entire screen.","No one thought that such a thing would happen, and they froze in place for a moment.","At this moment, Li Leyun’s scream sounded in the room, “Alright, I knew it would be like this! You damn girl, what do you want to do to Brother Moying? Hurry up and get off him!” You...you actually took advantage of Brother Moying’s inability to move, and did this to him...to him!”","The tranquility in the room was suddenly broken.","Everyone subconsciously looked at the position of the big bed behind the screen.","After seeing this, they were all stunned.","I saw Huang Yueli sitting sideways on the edge of the big bed, leaning towards Li Moying’s side, just a little bit, she was about to fall into Li Moying’s arms, and her right hand was even pressed directly on Li Moying’s chest.","Not only that, the clothes on Li Moying’s chest were ripped open, revealing tight and perfect muscle lines.","His hair was a little disheveled, and the appearance of half leaning on the bed, coupled with that suffocatingly handsome face, added a sense of chaotic beauty as if after indulgence.","Seeing this scene, everyone was speechless for a moment.","Only Liu Buyan couldn’t help raising his hand to cover his eyes.","Ugh! His eyes!","His little Junior Sister took some medicine wrongly, but she is so unrestrained! He had clearly warned them!","When the screen fell to the ground, there was a flash of shock on Huang Yueli’s face, but at this moment, she had already calmed down.","While everyone was in a daze, she unhurriedly supported Li Moying’s chest, sat up straight, and at the same time scanned the expressions on everyone’s faces one by one.","Facing the shock of the elders and Li Leyun’s resentment, Huang Yueli remained calm.","However, when she saw Liu Buyan’s old father-like expression of gnashing his teeth, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but the corners of her mouth twitched.","Senior Brother, what kind of expression is that on your face?!","She was not that kind of person. When she heard Li Leyun’s voice just now, she had already realized that something was wrong. In addition, the energy fluctuation in Li Moying’s body had calmed down a lot, so she wanted to push Li Moying away.","However, Li Moying insisted on pestering her, and she didn’t dare to forcibly withdraw, for fear that Li Moying had just recovered from a serious injury and his meridians were still very fragile, and it would be a disaster if his qi deviated.","When the two were entangled, the screen suddenly fell down.","Huang Yueli’s withdrawal was already very fast, otherwise, what everyone saw might not be her suspected approaching Li Moying’s arms, but her and Li Moying’s inseparable kiss!","Just when Huang Yueli was trying to show her Senior Brother her innocence with her eyes, Li Leyun had already pushed her wheelchair and rushed towards them.","As she approached, she shouted angrily: “Damn girl, what do you have to say now? I knew you had a problem!”"]},{"number":3783,"title":"Chapter 3783 Life Saving Grace (3)","paragraphs":["3783 Life Saving Grace (3)","“Now, you can’t deny it, can you? Why don’t you hurry up and spill it? Who sent you? Why did you sneak into the Cloudy Qilin Clan? What’s your purpose in seducing Brother Moying?”","Li Leyun asked repeatedly, with an extremely ferocious expression on her face. The pitiful expression that she had on just now was all gone.","It could be seen that if it wasn’t for the injury on her leg that wasn’t fully healed and she couldn’t walk a few steps, she would probably jump up and beat Huang Yueli by now.","Huang Yueli sat on the edge of the bed, didn’t even move, just looked at her coldly, “Which of your eyes saw me seduce Young Master Li? Young Miss Leyun, as a noble daughter of such a big family as the Cloudy Qilin Clan, your mouth is full of obscenities, and slanders others at will, this is too ugly!”","!!","“You–!”","Li Leyun glared at her, “You bitch, you still have the face to argue here! Everyone saw it just now, you threw yourself on Brother Moying! You are clearly seducing him! Don’t think that everyone else are all idiots and can’t see the intention of you Senior Brother and Junior Sister, you clearly sneaked into the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the name of healing, and you want to climb into Brother Moying’s bed!”","As she said that, she still didn’t forget to turn around to look at Li Shihong and the others outside the screen, “Second Uncle, you all said that I was thinking too much, what about now? The evidence is right in front of us! This damn girl clearly has no good intentions, do you believe me now?”","Li Shihong and the others were shocked by the scene in front of them. They couldn’t believe their eyes, so no one made a sound for a long time.","But now, Li Leyun has already said that, so they can’t continue to be silent.","“This this...”","Li Shihong didn’t know how to answer for a while.","Originally, he believed in Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli very much, but now it was true that Huang Yueli and Li Moying have an ambiguous posture.","“This... I don’t know what kind of treatment it is? I need to trouble Divine Doctor Li and Divine Doctor Liu to explain something to us...”","After all, Li Shihong had also seen big scenes before. After calming down, he thought about it and did not convict Huang Yueli because of this ambiguous gesture.","However, he also felt that it was really inappropriate for Liu Buyan and the others to treat him behind closed doors, so he made up his mind to ask Huang Yueli for clarification.","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows, but before she could answer, Li Leyun interrupted again.","“Second Uncle, is there a need to ask? I’ve never seen someone treat a patient in such a manner! She just wants to seduce Brother Moying, and whatever she says now is a sophistry! This damn ...”","She was afraid that Huang Yueli would come up with some reason to persuade Li Leyun, so she quickly jumped out to provoke her.","But who knows...","“Shut up!”","A cold and stern male voice suddenly sounded in the room, interrupting her accusation.","Li Leyun said subconsciously: “Who is it? Why should you tell me to shut up?”","After she finished speaking, she realized that there was suddenly no sound in the room, and there was a strange silence around her.","Li Leyun suddenly felt something was wrong, slowly raised her head, and turned her head in the direction of the sound.","On the hospital bed, the male protagonist of this incident, who had been ignored by everyone, was looking at her coldly at this time, and his pupils, which were as dark as a deep pool, were shining with an icy light.","Just looking at it made Li Leyun feel cold all over."]},{"number":3784,"title":"Chapter 3784 Life Saving Grace (4)","paragraphs":["3784 Life Saving Grace (4)","“Mo...Brother Moying...”","Li Leyun opened her mouth, and it took a long time before she recovered her voice, “Brother Moying, you finally woke up! Don’t worry, I will definitely avenge you for being bullied by this vixen while you were unconscious... ...Ahhh!!”","Li Leyun suddenly let out a shrill scream!","Halfway through her words, she suddenly felt a powerful force rushing straight into her chest.","!!","That incomparably powerful force pierced through the profound armour on her body in an instant, and she didn’t even have a chance to dodge. She was hit hard in the chest and flew backwards!","Li Leyun already had internal injuries before and after getting hit like this, it made her injuries worse.","When her body was still in mid-air, she spat out a mouthful of blood.","Li Leyun fell heavily to the ground and she felt her whole body in pain. This time, she couldn’t even get up.","However, even though she fell so badly, Li Shihong and the others didn’t look at her at all, but ran towards the big bed instead.","“Moying, Moying, what’s wrong with you?”","“Young Master? Where did you get hurt?”","Even Huang Yueli approached nervously, “Moying? What are you doing? Don’t you know what’s going on with your body? You can’t move casually until now, yet you dare to use your body’s profound strength!! Do you know the seriousness of the matter? Li Leyun is nothing more than talking badly, and she can’t do anything to me!”","The man who was half leaning on the bed took a few heavy breaths. The bright red blood at the corner of his mouth, against the background of his pale face, looked particularly shocking.","Looking at his weak appearance, Huang Yueli felt sour in her heart.","During this period of dual cultivation, Li Moying managed to regain some of his complexion. Now that his injuries were not completely healed, he was forced to use his profound strength, and he was immediately beaten back to his original condition!","Li Moying endured the throbbing pain in his meridians, raised his head, and his eyes swept across the girl’s face.","He said softly: “I just don’t allow her...to say that about you...”","Huang Yueli’s eye circles were red, and for some reason, she wanted to cry.","I don’t know if I was crying because of this man’s stubbornness.","“You... I just said it all! If she said a few words, I won’t lose a piece of meat!”","“No, just no!” Li Moying’s voice was a little softer, but his tone was very firm.","Before Huang Yueli had time to say anything, Li Shihong and the others had already run up to Li Moying’s bedside.","“Moying, don’t scare me. What happened to you just now? Why did you attack suddenly?” Li Shihong asked.","Li Moying swallowed the two pills that Huang Yueli personally delivered to his mouth, closed his eyes and adjusted his breath for a while before recovering a bit.","“Although Li Leyun is your niece, Patriarch, I have to say that she is simply too much! It took so much effort for Divine Doctor Li to save me. Just now, I had a residual poison attack, and Divine Doctor Li was the first one who discovered it and it was in time to treat it! I have no way of repaying her for saving my life, but my people still used such foul language to insult her? Wouldn’t it be ungrateful for me to let Li Leyun continue?”","With gloomy eyes, Li Moying said coldly.","Li Shihong was taken aback when he heard the words, “So, was Divine Doctor Li really treating you just now?”","“Otherwise?” Li Moying asked back."]},{"number":3785,"title":"Chapter 3785 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (1)","paragraphs":["3785 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (1)","Li Shihong choked on his words.","For a moment, because of Li Leyun’s words, he was a little confused. However, now that he had calmed down and thought about it, that kind of thing was really unlikely to happen.","It was well known that Li Moying hated women.","If that Young Miss Li was really taking advantage of his inability to do something shameless, with Li Moying’s personality, he would have already been furious!","Didn’t he just casually blow away an exponent like Li Leyun who was in the Heart Profound Realm?","Naturally, it was no problem dealing with a female doctor with an ordinary cultivation level.","However, not only did Li Moying not do this, but he obediently lay on the bed, even though Young Miss Li touched him all around, he didn’t show any disgust...","The only explanation for this was that she was really healing him just now.","Thinking of this, Li Shihong immediately blushed, and looked at Huang Yueli with guilt, “Ahem, this... Divine Doctor Li, I am really... really sorry about what has just entailed. My niece has spoilt, I have already strictly ordered her not to step out of her courtyard, but I didn’t expect her to come here by herself and say so many things that offend you, it’s really...”","With Li Shihong’s status, it was impossible to talk to Huang Yueli in such a humble tone.","But this time, he really felt guilty.","Li Leyun did something like this today. If he couldn’t handle it well, he might really offend the pair of genius doctors!","Seeing that Li Moying won’t get better soon, if they just leave, what will they do?","When Huang Yueli heard this, she sneered.","“Patriarch Li, you don’t have to say sorry to me, you have always been kind to Senior Brother and I. I am not an ungrateful person, however, the Cloudy Qilin Clan is one of the most noble forces in the God Realm. I’m surprised that the rules aren’t that strict! A clansman who repeatedly made mistakes and had been grounded can run around completely unhindered, and even run into the Young Master’s room and no one cares about her! What was the reason for this?”","“This... this... was indeed because I am not strict...” Li Shihong wiped the sweat from his forehead, but he was powerless to refute.","Huang Yueli said again: “Since the day my Senior Brother and I arrived at Amethyst Paramount Palace, many people have questioned our ability. Knowing that Senior Brother and I were not well-known before, and you doubt our medical skills is also within reasonable grounds, so I have been thinking about using facts to prove my ability! But I never thought that now that we have woken up Young Master Li, you are still suspecting that we are plotting something?”","“This... this...”","Not only Li Shihong, but also the Elders behind him were all speechless.","This matter, no matter where it was put, it was their Cloudy Qilin Clan’s fault.","The ancient gods all attached great importance to their reputation. If this kind of thing spread, it would definitely make the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan a laughing stock in the God Realm!","Just when everyone didn’t know what to do, Huang Yueli said coldly: “Anyway, Young Master Li has woken up now, I guess you don’t need us anymore, crossing rivers and demolishing bridges is human nature. I’m too lazy to argue with you, so let’s not live here now! If there are any problems in the future, it has nothing to do with us! Please find another Doctor!”"]},{"number":3786,"title":"Chapter 3786 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (2)","paragraphs":["3786 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (2)","As she spoke, she waved her hand towards Liu Buyan, “Senior Brother, let’s go!”","Huang Yueli walked towards the door first.","Li Shihong and the others saw that she was so resolute and decisive that she was about to leave as soon as she said she would leave. They all became anxious and rushed to chase her.","“Divine Doctor Li, don’t go, you can’t go!”","!!","“What happened just now was done by Li Leyun alone. The rest of us trust you two!”","“That’s right, Divine Doctor Li, we will definitely punish Li Leyun severely. What happened today will never happen again. Please trust us again!”","However, no matter how earnestly everyone persuaded, Huang Yueli’s steps were still very firm.","Of course her speed was not as fast as these Dao Profound Realm Elders, but although everyone can catch up to her in a few steps, no one dares to stop her. They could only restrain their eagerness one by one as they struggled to find a way to convince her.","It’s a pity that everyone has searched their brains and said all the words they could think of, but they still haven’t been able to impress her.","Seeing that Huang Yueli was about to walk out of the room, suddenly, a voice sounded from the corner of the room.","“Wait, Junior Sister, please stop! We can’t just leave like this!”","Hearing this, everyone was startled for a moment, and then they were overjoyed and looked in the direction of the sound.","The person who spoke was Liu Buyan who had been silent all this time!","Seeing him standing up to prevent Huang Yueli from leaving, the Elders all heaved a sigh of relief in unison.","Thank goodness!","Even though Divine Doctor Li almost ran away in anger today, at least Divine Doctor Liu believed in their sincerity, knew that it was not easy for them, and was willing to stand by their side...","Everyone was very moved and looked at him with extremely grateful eyes.","Liu Buyan was watched by so many people, a smile appeared on his handsome face, and he said slowly: “Junior Sister, we haven’t settled the medical expenses this time! How can you just leave? We can’t make a loss!”","Originally, although Huang Yueli stopped after listening to Liu Buyan’s words, she still had a sullen face and didn’t intend to look back.","But now, after hearing Liu Buyan’s words, her expression changed immediately.","“That’s right, they haven’t paid you yet!” Huang Yueli turned around abruptly.","“Patriarch Li, my Senior Brother and I have spent so long seeing Young Master Li, and we have indeed revived him. According to the agreement, you Cloudy Qilin Clan should pay us the consultation fee? Why has it been delayed? When will you be taking it out?”","She turned to Li Shihong, and when she opened her mouth, she asked unceremoniously.","Li Shihong and the Elders were still touched by Yu Liu Buyan’s understanding just now, but the joy only lasted for a few breaths before they were shattered by what he said next!","People stopped their Junior Sister, not because they understood them, but because...to ask for money!","But Huang Yueli was even more straightforward, and immediately entered the debt collection mode as soon as she opened her mouth.","“This... this... we will definitely pay the consultation fee, but...”","Li Shihong spoke hesitantly, and at the same time, thoughts were spinning rapidly in his mind.","Although the development of the matter was beyond his expectation, at least Liu Buyan and his Junior Sister were now staying!","If you can hold them back with the consultation fees first, and then persuade them slowly, maybe things will turn around..."]},{"number":3787,"title":"Chapter 3787 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (3)","paragraphs":["3787 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (3)","However, before Li Shihong came up with a specific plan, Huang Yueli frowned when she heard the word “but”.","“But? Why is there a ‘but’? Could it be that you have no intention to pay us at all?”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s doubts, Li Shihong quickly denied it, “No, no, that’s not what I meant. Please rest assured, the Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely give you the consultation fees that you deserve, and we will definitely give more. It is absolutely impossible to renege on or default on debts!”","“Is that so...” Huang Yueli pondered, seemingly a little shaken.","!!","Li Shihong hurriedly continued to persuade: “Divine Doctor Li, please sit down first, let’s chat slowly...”","Before he finished speaking, Huang Yueli waved her hand.","“No, I’m not in the mood to chat with you here anymore. Since Patriarch Li said he wouldn’t renege on his debts, then of course I believe you. The dignified Ancient God Clan have a big clan and great treasures. How can they cheat me? So, what about the money? Hurry up and pay the consultation fee, and we will leave as soon as we get the money! It will also save your clansmen from worrying about your Young Master being defiled by me, a Fox Vixen!”","Unexpectedly, after talking about it, Huang Yueli still wanted to leave.","Li Shihong became anxious, tried to persuade her repeatedly, trying to delay the time, but Huang Yueli looked ashamed of being hurt, and just shook her head, insisting that he pay the bill and they would leave immediately.","After a long time, Li Shihong also knew that there was no way to convince her. In desperation, he could only turn to work on Liu Buyan.","However, Liu Buyan seemed to be more talkative than his own Junior Sister, but he went around and refused to give an accurate answer.","When he was at his wit’s end, Li Shihong suddenly felt someone pulling his sleeve from behind.","Looking back, it turned out to be one of the Elders, Li Zhengwei.","“Patriarch, I have an idea. I don’t know if I should say it or not...” He lowered his voice.","Li Shihong hurriedly said: “What’s the idea? Say it quickly! Come anytime, and come here again!”","Li Zhengwei leaned into his ear and said, “Patriarch, according to my subordinates, the more we delay the time, the more the two Divine Doctors will doubt the sincerity of our Cloudy Qilin Clan. It’s better to just give them the consultation fee and forget it...”","“How can that be done?” Li Shihong objected subconsciously, “They must have run away immediately after receiving the consultation fee! Why do they still stay?”","“But other than that, we have no way to prove our sincerity. These two genius doctors seem to be short of money. If we pay more and add a sincere apology, maybe they will pay more for it. Continue to stay... is it better than the current situation? If the two of them had to stay because the consultation fee was deducted, they didn’t leave, but if they didn’t work hard for treatment, it would be useless!”","What Li Zhengwei said hit the point.","Li Shihong was convinced after a little thought.","Seeing that the other Elders were still searching for reasons to persuade the two of them, he coughed heavily and walked over.","“Divine Doctor Liu, Divine Doctor Li, since the two are determined to leave, I can’t stop it anymore. How about this, I will settle the consultation fee for the two of you during this period, even if we previously hired two to treat Moying. This matter will be deemed over. Next, we can talk about how to cooperate in the future. Do the two of you think this will work?”","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes, “Let’s talk about the future, in the future.”"]},{"number":3788,"title":"Chapter 3788 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (4)","paragraphs":["3788 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (4)","She refused to give an exact answer, Li Shihong was a little disappointed.","But he didn’t struggle for long, and he raised his voice to call the guards at the door, and told them to go to the warehouse and bring over the rewards for the two Divine Doctors.","After Li Shihong finished giving instructions, he said to Huang Yueli: “Divine Doctor Li, please sit down! It’s a bit far from the back mountain to the warehouse. These guards are not good enough, and they don’t travel fast. I’m afraid we have to wait for a while.”","In fact, the guards who were sent to run errands were all at the Heart Profound Realm, and their cultivation was not weak.","!!","However, the warehouse was really far away from the back mountain. To cross the entire Amethyst Paramount Palace, even Li Shihong himself would have to go back and forth for nearly an hour.","Huang Yueli also understood this, snorted coldly, and sat down on the seat by the window.","Liu Buyan also sat opposite her.","Seeing this scene, the big stone in Li Shihong’s heart dropped a bit. At least, Li Zhengwei’s suggestion was really useful, and the attitudes of the two obviously showed signs of softening.","However, he didn’t dare to take it lightly. He still hinted at the Elders with his eyes, and hurried up to persuade them.","Under the persevering bombardment of the Elders, Liu Buyan always smiled and nodded from time to time, but when he mentioned the key issues, he immediately shut his mouth.","And Huang Yueli remained calm, didn’t even make a sound, just leisurely sipping some tea by the side.","Even though the two of them were like this, none of these Ancient God ClanElders who used to be high above dared to be dissatisfied with it.","What they didn’t notice was that Huang Yueli covered half of her face with her teacup in her arms, her big watery eyes were always looking at the other side of the room, exchanging glances with Li Moying who had never spoken on the bed .","Liu Buyan actually discovered the tricks of her Junior Sister and her husband.","He twitched the corners of his mouth and cast a gloomy glance at the two of them.","These two people showed their affection, it was really crazy!","What kind of timing and situation was this? They could still express their love !","However, Liu Buyan admired Li Moying a little bit, because now it was obvious that Huang Yueli didn’t really want to leave, but just wanted to take this opportunity to ruthlessly cheat the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","It’s understandable to do this normally, but now, this was the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Huang Yueli actually got stuck, she didn’t have any scruples at all because of her husband’s relationship.","And Li Moying was even better, as the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he doesn’t care about the clan’s wealth and face at all, watching Huang Yueli give an attitude to all the Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, even the Patriarch, around , he seems to be smiling!","If Li Shihong knew that the Young Master whose clan put all their hopes on had turned his elbow outward like this, he would probably cry out there and then!","The two flirted with each other. At first, they were a little reserved, so they only dared to exchange glances secretly.","But very soon, they couldn’t even pry their gazes apart.","Liu Buyan hurriedly coughed a few times, “Cough, cough!”","Huang Yueli bit her lip, still infatuated with her husband! She has a good eye for picking men! Among other things, just this face, this figure! Tsk tsk! Really, simply looking at him a few more times and her mood will be so good that I can eat a few more mouthfuls of rice!","It was suddenly cold, and a coughing sound came from my ear.","She frowned before looking at Liu Buyan, “Senior Brother, what’s wrong with you? Have you caught a cold?”"]},{"number":3789,"title":"Chapter 3789 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (5)","paragraphs":["3789 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (5)","Liu Buyan was speechless for a moment.","As the saying goes, a married Junior Sister was no longer a member of her parents’ household, they were like splashed water which could not be taken back!","The ancients never deceived!","In the eyes of his Junior Sister, Li Moying was the only one she could see, so where was he, her Senior Brother?","Oh, no, she finally remembered to care about whether he had caught the cold, and finally she still had a little bit of conscience, although it was a little less...","“Senior Brother, you are a doctor yourself, yet you still catch a cold so easily? You are too careless, right? Anyway, you have a lot of pills in there, go find one and eat it yourself!” Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she said with an innocent face.","When Liu Buyan heard it, he almost vomited blood!","He stretched out a finger and pointed at Huang Yueli, but he couldn’t speak, the finger was still shaking.","“You...you...I...”","Was he still her Senior Brother?!","Huang Yueli looked at his grief-stricken expression, and the corners of her mouth couldn’t help but hook upwards.","Of course she knew what Liu Buyan wanted to say, but she was just teasing him on purpose.","Speaking of which, her Senior Brother has been alone for too long so it’s alright to be abused by them all the time. It’s time to find a beautiful sister-in-law for her Senior Brother.","Huang Yueli was thinking about it when she suddenly heard the sound of chaotic footsteps outside, and then, the guards who were sent to move things just now appeared in front of everyone again.","They came in from the door in groups of two, carrying boxes one by one.","Walking to the open space in the middle of the room, they put down the boxes, and then stepped back respectfully.","Li Shihong ordered: “Open the box and ask the two Divine Doctors to check it in person.”","“Yes, Patriarch!”","The guards opened the box, and as the lid was lifted upwards, a golden light shot out from the box.","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up immediately!","The appearance of such a vision just shows that what was stored in the box was an extraordinary treasure!","It seems that their strategy today has worked. In order to keep the two of them, the Cloudy Qilin Clan has spent a lot of money this time!","The two stood up, walked to the front of the box and looked inside.","“Two Divine Doctors, please look here. This is the reward that our clan promised during the pill competition, a bottle of Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew!” Li Shihong walked behind the two of them and introduced them to them.","The first box contained a bottle of light blue liquid. Even through the body of the bottle made of crystal, one could feel the powerful energy emanating from the bottle. The liquid shone brightly in the sunlight. A crystal-clear lustre which was radiant looked very beautiful.","After hearing Li Shihong’s words, Huang Yueli suddenly realized, “So this is Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew!”","Li Shihong nodded, “Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew can improve the refining efficiency of elixirs above the saint level. It was a good thing that all Spirit Medicine Masters want to get. This bottle that our Cloudy Qilin Clan treasures was even more rare among them! It was refining god-level pills, which can increase the success rate by at least 20%!”","After hearing the words, Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan quickly exchanged an incredulous glance.","Increase the success rate of god-level pills by 20%!","This effect can be said to be shocking! Unbelievable!","Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew was not refined, but a pure natural treasure.","Such top-quality Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew can’t be produced in the entire God Realm for hundreds of thousands of years, but Li Shihong actually took out a bottle."]},{"number":3790,"title":"Chapter 3790 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (6)","paragraphs":["3790 Can’t Do A Business At A Loss (6)","Huang Yueli had reason to believe that what Li Shihong planned to give as a reward in the Pill Competition at the beginning was absolutely impossible to be such a rare top quality bottle, but just a bottle of inferior Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew.","Because this itself was extremely rare, even if it was only low-grade, it was a priceless treasure.","In the major auction houses in the God Realm, once they appear, they will be looted by Spirit Medicine Masters from various powerful forces.","As a reward for such a Pill Competition, low-ranked ones were enough.","But now, Li Shihong took the initiative to replace Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew with the best...","This sincerity was quite enough!","Seeing this Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew, Liu Buyan’s complexion immediately improved a lot.","Next, Li Shihong took the two of them to look through the contents of the other five boxes, and introduced the purpose of these items to them one by one.","Huang Yueli was not a proper Spirit Medicine Master, so she has never even heard of many natural treasures in it, but just by looking at Liu Buyan’s expression, she can tell that the things in the five boxes behind were comparable with that bottle of top-quality Heaven’s Origin Immortal Dew! The value of these made her eyes sparkle yet she also let out a soft sigh. The real power in the God Realm has a profound foundation beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","Liu Buyan listened very carefully, and only after he finished viewing the contents of the box did he raise his head, look at Huang Yueli, and cast a questioning gaze at her.","Huang Yueli knew that this was her Senior Brother asking what to do next.","She thought for a while and said, “Patriarch Li, everyone here are all understanding people, so I won’t say polite words. Your treasures are too precious. Compared with the consultation fee we agreed at the beginning, the value is much higher and I’m afraid it’s more than ten times! Although we rely on our skills for a living, we are really ashamed of receiving so many treasures!”","Upon hearing this, Li Shihong almost blurted out: If you feel that you deserve it, then stay and continue treating Moying!","Fortunately, Li Zhengwei pulled him from behind again.","Li Shihong suddenly came to his senses, and changed his words: “Two esteemed Divine Doctors, you are too polite! Moying’s life itself is a priceless treasure to our Cloudy Qilin Clan! Don’t say it’s just these medicinal materials, even if it exhausts the entire clan’s resources, we want to save him too! Since two esteemed Divine Doctors saved Moying, to our clan, the kindness is as great as a mountain. Now these can only be called small gifts, please accept them.”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, but she didn’t expect that Li Shihong became so good now!","He didn’t mention that he wanted them to stay, but only said how much he thanked them.","In this way, even a thick-skinned money fan like her would feel embarrassed to continue blackmailing him.","She coughed twice, and said, “Since that’s the case, I’m not being hypocritical. These things are indeed of great use to us, so we’ll accept them!”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s words, Liu Buyan’s eyes lit up immediately.","Li Shihong nodded, and he hastily put away his things.","What Li Shihong gave them were medicinal materials and auxiliary supplies for alchemy, and they were of no use to Huang Yueli. This time, it can be said that they were all cheaper for him!","Liu Buyan’s interspatial ring was made by Huang Yueli herself. It was much larger than ordinary interspatial rings, and it was also very convenient to use.","He just waved his hand lightly, and several huge boxes were taken in."]},{"number":3791,"title":"Chapter 3791 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(1)","paragraphs":["3791 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(1)","The Elders couldn’t help but feel their heart ache after seeing so many priceless treasures that they’ve been keeping carefully for many years disappearing from their sight in the blink of an eye.","Liu Buyan had thick skin to begin with, so after putting away his things, he cupped his hands very naturally.","“During this period of time, I would like to thank everyone of the Cloudy Qilin Clan for their care. Although some unpleasant things happened during this period, my Junior Sister and I will not care about it for the sake of the generous consultation fee. Since we have already received the consultation fee, well then we shouldn’t tarry here and we’ll just leave!”","With that said, he stood up, turned around and was about to leave.","Huang Yueli shook her head secretly.","Her Senior Brother really is! He was so rude to the patron! She wasn’t afraid to really piss off Li Moying and settle accounts with him afterwards.","Having said that, she still stood up, followed behind Liu Buyan, and walked out.","When Li Shihong saw it, he immediately became anxious and rushed to the door of the room, just blocking the path of the two of them.","In terms of cultivation, Li Shihong was more than a little bit higher than the two of them. If he really wanted to stop them, Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan couldn’t avoid it.","The two of them could only stop.","Liu Buyan frowned, “Patriarch Li, what do you mean by this? Didn’t you say it just now? After the medical fee’s been settled, we can leave freely. Yet you still stop us, could it be that you regret taking out so many treasures?”","When Li Shihong heard this, he also realized that his behaviour was a bit inappropriate, which could easily cause misunderstandings.","However, he can’t take care of other things now, the most important thing was to keep them!","He signalled the guards to come around with his eyes and blocked the door, then turned around and explained: “Divine Doctor Liu, please don’t get me wrong. The treasures of heaven and earth just now are all to thank you two for Moying’s treatment. We, the Cloudy Qilin Clan, are not so petty, we won’t snatch back things that we’ve given away. ”","“Then what are you up to?” Liu Buyan still looked very guarded.","Li Shihong hurriedly said: “You two, don’t leave in a hurry, we can talk about a new deal!”","“New deal? Patriarch Li means...” Huang Yueli blinked, looking thoughtful.","Her flamboyant acting skills attracted Liu Buyan’s constant attention.","This little girl almost couldn’t hold back her laughter just now, but now she puts on such an innocent expression, she really thinks that everyone in the Cloudy Qilin Clan was blind!","However, Li Shihong and the Elders were so anxious at this moment, no one paid attention to Huang Yueli’s small movements at all, and it was not much different from being blind.","They focused on convincing the two of them, “Divine Doctor Liu and Divine Doctor Li, on behalf of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, please stay and be responsible for the next stage of Moying’s treatment. Although Moying has woken up, his body is still unable to move freely. Afterall, he has been in a coma for so long, his meridians have also been damaged to a certain extent, and he needs a long period of recuperation. The two of you can’t just leave so quickly!”","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows when she heard the words, and said: “Patriarch Li’s words are wrong, Young Master Li really needs to take care of himself, but it doesn’t have to be my Senior Brother and I. He is now awake, and most of the poisonous gas in his body has been detoxified, as long as the doctor who comes later prescribes a few more symptomatic nourishing prescriptions, it will be cured. At most, the recovery time will be a little longer.”"]},{"number":3792,"title":"Chapter 3792 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(2)","paragraphs":["3792 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(2)","These words of Huang Yueli were actually the truth.","She had already handed the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” to Li Moying.","With Li Moying’s talent, in fact, he can continue to practice without her watching from the sidelines.","As long as those evil qi can be controlled, other injuries to the body and meridians can only be regarded as minor injuries, which can be cured by better doctors.","!!","However, the more Huang Yueli told the truth, the less Li Shihong and others believed it!","How could his condition be as light as she had described?","They had invited so many doctors to see Li Moying before, none of them could think of a way to do it. Finally, the two of them stepped forward and rescued him. It was only a day after he woke up. What other doctors can be better than them?","How could there be such an outrageous thing in the world!","It must be that Divine Doctor Li was still angry about Li Leyun’s slander on her, and deliberately said this to evade.","Everyone agreed that what Huang Yueli said was definitely not the truth.","Not only was it not the truth, but she was also very angry, so angry that she was still sarcastic.","Thinking of this, Li Shihong immediately changed his face, and said: “Divine Doctor Li, I know that I punished Li Leyun too lightly, that’s why I made you feel uneasy. This was my fault, because Leyun is my niece... Well, anyway, I will give you a satisfactory explanation this time.”","As he said that, he turned his head and told the guards beside him, “Go and catch Li Leyun to the punishment hall, and lock her up first. At dawn tomorrow, send her to the quarry in Adamantine Ocean City to mine!”","After Li Shihong finished speaking, he paused, and looked at Huang Yueli, “Divine Doctor Li, do you think this is alright? If you have any other requests, or if you think the punishment is too light, just say it and I will definitely let you be satisfied!”","Huang Yueli let out a “huh”. In fact, she didn’t know what a great punishment it was to go to the quarry to mine.","However, she raised her head and looked at Li Moying, and when she saw him nodding slightly, she nodded and said, “No need, Young Miss Li is the proud daughter of the Cloudy Qilin Clan after all, and I don’t want to make it too ugly. Patriarch Li is very sincere this time and this matter will be settled!”","Since her husband thinks that such punishment was enough, it seems that the quarry must be a very dangerous place.","When Li Leyun gets there, she will peel off a layer of her skin even if she doesn’t die!","It’s also impossible for her to really let Li Shihong kill his own niece. This was unrealistic, so it’s enough to have such a result.","After hearing Huang Yueli’s reply, everyone heaved a sigh of relief.","If the brothers and sisters are still not satisfied, they really don’t know what to do!","Although Li Leyun’s life was nothing compared to Li Moying, she was also an important genius in the clan, and for the sake of the clan’s face, it was impossible for her to die.","Li Shihong struck while the iron was hot, and immediately said: “Since Divine Doctor Li doesn’t care about those trivial things anymore, can you please stay and continue to see Moying? Don’t worry, we will also calculate the consultation fee this time. There will absolutely not be one cent less!”","“This...” Huang Yueli showed hesitation.","Li Shihong wanted to persuade her again, but a voice rang out first.","“Divine Doctor Li, please stay here, I only believe in your medical skills.”","It was Li Moying who was lying on the bed who finally spoke."]},{"number":3793,"title":"Chapter 3793 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You? (3)","paragraphs":["3793 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You? (3)","From the beginning to the end, he did not intervene at all.","Although it was his clan that Huang Yueli had dug a hole for them to fall into, in his opinion, all of this was perfectly normal.","It was because of the inaction of Li Shihong and others that his Little Fox had been insulted so much. If it weren’t for the fact that they were his clansmen and had helped him a lot in the past two years, Li Moying would have gone ballistic already.","Now, just because he can bear it, doesn’t mean his Little Fox needs to endure it.","He wanted to let her vent her anger and he would just pass the knife by the side to make things easier for her.","Now, after the Little Fox’s anger has been vented, it’s his turn to appear.","Hearing Li Moying’s sudden interruption, everyone in the room was a little surprised, and turned their heads to look at him in unison.","Just now, they were too busy trying to keep Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli to stay, but they had already forgotten that their Young Master was still lying behind the screen.","Li Moying didn’t pay attention to other people at all, his eyes focused on Huang Yueli’s delicate and charming face, as she looked back at him with a pair of soft big eyes.","Although Huang Yueli was disguised and she looked different from herself, but those eyes were still the same, making Li Moying deeply immersed.","Being stared at by her husband like this, Huang Yueli’s cheeks couldn’t help but feel hot.","Seeing that the two of them were staring at each other without speaking, Liu Buyan suddenly felt his throat itchy and couldn’t help but start coughing heavily.","“Cough cough, Young Master Li, what advice do you have?”","Li Moying’s eye contact with her own Little Fox was interrupted, and she glanced at Liu Buyan in displeasure, before she raised her voice and said, “Two Divine Doctors, I can assure you that what Li Leyun did today will not happen again. I am different from the Patriarch. I will not give face to anyone in the clan. If you trust me, you will continue to stay. As for the consultation fee... In addition to the payment, I will give you a promise and you can ask for anything!”","Hearing Li Moying’s words, Li Shihong and the Elders looked a little embarrassed.","From Li Moying’s words, it seems that they only cared about their own favours and did not manage their clansmen well, which was why Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli were insulted.","However, what Li Moying said was the truth, and they had no way to refute it.","Moreover, no one dared to refute Li Moying at this moment.","Everyone looked at Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan expectantly, hoping that they would believe Li Moying’s words and stay.","However, neither of them spoke.","Liu Buyan looked very cold on the surface, but in fact, he wanted to talk but couldn’t.","Li Moying has already spoken, and this has become a matter between them young husband and wife, and there was no room for him as a senior to intervene.","And Huang Yueli looked Li Moying up and down for a while, her eyes shifted, as if she was thinking about something.","Everyone didn’t even dare to take a breath. After waiting for a long time, they heard her say: “Young Master Li, what good things can you give us as our consultation fee? What you gave out personally, can it be better than what you get in the clan’s warehouse?”","Li Moying said in a deep voice: “It may not be better, but no matter what you want, I can satisfy your request.”","When Huang Yueli heard the words, the corners of her mouth curled up, her face was stained with a smile, adding a bit more charm than usual.","For a moment, everyone in the room was a little dumbfounded.","“What if... I want you, Young Master Li?”"]},{"number":3794,"title":"Chapter 3794 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(4)","paragraphs":["3794 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(4)","“Me?”","Li Moying raised his eyebrows, but there was not much surprise on his face, but a bit of interest in his eyes.","“What Divine Doctor Li means that you want ..me to repay this myself by dedicating his life to you?”","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, revealing two pointed canine teeth, “What if I say yes? What does Young Master Li plan to do?”","Hearing this, all the Elders present gasped in unison!","No one knows better than them how much Li Moying hates those women who can’t move their legs when they see him! Li Moying would be displeased even if a woman looked at him a few more times, not to mention that this Divine Doctor Li openly teased him!","When Li Moying gets angry, maybe he might even beat the doctor who treated him!","Divine Doctor Li was such a delicate little beauty with a low level of cultivation, how can she stand up to his anger?","Li Shihong hurriedly shouted: “Divine Doctor Li, stop talking, come to me quickly...”","While he was speaking to stop him, he wanted to save people.","But who knows, instead of leaning towards him as promised, Huang Yueli took a few steps forward and slowly walked towards Li Moying’s bedside.","Moreover, for some reason, Li Shihong’s speed was obviously much faster than her, but he failed to stop her, but passed her by.","After this miss, Huang Yueli had already walked to the side of the big bed.","Li Moying half leaned against the head of the bed, a little lower than her, allowing Huang Yueli to look down at the sickly handsome man lying on the bed.","“Young Master Li, how are you thinking? My request...can you do it?”","Hearing that Huang Yueli didn’t know how to repent, was still dying here, and even dared to send her home to be tortured by Li Moying, everyone couldn’t bear to watch, and closed their eyes one after another.","But who knew, they stood there with their eyes closed for a long while, but the scream they imagined did not come from their ears.","Just when everyone was puzzled, Li Moying’s voice sounded again, “If Young Miss Li has such a request, I am naturally willing to oblige. However, I am currently unable to move, and I am afraid it will take a while before I can repay you. I don’t know if Young Miss Li, can wait for a while?”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips slightly, looking dissatisfied, “Wait? How long?”","“It depends on the progress of the two Divine Doctors’ treatment.” Li Moying said.","After hearing this, Huang Yueli seemed to think of something, “That makes sense, but if I cure you and you renege on your debt, what should I do?”","A smile flashed across Li Moying’s eyes, “If Young Miss Li is worried, it’s alright to charge some interest first.”","Li Moying’s voice gradually became deep, and his peach blossom eyes were full of charm.","His gaze slowly moved down from Huang Yueli’s big bright eyes, all the way to her delicate lips, and he couldn’t stop thinking about it.","The Little Fox of his arrogantly negotiating conditions with him was so cute. If it was different from usual, he couldn’t help but want to hug someone and kiss her.","It’s just a pity that he can’t move by himself now.","So, he had no choice but to lure his Little Fox to the door in such a manner.","As expected, Huang Yueli was mesmerised and in a daze. Facing such a handsome man, she subconsciously took another step forward.","“You... what are you talking about? Moying, why can’t I understand what you’re saying?”","Li Shihong’s voice came from behind.","Huang Yueli’s body froze immediately."]},{"number":3795,"title":"Chapter 3795 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(5)","paragraphs":["3795 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(5)","This man was simply poisonous!","If she hadn’t been determined, she would have been seduced and kissed just now.","Some people have peach blossom luck in their lives. Even if they don’t do anything, they can attract countless women to fly into the flames, let alone him who takes the initiative to seduce.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but glared at Li Moying fiercely. This man... clearly did it on purpose!","Li Moying was stared at with an innocent expression on his face.","It was obvious that the Little Fox was the one who teased him first, why was he so cooperative and still got stared at?","However, seeing that his wife’s eyes were bursting with fire, he quickly put it away and turned his attention to Li Shihong who was behind Huang Yueli.","“Patriarch, we are talking about the price of asking two divine doctors to treat me! The two of them have saved my life. If I don’t personally repay a little bit, I will feel really sorry.”","Li Shihong was a little uneasy when he saw that the two were talking more and more wrong, and he felt relieved after hearing this, but he was still a little puzzled, “Moying, what’s going on with this promise of yours using yourself as repayment?”","Before Li Moying could speak, Huang Yueli had already burst out laughing.","“Patriarch Li, you are thinking too much. I was just joking with Young Master Li. Although Young Master Li is indeed a good-looking talent, there are too many people who like him. I am not that kind of person. As a woman who has to work among the people, my future husband will have to follow me to wander around to treat people! Patriarch Li said so, but it hurts my boudoir reputation. If my future husband finds out, he will definitely be angry.”","It was only then that Li Shihong came to his senses. After thinking about it again, he felt that he was thinking too much.","It must have been somewhat affected by Li Leyun’s slander against the two of them.","Obviously Young Miss Li and her Senior Brother were already a couple. The two are childhood sweethearts, and they practice medicine together everywhere.","It’s not those daughters of the Ancient God Clan who only value the talent and strength of men.","Thinking of this, Li Shihong was a little ashamed, and said with a little embarrassment: “I’m really sorry, Divine Doctor Li, I didn’t think so much... Yes, I didn’t pay attention to what I said, please don’t worry about it.”","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, and said: “I also know that what you said was unintentional, but you can’t talk nonsense, I will need to get married in the future!”","Li Shihong hurriedly nodded in agreement.","Since Huang Yueli really didn’t have such feelings towards Li Moying, what he said just now was very inappropriate. Although he didn’t mean to accuse Huang Yueli, he just asked questions, but even asking questions would affect Huang Yueli’s feelings. Yueli’s reputation.","Although there are not as many rules for women in the God Realm as in the Lower Realm, they are not without scruples.","With such a guilty heart, Li Shihong also missed the eye contact between Huang Yueli and Li Moying again.","Li Moying was in a bad mood when he heard Huang Yueli disregard her relationship with her, but he couldn’t come out to swear sovereignty, and even his complexion became a little ugly.","Liu Buyan saw it, and said gloatingly, “Huh? Why does Young Master Li look a little sour? Could it be that the residual poison in your body has flared up again? Or was it because someone misunderstood my relationship with my Junior Sister just now? Such a thing, if there isn’t any then there isn’t so one can’t really utter nonsense!”"]},{"number":3796,"title":"Chapter 3796 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(6)","paragraphs":["3796 Want Li Moying to Devote His Life To You?(6)","The moment Li Moying heard his words, his expression turned darker immediately.","The fact that he couldn’t publicly announce that he was Little Fox’s man already made him gnash his teeth in anger, yet Liu Buyan kept emphasizing it!","Their eight characters really clashed, that’s why they could never get along!","He suddenly coughed heavily, “Actually, this is not entirely a misunderstanding...”","Upon hearing this, everyone was shocked and looked at Li Moying one after another.","Li Moying said slowly: “After all, when Divine Doctor Li treated me earlier, she had already seen all of me. Speaking of which, it really has an impact on Young Miss Li’s boudoir reputation. I’m sorry, otherwise, I will be responsible...”","“No no no...”","Before Li Moying finished speaking, Huang Yueli shook her head hastily.","She laughed dryly and said, “Young Master Li really doesn’t need to take these things to heart. To us doctors, anyone’s body is no different from a stone on the side of the road. In order to cure diseases and save lives, it’s alright to take a look at it. My future husband can also understand. So, you don’t have to care about it at all, and you don’t have to be responsible for anything!”","He had to be kidding! The Ancient God Clan like the Cloudy Qilin Clan have many factions in the clan, and every faction wants to give their daughter to Li Moying. Even if they can’t be the main wife, being a concubine was enough.","One can imagine how much trouble she would get into if her relationship with Li Moying was discovered!","Although she was not afraid of provocations from these forces, she does not intend to waste time on such things right now. For her, the most important thing now was to cure Li Moying, and then participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. In addition, the Sacred Phoenix Clan still has a lot of messy things waiting for her to go back to deal with.","Right now, it’s really not a good time to divulge her relationship with Li Moying.","Li Moying was naturally very clear about what his Little Fox was thinking, but hearing what Huang Yueli said, he was still furious.","Staring at Huang Yueli, it seemed as if she was going to eat her in one bite!","His body looks no different from the stones on the side of the road?","This Little Fox can really talk nonsense so blatently!","Has she ever seen such a handsome stone?","Li Moying’s expression was extremely dark, but Li Shihong and others completely misunderstood it. Seeing his ugly face, they thought his body was failing again.","“Divine Doctor Li, Divine Doctor Liu, Young Master, is there something wrong with him now? Please, you two, you can’t just ignore death!”","“Yes, no matter what conditions the two of you have, we can agree to it, please be sure to stay...”","Huang Yueli looked back and she winked at Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan understood, turned around and said to Li Shihong: “Patriarch Li, we stayed this time purely for the sake of you and Young Master Li. It’s easy to talk about medical fees, but I don’t want anyone to treat my Junior Sister so disrespectfully anymore...”","“Don’t worry, the two Divine Doctors, there will never be such a thing again!”","Liu Buyan nodded, “Alright, then we’ll send the Buddha to the west and stay here for a few more days...”","“A few days are not enough. Divine Doctor Li please stay till after the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over. I’m worried that if something goes wrong, if it affects my performance in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, it will be troublesome...”","Li Moying interrupted Liu Buyan’s words, his peach blossom eyes gleamed with a charming light, and he stared at the girl in front of him gently and intently.","Liu Buyan became depressed again.","Damn, only Divine Doctor Li was invited to stay!"]},{"number":3797,"title":"Chapter 3797 Candidate For Fiancée (1)","paragraphs":["3797 Candidate For Fiancée (1)","Was there a mistake?","He was the real Divine Doctor, his Junior Sister was just here to see her husband!","Li Moying really perfectly executed the saying of what it means to forget friends after meeting the opposite sex!","Moreover, he said this in front of Li Shihong and the others, wasn’t he afraid to arouse the suspicion of others?","!!","Liu Buyan looked around subconsciously, only to realize that Li Shihong and the others didn’t seem to notice anything wrong with Li Moying’s words at all as everyone was caught by the God Realm’s Grand Meet mentioned by Li Moying just now.","“Yes, in less than a month, it will be the God Realm’s Grand Meet!”","“If the Young Master really wants to participate, there really isn’t much time left for recuperation!”","“I see the Young Master’s current situation, it’s too much to try to participate in the Grand Meet! It’s better not to be brave. Anyway, the future will be long...”","“That’s what I mean too, but the Young Master insists on going to the Grand Meet? If that’s the case, then I can rest assured that only the two Divine Doctors stay here.”","“That’s right. Other people’s medical skills are far behind these two. We can’t take this risk.”","Several people chattered in unison, which further strengthened their determination to keep the two Divine Doctors at all cost.","While they were fervently discussing this matter, Huang Yueli coughed softly, “Elders, I’m sorry to interrupt you, but the visiting time is only half an hour but now, it’s been an hour and a half, Young Master Li should have rested long ago... ...”","When everyone heard this, they suddenly came back to their senses.","Only then did they realize that they had stayed in this room for too long!","Seeing that Li Moying’s face was getting more and more gloomy, and he looked weak, even if the Elders had thousands of words to say, they didn’t dare to say it at this time.","Everyone looked at each other and left the room one after another.","Li Shihong was the last one to leave. He looked at Li Moying who was lying on the bed, and sighed slightly, “Moying, rest well. Don’t worry about the God Realm’s Grand Meet and the Sacred Phoenix Clan, as long as you can recover from your illness Well, everything else can take your time, understand?”","Li Moying nodded, and said in a cold voice: “Thank you, Patriarch, for your concern, but I care about my affairs.”","Li Shihong knew that he was a very strong-willed person, and it was impossible to persuade him, so he turned around and left without saying anything.","In the courtyard outside the room, several Elders hadn’t left yet, they were forming a small circle, discussing something in a low voice.","When Li Shihong saw it, he quickly walked towards them.","“Few Elders, why don’t you go back to rest? Moying’s side is fine, and there are two Divine Doctors here, so you can rest assured.”","Li Zhengwei turned his head, looked at the closed door again, frowned slightly, and said thoughtfully: “Patriarch, what do you think... how about Young Miss Li?”","Li Shihong was taken aback, “Young Miss Li? You mean Divine Doctor Li?”","Li Zhengwei nodded.","Li Shihong said in bewilderment: ” Divine Doctor Li...has superb medical skills and was decisive in her actions. Although she was a bit forceful, people with skills have tempers, so that’s nothing.”","Li Zhengwei shook his head and said: “I don’t mean that, I just want to ask...” He paused, and then continued: “I want to ask, the Patriarch has been worrying about the candidate for the young lady, have you ever thought about looking for a doctor for the Young Master to be his wife?”"]},{"number":3798,"title":"Chapter 3798 Candidate For Fiancée (2)","paragraphs":["3798 Candidate For Fiancée (2)","Li Shihong was obviously taken aback for a moment, not expecting that Li Zhengwei would say such a thing.","After a while, he frowned and said, “Elder Wei, do you think...there is something wrong with Divine Doctor Li and Moying? It’s wrong for you to think that way. Doctors save patients and have some physical contact with patients. It’s a common thing. You can’t say that again!”","Li Zhengwei shook his head and said, “Patriarch, you have misunderstood me! I just saw Divine Doctor Li treating the Young Master’s illness, and suddenly thought that we had been thinking about finding a talented woman for the Young Master as his wife, but in fact, the Young Master may not need it, but a female doctor may be more suitable.”","Li Shihong was even more surprised. He frowned and said, “What does Elder Wei mean?”","!!","Li Zhengwei said: “Young Master’s pure blood and powerful talent have far surpassed all the members of the clan. The descendants of the Ancient God Clan all inherit the talent of the stronger parent. What kind of wife to find for the Young Master, in fact, does not have a great impact on his blood inheritance. But the female doctor is different...”","“If the Young Master wants to make a breakthrough, he will have to go through a lot of experience and face many dangers in the future. Injuries are unavoidable, and situations like this time will definitely happen often. Where can you find a real Divine Doctor without arrogance? Even if they are willing to help with the treatment, we have to do our best to support it, and we have to spend a huge amount of money for the consultation. They may not be willing to help. But if the Young Master’s wife was a Divine Doctor, it would be much more convenient. This will definitely make people feel better. The Young Master was like a tiger with wings added!”","What Li Zhengwei said was very sincere.","Hearing this, the Elders present were all stunned.","They never considered this possibility before. Only cultivators with similar talents can match each other. This has been a tradition in the God Realm for millions of years, and everyone subconsciously follows this rule.","But now, when Li Zhengwei said this, when everyone thought about it from this perspective, they felt that this really made sense!","For a peerless genius like Li Moying who leaves his peers far behind, it was almost impossible to find a woman with the same talent as him who can fight side by side. Even Li Leyun, the most talented lady in the clan, was weak compared to Li Moying.","Since no one can stand shoulder to shoulder with him, it’s better to find a good wife who can make up for his shortcomings and help him in other aspects...","When Li Shihong thought of this, the face of that Divine Doctor Li in the room just now appeared in front of his eyes.","That girl was really beautiful, even compared with Li Leyun, a well-known beauty in the God Realm, she was not inferior, and she has amazing medical skills at a young age, and more importantly, she acts steadily and decisively, quite With everyone’s demeanor, even a wealthy daughter like Li Leyun was compared to a waste in front of her!","If Li Moying had such a wife...","Just as Li Shihong had some thoughts, he saw someone among the Elders stand up and angrily said to Li Zhengwei: “Elder Wei, what do you mean by that? You are trying to destroy our Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Li Zhengwei frowned, and before he had time to speak, the man said excitedly: “Our Cloudy Qilin Clan is a noble Ancient God Clan. Which Patriarch’s wife was not from the direct line of the god clan, right?”"]},{"number":3799,"title":"Chapter 3799 Candidate For Fiancée (3)","paragraphs":["3799 Candidate For Fiancée (3)","“Furthermore, the wife of a strong man must also be strong! Only those with outstanding talents can match well. That is also the marriage tradition of our ancient gods! How can a tradition of millions of years be changed at will? If it’s changed so flippantly, I don’t know how much outsiders would laugh at us!”","“Young Master is one of the most outstanding geniuses in the history of our entire Cloudy Qilin Clan. He is the hope of the future of our clan. If you find him a woman with average talent, he will become the laughing stock of the entire God Realm! The face of the clan would also be lost! I will never agree to such a thing!”","Li Zhengwei obviously did not expect that his casual proposal would encounter such fierce opposition from his colleagues.","However, he was not frightened by the other party’s menacing appearance, and continued to explain: “Elder Yu, what you said was biased. Tradition is tradition, but you have to adapt it according to the actual situation? With our Young Master’s natural strength and talent, no matter what kind of wife he marries, who would dare to underestimate him? Besides, I’m just raising a possibility, and it doesn’t mean that the Young Master can only marry a female doctor?”","!!","“Anyway, don’t even think about what you said! The Young Master’s wife can only be the proud daughter of the Ancient God Clan. It’s best to choose one from the clan!”","“That’s right. Although women from other ancient god races are fine, they are not as reliable as the women in our clan. The Young Master bears the future of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan on his shoulders. The one who is by his side must be reliable, and there must be no mistakes!”","“Although Young Miss Leyun’s marriage contract with the Young Master will most likely not come to fruition, there are still so many talented women in the clan, so I will definitely find someone who is worthy of the Young Master!”","Although the other Elders were not as excited as Elder Yu who refuted at the beginning, they all spoke up one after another, expressing their disapproval.","Li Zhengwei also reacted after hearing so many people talking.","In fact, this matter has nothing to do with whether his proposal was correct or not, and it has nothing to do with the marriage tradition of the ancient gods.","What really matters was the interests of the various branches of the clan!","Li Moying ascended from the lower realm, and the relationship with any branch of the clan was actually very far away. The only way to get closer to him was to marry.","Originally, Li Leyun was able to win among the many proud girls of heaven. Apart from her highest talent, she also relied on her hardest backing. She was the most outstanding woman in the Patriarch’s team.","But now, Li Leyun has repeatedly committed crimes. Although the clan has not explicitly kicked her out of Li Moying’s fiancée candidates, everyone must think that she was no longer favoured.","All the Elders who had been eyeing the Young Madam’s throne were all gearing up to send their daughters to the Young Master’s side.","Li Zhengwei himself practiced the pure way. He never married a wife in his life, and naturally he had no children. He was the only one among all the Elders, so he didn’t think so much at first.","However, he wasn’t really stupid. Now that he understood, he immediately shut up.","He was the only one in the clan who was neutral. He has never participated in this kind of factional struggle. At this time, he also knows that what he said touched the interests of everyone.","Li Shihong understood it earlier than him.","When Elder Yu jumped out at the very beginning, he knew where the problem was.","Although he also felt that what Li Zhengwei said made some sense, he could only suppress his true thoughts."]},{"number":3800,"title":"Chapter 3800 Candidate For Fiancée (4)","paragraphs":["3800 Candidate For Fiancée (4)","“Everyone, Elders, please don’t get excited, listen to me...Elder Wei, he also did it for the sake of the clan! Although this proposal is indeed against the clan tradition and inappropriate, but after all, he had a good intention. Please rest assured, Moying’s fiancée will definitely be selected from the noble daughters of the Ancient God Clans!”","For Li Shihong, the Patriarch, balancing the relationship between the various branches of the clan was his most important duty.","So, he immediately spoke to appease the excited Elders.","At the same time, he did not forget to say a few good words for Li Zhengwei, and comforted everyone in every possible way.","!!","After the Elders took this reassurance, their attitude softened significantly. When facing Li Zhengwei, they were not so harsh.","But there were still some people who were not at ease.","Li Yuntao said: “Patriarch, let’s just decide directly. The Young Master’s wife will be selected from the clan’s heaven geniuses, and there is no need to consider other women from other Ancient God Clans. The female younger generation in our clan can be said to be flourishing, before the Young Master came to Amethyst Paramount Palace, most of the heaven geniuses in the clan are women, and there are quite a few beauties among them, enough for the Young Master to choose.”","“That’s right, that’s exactly what it should be!”","“In the past, the Patriarch of the clan married other clan’s women because there was no suitable candidate in the clan. This time, there are so many women of the right age in the clan, so there is no need to ask for help everywhere!”","As soon as Li Yuntao’s words came out of his mouth, everyone immediately responded with unanimous voices.","Because, what he said was exactly what other people wanted to say the most.","If all the girls from other ancient god races could be excluded from the candidates, then the girls from their own branch would have a much higher chance of winning.","Everyone looked at Li Shihong eagerly.","But this time, Li Shihong didn’t respond right away, but thought for a while, then frowned and said: “I also hope that Moying’s wife comes from the daughter of our clan, but you also know Moying’s character, what he doesn’t want to do, no one can force him to do it. If he doesn’t like these women in the clan, then he will definitely have to go to other God Clans to find suitable candidates, so I can’t guarantee you this.”","Elder Yu immediately said: “So, as long as whose daughter can get the Young Master to agree to marry her, the clan will agree?”","Li Shihong nodded slowly.","When everyone heard this, they became a little excited.","If it was said that Li Moying’s fiancée was only chosen based on her cultivation and talent, then except for Li Zijun who can compete with Li Leyun, everyone else was basically useless.","However, from Li Shihong’s point of view, the most important condition was that “the Young Master Likes it”, so there was a lot of room to play in it.","Although the female talent in their branch was not good enough, maybe she might just have caught the eyes of the Young Master?","Li Shihong was a shrewd person. Seeing everyone’s expressions, he guessed their thoughts completely.","He immediately said: “Everyone, no matter what you are going to do, you must remember Moying’s character. He has always been stern and not friendly with women. Even my Leyun had been mercilessly treated by him. So you better be careful.”","The Elders didn’t like to hear these words, and the smile froze on their faces for a while.","However, they all had to admit that what Li Shihong said was absolutely right!"]}]);
